<urn:mukthiguru:Abundance%20Consciousness> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Abundance Consciousness is a state of mind essential for creating enduring wealth and financial abundance, and it also attracts prosperity. It is a mental state that enables individuals to contribute back to the world, perform actions with passion, and experience synchronicities and magic.

The concept is linked to spiritual evolution and is awakened through spiritual science. It is characterized by ease, synchronicities, and magic, and it contrasts with misfortune consciousness.

By fostering a mindset of abundance, it leads to positive actions and a sense of ease, and it is considered a prerequisite for creating wealth and contributing to the world.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779423459"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-2baff9ff7ae96c7443216aa06ccb2687<SEP>chunk-862528746f60f5678c41b67748425947<SEP>chunk-3cf67bb7dd92ee291f3034c55c2bac9c<SEP>chunk-cc573a1ed7984ac5ddefcc442d2f95bf<SEP>chunk-9146e187edbee9cdbc50b048c433c6f9<SEP>chunk-3e00aec0d824214dc3b1bf504e305af0<SEP>chunk-407afcc34149e3cdc533c3a522a0ac53<SEP>chunk-8de47a5ff0c1ad110a1c99957f390ebf<SEP>chunk-ff51aa4461148b2b87ba9c4aa3794e5c";
