<urn:mukthiguru:Abundance%20Festival> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "event";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Abundance Festival";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-76149e88e75ab43aa17ddf5959e26b51<SEP>chunk-d60ea4c3ef338ea56e51d8095d8b3e7f<SEP>chunk-b3e66eb1842ee5e41bdfa8b1037a7c51<SEP>chunk-ac12dffa6ce039201a2a2ead8652a28d<SEP>chunk-d1c28363f61d0804fe0da48af4c11dd4<SEP>chunk-ac6391e06ee1d9f0eaf83699fa502ac7<SEP>chunk-c5f3bfe2a8c8ea1bf2d9597c128a1514<SEP>chunk-883157a96b051a9c01b5808f02cc4271<SEP>chunk-8ff5db384f4494f2be81335882ee46ae<SEP>chunk-8baf1265be404bc46eddc076192461b0<SEP>chunk-f736079de24478bec6cb37255e7aac1e<SEP>chunk-498e1fd5e415407ac1ad5829d73bec9b<SEP>chunk-ad8cd9c49a16ec95450897f747dabecf<SEP>chunk-3a0add62a70895b5ac3db1f7977a8549<SEP>chunk-a8830e719ab8be4a9944bce2ee0a988b";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Abundance Festival is a spiritual event that focuses on the external world while simultaneously working on the inner world and consciousness, employing the mantra Om Shanti. It is described as a global event that addresses life's challenges through inner work and consciousness, with an emphasis on transforming inner consciousness to tackle external life challenges.

The festival is also characterized as an event that connects the external world with inner consciousness development, and it is noted for its use of consciousness work to address both external and inner world challenges. This dual focus on external outcomes and inner transformation underscores its holistic approach to personal and collective growth.

Beyond its spiritual dimensions, the Abundance Festival is highlighted as a significant event that marked a shift in the family's fortune, suggesting that its impact extends to personal and familial realms, not solely to broader spiritual or consciousness-focused objectives.<SEP>Abundance Festival is a focus of the text, centered on addressing problems, challenges, and desires.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779433874"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: tOi1Ho5Kwhk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tOi1Ho5Kwhk)<SEP>YouTube Video: owC8E_G2fY4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owC8E_G2fY4)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "" .

