  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "An everyday practice designed to nurture the three dimensions of the Beautiful State (calm, connected, and creative) through conscious observation and breathwork.<SEP>The Abundant Life Practice is an everyday practice to nurture the three dimensions of the Beautiful State: calm, connected, and creative.<SEP>The Abundant Life Practice is an everyday practice to nurture the three dimensions of the Beautiful State: calm, connected, and creative.<SEP>An everyday practice designed to nurture the three dimensions of the Beautiful State (calm, connected, and creative) through conscious observation and breathwork.";
