  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Actions are non-determinative behaviors in universal communication, representing human activities that contribute to the maintenance of global systems and harmony. They are performed within family, organization, or community contexts and can emerge from spiritual states, with the aim of alleviating suffering, simplifying lives, or adding value to products or people.

In conceptual terms, actions are behaviors influenced by energy flow, which can lead to destiny. Additionally, actions are linked to karma manifestation, playing a role in determining life experiences. These perspectives collectively describe actions as multifaceted, spanning personal, social, spiritual, and karmic dimensions.<SEP>Actions are linked to karma manifestation, with the text emphasizing their role in determining life experiences.<SEP>Actions are linked to karma manifestation, with the text emphasizing their role in determining life experiences.<SEP>Actions are linked to karma manifestation, with the text emphasizing their role in determining life experiences.<SEP>Actions refer to behaviors or measures taken by individuals or groups.""" .

