<urn:mukthiguru:Addictions> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779672187"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Addictions are characterized as a self-perpetuating or vicious cycle that consumes individuals both physically and emotionally, thereby hindering their ability to achieve personal goals or find meaning and purpose in life. This cyclical nature creates a persistent pattern of behavior that is difficult to break without intervention.

The behavioral dependencies associated with Addictions often arise from external pressures and internal struggles. Societal expectations and an inability to self-accept can foster these dependencies, while stress and anxiety also serve as catalysts for their development. In children, such dependencies may manifest as negative behaviors stemming from feelings of being judged, leading to further emotional and psychological challenges.<SEP>Addictive behaviors resulting from stress and anxiety as per the transcript's assertion.<SEP>Addictive behaviors resulting from stress and anxiety as per the transcript's assertion.<SEP>Addictions are framed as manifestations of moral decay and loss of ethical grounding.<SEP>Addictions are framed as manifestations of moral decay and loss of ethical grounding.<SEP>Addictions represent harmful dependencies on substances or behaviors linked to escapism from societal pressures.`""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Addictions";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oc5ar2g2rnI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)<SEP>YouTube Video: odNtpKqbCQo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odNtpKqbCQo)<SEP>YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-e2bd3f4cf43dab42e9cb72ed41ed496d<SEP>chunk-65e592e96dcb520be6fd6fe6ab9612ea<SEP>chunk-287b5379ffe15e81cc3508670d4597aa<SEP>chunk-782fc68234c609b298ab73b8f6469f59<SEP>chunk-f1b80dca74bf6e05c17db254a9158b6f<SEP>chunk-7909a6563f5b96191ad7c41fa18cd126<SEP>chunk-7ac9109abdb5bdc9de2685e960e358c1<SEP>chunk-4043681cb90e5032a1d66db36f936a98<SEP>chunk-30142fb409cd6113794311c0e52cc0fc<SEP>chunk-fd0cf329c3a40648553339d60f0ac0b7<SEP>chunk-e53aa20908f0e3dc300b2226e52897f3<SEP>chunk-e27c90d3f030c932363441c1ed78bf62<SEP>chunk-fafff025e01a29bbcee9969fc4559382<SEP>chunk-3d3e1db7059b50ed67e675540955de81<SEP>chunk-287c3c0f3f95498058ee40d18602c6a5<SEP>chunk-4da1e45ca993decf20ec10e31d56d36e<SEP>chunk-abcd9205e6cb81b428a3257c9dbf7dc6<SEP>chunk-7acdb8dcc103d74a206701373f78fcb9<SEP>chunk-01f9faf5a613d1d1b6c6131312eef66b<SEP>chunk-4e900263f52a257effc9757bdfd34e24" .

