<urn:mukthiguru:Akam> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gQiIwfA3mlk)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)<SEP>YouTube Video: qDSfb0DZ0PE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qDSfb0DZ0PE)<SEP>YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)<SEP>YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)<SEP>YouTube Video: NJQ573JDmAg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJQ573JDmAg)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Akam is an entity and center for enlightenment created by the speaker and Shri Krishna (or Shri Krishna ji) to promote solutions for global challenges. It is also described as an organization where a couple underwent processes to dissolve vasanas and achieve enduring love, and as a center for enlightenment aimed at nurturing individuals capable of solving global challenges through enlightened consciousness. Akam is an entity creating women spiritual masters and redefining feminine spiritual potential, and it is also described as a divine force field enabling access to transcendental dimensions and facilitating processes that reveal past lives and spiritual truths. The input for these descriptions is provided as a JSON list of descriptions, with each description appearing on a new line within the 'Description List' section.<SEP>A term mentioned in the video, possibly a name or concept related to the content.<SEP>Entity referenced in the video's discussion of statistical data and divine presence, likely an organization or group.<SEP>Entity referenced in the \"Eighty percent at Akam\" statement, implied to be an organization or group.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "organization";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-6dd6f0aed7fea431a27783bb1609b0ed<SEP>chunk-be5b7210ecbddf5ded747efb6c288c98<SEP>chunk-a5ed3c3b69f89f61229321dd09c0168c<SEP>chunk-6ae87d1dae4175236f1b20e5eafe0a7f<SEP>chunk-b2da194d8278fd090cf383109d705fd4<SEP>chunk-b4e37c7db97e4b2bc15d3f49a3cabd7c<SEP>chunk-2d6aa6f1c06baa8bf16178bfef309ddc<SEP>chunk-7ae937704ca1201df5ce3ccc8999552d<SEP>chunk-81a80670e6aa7bf176b0cacf73a6f715<SEP>chunk-18859e4480224ac68f76cca24a1ad2ca<SEP>chunk-6390a02d03fdb4770463600e69448a2a<SEP>chunk-4dd42d1c4c17856886839529f0694f39<SEP>chunk-921bac8d531822a1c218a0ec38fab591<SEP>chunk-30bdabdce129add775eb3da51d3ffd8d<SEP>chunk-bdaca57c11a3d551259155ef196cf16d<SEP>chunk-f72de7c8d762c18a6655f15c49149836<SEP>chunk-ff3e80d959eda2affcf9fb1d2dff2880<SEP>chunk-7dca0f22171b9785fbbab01b79ee3fa3<SEP>chunk-b189860a6013a1c7314380e0e0422ab7<SEP>chunk-ae5642ecfdb10a03887e8821b348299e<SEP>chunk-ce97641a5abeea9a25ad8c8cc01b440d<SEP>chunk-02c476f06b018b2911ffd93038b4567f<SEP>chunk-7a9b6af69eebffa2e5823fd0f89c5c36<SEP>chunk-96c40ba90756818741bbddb2688da9b1";
