  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Ancient times refers to historical periods where humans faced frequent life-threatening stressors.<SEP>Ancient times represent a period when survival mechanisms shaped the human brain's memory retention traits.<SEP>Ancient Times refers to early human history where survival depended on threat awareness and memory of dangers.<SEP>Ancient times are cited as the origin of spiritual and scientific death-related inquiries.<SEP>Ancient times are cited as the origin of spiritual and scientific death-related inquiries.";
