  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779179020"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Andrew is a character with a troubled childhood, marked by hatred toward his father and internal conflict about his relationships.<SEP>Andrew is a man struggling with anger and emotional distress in his relationships, particularly with his wife, and seeks to heal from his wounded child state to improve his career and family life.<SEP>Andrew is a person who sought approval through various behaviors driven by a desire for love and acceptance, eventually undergoing emotional healing and forgiveness.<SEP>Andrew is a person who experienced healing of his inner child, leading to business growth and reduced anxiety. He lost inhibition to reach out to people and no longer fears being hurt.<SEP>Andrew is a character who grapples with childhood trauma, anger, and disconnection, later undergoing transformation through self-awareness and forgiveness.`" .

