  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "An ancient Sanskrit phrase meaning \"food is the embodiment of the universe,\" emphasizing universal consciousness in food.<SEP>Annam Para Brahma Swarupam is a Sanskrit phrase meaning \"food is the embodiment of the divine,\" emphasizing the sacred nature of food in spiritual traditions.<SEP>Ancient saying meaning \"food is the form of the universe,\" emphasizing the universal consciousness in food.<SEP>An ancient saying equating food with divine energy, emphasizing its spiritual significance.";
