  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Authentic transformation occurs through gradual shifts toward observational awareness rather than forced positivity.<SEP>Highlights the shift from self-centeredness to connection as the essence of genuine personal growth.<SEP>A shift from self-centeredness to connection with others and the world, marking true aliveness and purpose.";
