  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Authenticity refers to aligning with one's true self, emphasized as key to addressing the root cause of unhappiness and achieving fulfillment.<SEP>Authenticity is highlighted as crucial for genuine connections.<SEP>Alignment with one's true self, free from societal pressures or external validation.<SEP>Authenticity is a concept that is emphasized as a positive trait in relationships.<SEP>Authenticity is a concept that is emphasized as important in relationships.";
