  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Awakened Consciousness is a state of heightened awareness that can be achieved through meditation at Ekam, enabling an impact on the human collective. It is also a concept representing enlightenment and serves as a solution to global challenges by fostering compassion and oneness.  

This state is characterized as enabling harmony with the world and functions as a powerful life movement. Moreover, awakened consciousness is emphasized as the foundation for overcoming division and fostering understanding.<SEP>Awakened consciousness is emphasized as the foundation for overcoming division and fostering understanding.<SEP>Awakened consciousness is emphasized as the foundation for overcoming division and fostering understanding.<SEP>Awakened consciousness is emphasized as the foundation for overcoming division and fostering understanding.<SEP>Awakened consciousness is emphasized as the foundation for overcoming division and fostering understanding.""" .

