  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a comprehensive, cohesive summary of the entity \"Awakened State of Consciousness\". The input is a list of descriptions (JSON objects). We need to merge them into a single summary, multiple paragraphs, plain text, no extra formatting. Must be objective, third-person, mention full name at beginning. Must be within 600 tokens. Must include all key info.

