  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Beautiful Self embodies peace with oneself and harmony with the world, achieved through the Soul Sync Exercise.<SEP>The Beautiful Self embodies peace, self-acceptance, and harmony with oneself and the world.<SEP>Beautiful Self embodies a state of self-acceptance and peace, free from internal conflict and aligned with one's authentic existence, as symbolized by the affirmation \"Mine is a beautiful life.\"<SEP>A state of self-acceptance and harmony with oneself, free from inner conflict.";
