  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "A beautiful state of being describes a harmonious condition of wholeness, joy, and connectedness.`<SEP>A beautiful state of being describes a harmonious condition of wholeness, joy, and connectedness.`<SEP>A transcendent condition marked by emotional fulfillment, unity, and heightened awareness of consciousness.<SEP>A state characterized by wholeness, joy, and connected consciousness that enables spiritual fulfillment.<SEP>A state characterized by wholeness, joy, and connected consciousness that enables spiritual fulfillment.<SEP>Beautiful state of being is portrayed as a transformative outcome of meditation, reflecting harmony with existence and universal intelligence.<SEP>Beautiful state of being is portrayed as a transformative outcome of meditation, reflecting harmony with existence and universal intelligence.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-6bd1265c66d1065be54810dd4e52f30a<SEP>chunk-5b6ea8ea6a84c14eccce239691136bf1<SEP>chunk-1eb764bde7f7f1e1e97d8931c7b9875e<SEP>chunk-e5a191d0b4c345edce809b4d1989b5be";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Beautiful State of Being" .

<urn:mukthiguru:Beautiful%20State%20of%20Connection> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "A spontaneous state of connection emerges through embracing self-disconnectedness without resistance.<SEP>Beautiful State of Connection is a shared state of connection that is possible for all as they make peace with themselves, their past, and their present.<SEP>A state of evolution and connection achieved by observing and accepting inner shadows rather than escaping them.<SEP>A state of being characterized by dissolving separation and emerging connection, where relating and living become joyful experiences.<SEP>The CEO's empathetic connection with employees, fostering collaboration.<SEP>A state of profound self-awareness and inner harmony used to address moral dilemmas.<SEP>A harmonious mental state achieved through empathy and understanding of others' inner experiences.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Beautiful State of Connection";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)<SEP>YouTube Video: 1PlGMOAypCI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1PlGMOAypCI)";
