  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Beth is a person who experiences a learning disability, parental taunts, and engages in a vicious cycle of unhealthy behaviors.<SEP>Beth is a person trapped in an inert self due to lifelong comparisons with her siblings, leading to self-destructive behaviors.<SEP>Beth is a person who struggled with self-comparison, parental criticism, and a vicious cycle of negative behaviors leading to self-destructive patterns.<SEP>Beth is a person who experienced an inert self due to lifelong comparisons with her siblings, leading to feelings of inadequacy.`<SEP>Beth struggles with self-comparison to her siblings, leading to a cycle of self-destructive behavior including overeating and poor financial decisions." .

