  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Bias is discussed as a societal issue that needs to be acknowledged and addressed to foster harmony.<SEP>Bias refers to prejudiced attitudes or stereotypes, particularly those related to skin color and social hierarchy.<SEP>Bias is a truth that must be seen, leading to the door of abundance in family.<SEP>Bias is explicitly addressed as a societal flaw requiring recognition and overcoming.<SEP>Bias is mentioned as a reaction to differences in appearance or belief.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779675495"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Bias" .

