  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Critical life choices addressed through the academy's teachings, like relationships and career paths.<SEP>Major life choices such as career, marriage, and business that are traditionally considered more impactful than smaller decisions.<SEP>Big decisions are mentioned as typically considered important by people, such as career choices, marriage, and business, contrasting with small daily decisions.";
