<urn:mukthiguru:Bliss> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779701306"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-cb2b247e069cff8e39d34db433289983<SEP>chunk-e7a44718d07524dc9d25d8465c12f664<SEP>chunk-c195d5abc160d6408ccad089d03fdf8f<SEP>chunk-16505689511452878f9de53f0eb16c6e<SEP>chunk-2d3f608813d8d7bf79ec7758bd159c09<SEP>chunk-7796e9953e60bd3bb11c46251f992983<SEP>chunk-6bd1265c66d1065be54810dd4e52f30a<SEP>chunk-ade616c2567b32dc9ebbc4ced1ffc773<SEP>chunk-20d55a95f1cbc94a40998bcd62b8a62f<SEP>chunk-421a4c58520d1e933d3bc17c203cc893";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: E-LCT0YEpWQ (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E-LCT0YEpWQ)<SEP>YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)<SEP>YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E8N04l1Lptk)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Bliss";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual teaching about \"Bliss\" from the contaminated text. The contaminated text has a lot of developer instructions and meta-instructions mixed in.

First, I need to identify the real content. The entity name is \"Bliss\". The original description says, \"Bliss represents a state of complete fulfillment and joy in experiences, often absent due to incompleteness.\" Then there's a second paragraph that elaborates on this, explaining that experiences are rarely complete, leading to a sense of incompleteness.

The rest of the text is about how to structure the output, token counts, and formatting instructions. I need to remove all that. The key points are the two paragraphs that define Bliss. The first paragraph is straightforward. The second one adds that the state is lacking because experiences aren't complete. 

I should check if there's any other spiritual content. The rest is just instructions on how to format the response, which I need to ignore. So combining the two paragraphs into a clean description without any markdown or extra text. Make sure it's in plain English, 1-4 sentences. The example output in the contaminated text has two sentences, so that's acceptable. 

No bullet points, no headers. Just the clean description. Let me put it together.
</think>

Bliss is a concept that represents a state of complete fulfillment and joy in experiences, often absent due to incompleteness. It describes a condition where an individual feels fully satisfied and content, yet such a state is typically lacking because experiences are rarely entirely complete, leading to a sense of incompleteness.""" .

