  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Boredom also motivates starting new relationships, but the engagement is fleeting.<SEP>Boredom arises from unmet desires for novelty and stimulation.<SEP>Boredom is a state of monotony or lack of stimulation that may drive individuals toward addictive activities for escapism.<SEP>Boredom is an emotional response to lack of activity during seclusion.<SEP>Boredom is a state of lack of interest or engagement.<SEP>Boredom is a state of monotony or lack of engagement, often linked to dissatisfaction and mental restlessness.<SEP>Boredom is a concept that oscillates with excitement.`";
