  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The Brahma Sutras are a collection of teachings compiled by sage Vyasa.<SEP>A text that describes the nature of Brahman and all that exists as the one indivisible field of consciousness.<SEP>The Brahma Sutras are brief descriptions of profound, enlightened states of consciousness of sages.<SEP>Brahma Sutras are brief descriptions of profound, enlightened states of consciousness of sages.<SEP>The Brahma Sutras are brief descriptions of profound, enlightened states of consciousness of sages.";
