<urn:mukthiguru:Brahman> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>, <neo4j://graph.schema#Concept>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Entity Name: Brahman

Description List:<SEP>Brahman is equated with the indivisible consciousness in the concept of Brahmarpanam.<SEP>Brahman is the one indivisible field of consciousness representing ultimate reality.<SEP>Brahman is described as the one indivisible field of consciousness, the single cell, bacteria, the blue whales, the rainforest, and humanity.<SEP>The indivisible field of consciousness encompassing all existence, from the physical universe to multi-dimensional realities.""";
