<urn:mukthiguru:Breakthroughs> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual content from the contaminated text provided. The contaminated text includes a lot of developer instructions and prompt templates mixed with the real content about \"Breakthroughs.\"

First, I need to identify the real spiritual teaching. The user mentioned that the long description talks about breakthroughs as potential achievements through heightened consciousness and meditation, unlocking new capabilities. The short descriptions are identical, repeating that definition. The developer instructions are about how to structure the summary, token limits, paragraphs, etc.

My job is to remove all the developer stuff and just keep the spiritual content. The key points to include are the definition, relation to meditation, heightened consciousness, new capabilities, cognitive and perceptual enhancements, personal growth, creativity, problem-solving, mechanisms under investigation, practitioner experiences, personal transformation, overcoming limitations, disciplined mental training, and consciousness transcending constraints.

Looking at the contaminated text, the actual content is in the long description and the short ones. The developer instructions are the parts about producing summaries, token limits, paragraphs, etc. So I need to extract the spiritual parts and structure them into a clean 1-4 sentence description without any markdown or headers.

The example output starts with \"Breakthroughs are defined as...\" and includes the key points. I need to make sure not to include any of the meta-instructions. Let me check the paragraphs planned in the contaminated text. The first paragraph is the definition, the second about mechanisms and research, third about practitioner experiences, and fourth about broader implications. But the user wants a clean description, so I need to condense this into a few sentences without bullet points or headers.

Putting it all together, the clean description should mention the definition, the role of meditation and heightened consciousness, the outcomes like new capabilities, personal growth, creativity, and the impact on personal transformation. Also, include that these are reported by practitioners and the potential of consciousness transcending limits. Avoid any""";
