<urn:mukthiguru:British%20Empire> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The British Empire is a historical political entity that ruled over colonies, including India and South Africa.<SEP>The British Empire is mentioned as the historical context against which Gandhi's nonviolent resistance was significant.<SEP>The British Empire is the colonial power in South Africa during Gandhi's time, associated with oppressive policies.<SEP>The British Empire was the colonial power that ruled India and created a structure for clerks.";
