  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Broken heart syndrome is referenced as a physiological manifestation of heartbreak, involving neural and cardiac effects.<SEP>Broken heart syndrome is a medical condition where heart neurons die and connections are lost due to betrayal.<SEP>A medical condition characterized by the death of neurons in the heart and loss of connections, leading to severe emotional and physiological distress." .

