  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Buddha Purnima, also known as Vaishaka Purnima, is the full moon day in the lunar month of Vaishakha celebrated by over 500 million people in honor of the Buddha's enlightenment.<SEP>Buddha Purnima (Vaishaka Purnima) is the full moon day in the lunar month of Vaishakha celebrated in honor of the Buddha's enlightenment.<SEP>Buddha Purnima is a full moon day in the lunar month of Vaishakha, celebrated globally to commemorate the Buddha's enlightenment.<SEP>Buddha Purnima is an event related to Buddha's enlightenment and is mentioned in the text.";
