<urn:mukthiguru:COVID> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "COVID";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-0ad786d49405bb1a57cd1b61b45c9d47<SEP>chunk-161257a3b15bcafcf939769dfff5e967<SEP>chunk-3a0add62a70895b5ac3db1f7977a8549<SEP>chunk-c1d8dd3f6ee4794537974077b8f6d5c9<SEP>chunk-195432225c839e4aa9996bf06701d94e<SEP>chunk-e1d5e0073f33e1ee1857e1f6302d5b7f<SEP>chunk-00b63395d5ef5274c1baeb0f4e99541f<SEP>chunk-3bbc23f7da347ce4b93776c537570fa8";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: owC8E_G2fY4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owC8E_G2fY4)<SEP>YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)<SEP>YouTube Video: d0v8RE6i0GM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d0v8RE6i0GM)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779519229"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual teaching or concept definition from the contaminated text provided. The contaminated text includes a lot of developer instructions and prompt templates mixed with the real content about COVID.

First, I need to identify the real spiritual content. The task mentions that the entity is \"COVID\" and there are several descriptions. Some of these descriptions talk about the pandemic as a global event related to shared karma, lockdowns, masks, and societal disruption. Others mention the interior designing firm's success during COVID, which seems unrelated to the spiritual aspect. There's also a metaphor comparing COVID to the \"infection of violence\" and the need for spiritual awakening.

The key here is to separate the spiritual aspects from the other information. The spiritual teachings would be the parts that discuss karma, the metaphor of violence as a mental infection, the necessity of spiritual awakening, and the pandemic's role in prompting community solidarity and family bonding. The interior designing firm's success is a separate entity and not part of the spiritual content, so that should be excluded.

I need to make sure that the output is a clean 1-4 sentence description in plain English without any bullet points or headers. Also, the response should start with \"COVID\" as per the instructions. The example response provided by the user includes mentions of shared karma, lockdowns, masks, societal disruption, health crisis, metaphor of violence, spiritual awakening, and community solidarity. That aligns with the spiritual aspects mentioned in the contaminated text.

I should check if all the relevant spiritual points are covered and that any non-spiritual elements like the interior designing firm are omitted. The final answer should be concise, objective, and in third-person. Let me structure that into a few sentences without any markdown.
</think>

COVID is a global pandemic viewed through spiritual and metaphorical lenses as a shared human experience of karma, manifesting through lockdowns, masks, societal disruption, and health crises.""" .

