<urn:mukthiguru:Campus> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Campus";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Campus is a versatile location that serves as the setting for multiple individuals and programs. It is where Sunil met Krishnaji for a mentoring session, and where Sunil had a similar mentoring interaction with Krishnaji.

The campus also functions as the destination for a couple who eventually arrives at O&O Academy. Additionally, it is the site where Doris and Clark undergo a transformative process. Campus is also the place where Scott came to feel lost and sought introspection.

It is the physical location for the Oneness Achievers program, which will be conducted there. Finally, Campus is where Diego resides, and it is the setting for his interactions and emotional journey.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779187087"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "location";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-c4f9e407e113bf4f292d2bfecfb8c361<SEP>chunk-5f6e567050111ca1e6e0891a182bd7b3<SEP>chunk-2be9c30d5eb8cae8ce6cd1e6425921bc<SEP>chunk-ca39129be392f8feb82a946e1e47ca81<SEP>chunk-35066d143982984b9a29f99d425abcdb<SEP>chunk-8828f50e6038efd15058fd650efc925a<SEP>chunk-214089f71bed8468f80247a24979283e<SEP>chunk-9a28e4054912d7c9812d1628ee5acb4a" .

