<urn:mukthiguru:Caste> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779701483"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Caste is a social term used to describe cultural divisions within societies. It is understood as a social hierarchy that shapes community interactions and influences individual opportunities. The concept of caste functions as a persistent social category that continues to influence social dynamics, despite varying interpretations of its effect on collective identity.

In India, caste has been identified as a basis for discrimination, where it persists as a social divisor that affects community cohesion. Some perspectives note that caste does not affect the sense of oneness in the second level, indicating a nuanced view of its impact. Overall, caste operates as a persistent social divisor affecting community cohesion.

Multiple descriptions emphasize that caste refers to a social hierarchy that affects community interactions and individual opportunities. The repeated statements highlight that caste is a persistent social divisor affecting community cohesion, and that it is a social hierarchy influencing community interactions and individual opportunities. The concept of caste continues to be a subject of interpretation regarding its effect on collective identity.<SEP>Caste is noted as a persistent social divisor affecting community cohesion.<SEP>Caste refers to a social hierarchy that affects community interactions and individual opportunities.<SEP>Caste is noted as a persistent social divisor affecting community cohesion.<SEP>Caste is mentioned alongside gender as a basis for outdated social differentiation.<SEP>Caste is mentioned alongside gender as a basis for outdated social differentiation.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-b05adb44a9c000b3a3a1231da35d601a<SEP>chunk-f97c33bc1c34505752dbdf13ce792596<SEP>chunk-1a2d9f9a94f699ed87aa72d476d3870c<SEP>chunk-b1776121cc5dfb12d2007497b9b6d6fe<SEP>chunk-25f394f47fe40575ea9fbcd110df6414<SEP>chunk-9eea478f3eb12a678ce672d3075c4af8<SEP>chunk-c2a3583743d6818c48f0ebcba32019d3";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Caste";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWMBvMlGWTA)<SEP>YouTube Video: 2seBB2oByZc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2seBB2oByZc)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGhlBQ8iWl4)" .

