<urn:mukthiguru:Causeless%20Love> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Domain-specific term referring to unconditional, selfless love without cause or expectation.<SEP>Causeless Love is a state of unconditional love that is not dependent on external causes, often described as a spiritual or divine state.<SEP>Causeless love is a state of unconditional, selfless love that arises without external triggers or expectations.`<SEP>Domain-specific term referring to unconditional, selfless love without cause or expectation.<SEP>Causeless Love is a state of unconditional love that is not dependent on external causes, often described as a spiritual or divine state.<SEP>Causeless love is a state of unconditional, selfless love that arises without external triggers or expectations.`<SEP>Causeless love is portrayed as an idealized form of love that is limitless and selfless, though critiqued as a thought structure rather than a real experience.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
