  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Cells are described as engines that are powered by the intake of breath.<SEP>Biological units within organisms that communicate through biochemical processes involving enzymes and neuropeptides.<SEP>Cells communicate with each other through enzymes and neuropeptides, and a perfect state of communication is health.<SEP>Cells are biological components through which destructive emotions from past generations can be inherited and influence present emotions.<SEP>Cells are biological components mentioned in the context of synchronized power and bodily healing through Oneness consciousness.<SEP>Cells are discussed in the context of carrying generational information and uniqueness.";
