<urn:mukthiguru:Childhood> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Childhood is the period of early life marked by formative experiences that influence adult perspectives and behaviors. It includes numerous instances and experiences that individuals reflect upon, often associated with the recollection of past events.  

This stage is also characterized as a past event where change in others was not possible, underscoring its fixed nature. Furthermore, childhood is described as a time marked by unmet needs for kindness and warmth, which contrasts with the present transformative consciousness that emerges later.  

The concept of childhood also emphasizes its role as a period of reflection, where individuals look back on the numerous experiences that have shaped them, and it is often contrasted with the transformative consciousness that characterizes later life.<SEP>Childhood refers to the period of life from birth up to adulthood, often associated with formative experiences and development.<SEP>Childhood refers to the period of life from birth up to adulthood, often associated with formative experiences and development.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)<SEP>YouTube Video: s6B81c2uTGg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s6B81c2uTGg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-c0eee090a2741e82903b80d77573da86<SEP>chunk-3b972b1465c1099f09b7fe384e4ebabc<SEP>chunk-5d0f74c4239eabf7a6fea87da28be5d8<SEP>chunk-c1d8dd3f6ee4794537974077b8f6d5c9<SEP>chunk-c31c96b585957b3d969c1f44467db292<SEP>chunk-967a1ebc79cd7d83afc2b43d42c8ab36<SEP>chunk-a1a3adb6e659bbb8209f01781e8bec78<SEP>chunk-5775fa967c3333ec10bee1ba6077c7ce<SEP>chunk-c088c9de5db4ddb6d01a048401214aef<SEP>chunk-472321605b70f46b6792fb017a049d8d<SEP>chunk-313c3c4bd3fa26c1b3b5e358022a1e6b<SEP>chunk-607beefb79fd1c2b867abf7979a1dbfc<SEP>chunk-e9d2d065e530e86a6fbd6e76094e9842<SEP>chunk-4f083f509b73a704942cae198b15e4c6";
