  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Cities are portrayed as becoming cleaner and smarter, representing material progress in the physical world.

This portrayal emphasizes the transformation of urban environments, highlighting improvements in cleanliness and technological advancement as indicators of progress.

Overall, the descriptions convey a consistent view that cities are evolving toward greater cleanliness and intelligence, reflecting broader material advancement in the physical realm.

Thus, the portrayal of cities as cleaner and smarter serves as a metaphor for material progress in the physical world.

This consistent depiction underscores the link between urban improvement and broader societal advancement.<SEP>Cities are portrayed as becoming cleaner and smarter, representing material progress in the physical world.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Cities";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-25f394f47fe40575ea9fbcd110df6414<SEP>chunk-5f06ba1ae7a3d1eb5ae89a5a7db786f0" .

<urn:mukthiguru:Citizens> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Citizens are urged to prioritize unity over divisiveness, with relationships tested by political differences.<SEP>Citizens are urged to prioritize unity over divisiveness, with relationships tested by political differences.<SEP>Citizens are urged to prioritize unity over divisiveness, with relationships tested by political differences.<SEP>Citizens are urged to prioritize unity over divisiveness, with relationships tested by political differences.<SEP>Citizens are portrayed as collective entities expected to honor those who defend the nation, reflecting societal responsibility and respect.<SEP>Citizens' Dharma is to live with a non-violent consciousness.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-5eb1940c87be8a3cdd703c8147cf00f5<SEP>chunk-0360e3d7478d7aa88e74b472aef4bc64<SEP>chunk-4529c1884cd3f5e14f3ad9c161d86e76";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "YouTube Video: oSqD_BvF7vA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oSqD_BvF7vA)<SEP>YouTube Video: ftFDBaH7RFg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftFDBaH7RFg)";
