<urn:mukthiguru:Civilizations> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Civilizations are referenced as historical entities that face extinction due to refusal to adapt.<SEP>Civilizations are mentioned as historical entities that faced extinction due to refusal to adapt and change.<SEP>Civilizations refer to human societies that have undergone cycles of rise and fall, marked by the emergence and disappearance of languages and lifestyles over time.<SEP>Civilizations refer to human societies with distinct cultural, political, and social structures that have risen and fallen throughout history, as referenced in the context of human beings' persistent pursuit of enlightenment.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Civilizations";
