<urn:mukthiguru:Communities> <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Communities are highlighted as entities dependent on individual well-being for collective health.<SEP>Local groups affected by the leaders' actions and teachings.<SEP>Communities refers to groups of people, simplified from \"communities of people\" for readability.<SEP>Communities refers to groups of people interconnected by shared interests, culture, or geography.<SEP>Communities refers to groups of people, simplified from \"communities of people\" for readability.";
