  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "{\"Description\": \"Compassion is defined as an act of kindness where one helps someone in need, requiring a \\\"beautiful state\\\" to sustain it effectively.\"}<SEP>Compassion is defined as an act of kindness where one helps someone in need, requiring a \"beautiful state\" to sustain it effectively.<SEP>Compassion is described as an act of kindness driven by connection, with implications for energy expenditure and behavioral outcomes.";
