<urn:mukthiguru:Competitors> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Competitors are individuals that lottery winners compare themselves to, leading to feelings of superiority.<SEP>Competitors are individuals or groups in rivalry, often prioritizing dominance over cooperation.<SEP>Competitors are individuals driven by rivalry rather than genuine friendship.";
