The user's instructions mention that there's a conflict between the first description and the others. The task is to reconcile these or present both viewpoints. The developer notes say to present both perspectives, noting the differing views. So the real spiritual content here is that there are two perspectives on what causes conflicts: one internal (bad samsara, inner work) and one external (interpersonal/societal divisions).

I need to make sure I only include the actual teachings, not the instructions. The example output starts with \"Conflicts are a phenomenon...\" and mentions both perspectives. I should follow that structure but ensure it's concise, in plain English, and within 1-4 sentences. Also, start with the entity name \"Conflicts.\"

