2. Six short descriptions: each is \"Conflicts within families result from societal division and separation.` - Seems correct.\"

Thus, we need to synthesize a comprehensive summary that integrates all key information. The summary must be in plain text, multiple paragraphs, no extra formatting. Must be objective, third-person, mention the full name of the entity at the beginning. Must not exceed 600 tokens. Must be in English.

