  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-a29dd9226d9c6641c3dfa10db6f15eb5<SEP>chunk-b46675c05bfa30223c5b090123b0a08b<SEP>chunk-7969e4168ecd055a3fbcda3d1911b288<SEP>chunk-9c20c8f0dd5caad4ba7b2edbb0325b1f<SEP>chunk-534aa5b1bce760dde6fcebe7d2a8da54<SEP>chunk-d1580b380e66d60231e8bb1500c438e9<SEP>chunk-69c518552350983af20c342ffe0b1ce1<SEP>chunk-1de41cf0c7dd51f4c24f73f5f21d78fe<SEP>chunk-02c05cf3a61d20e46704cb3f714b9393<SEP>chunk-fedec056ab462ac623268f5f37e05639";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Connected State is a concept describing a mindset of unity with universal intelligence that leads to peace and clarity. It is also a state of being characterized by love, peace, compassion, courage, and passion, which is associated with bringing order to life. This positive emotional state fosters order in one's existence and is linked to alignment with others and purpose, thereby promoting a positive organizational culture and collaboration.

The Connected State implies a harmonious or interlinked existence that enables mutual love experiences between individuals. It is a state of emotional connection that allows love to be shared and reciprocated effectively. In this condition, individuals communicate with consciousness, which helps bring about order. The concept also suggests that a connected state can create a \"magical destiny,\" reflecting a deeper, perhaps spiritual, dimension to the experience.

Overall, Connected State integrates personal emotional qualities with a broader sense of universal connection, resulting in clarity, peace, and order. It serves as both an internal mindset and an external relational dynamic, influencing how individuals interact with others and perceive their environment.<SEP>A connected state implies a harmonious or interlinked existence, enabling the creation of a \"magical destiny.\"<SEP>Connected State is a state of consciousness described as essential for creating destiny through interconnectedness.<SEP>Connected State is a state of consciousness described as essential for creating destiny through interconnectedness.<SEP>State of being connected, which is part of creating a magical destiny.<SEP>State of being connected, which is part of creating a magical destiny.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779686715"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Connected State" .

