<urn:mukthiguru:Connection> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Connection";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Connection is a multifaceted concept that encompasses interpersonal or emotional bonding, a sense of unity with others and the self, and the relationship between people or things that implies a bond or link. It is also defined as gratitude-awareness of being shaped by others' efforts, which serves as a motivator for reciprocal action. Connection is an awareness of the oneness of human experience, characterized by compassion, inclusivity, and sensitivity as states of consciousness. Additionally, Connection can be an emotional state linked to attracting blessings in life. Connection is also described as a state of being linked with oneself, leading to answers. Moreover, Connection represents the state of unity and interdependence between beings and the natural world, central to the text's themes.<SEP>Connection represents the state of unity and interdependence between beings and the natural world, central to the text's themes.<SEP>Connection represents the state of unity and interdependence between beings and the natural world, central to the text's themes.<SEP>Connection represents the state of unity and interdependence between beings and the natural world, central to the text's themes.<SEP>Connection is emphasized as a desired outcome of spiritual practices and inner state engagement.<SEP>Connection is emphasized as a desired outcome of spiritual practices and inner state engagement.<SEP>Connection refers to an emotional or relational bond between individuals, implied in the context of maintaining relationships and avoiding disconnection.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-ae33a0629a1035831d09370dbcb6fa05<SEP>chunk-e529b36ff201e9fd0aaf1f7dc5280697<SEP>chunk-9924c7e219f96915a4ef19eba2cb5f62<SEP>chunk-ad886d6b8bed920b247267424ac5e9aa<SEP>chunk-a813939f321629f8537b01c0cc6653ae<SEP>chunk-b96d370a14bedf82917d4f135e00825e<SEP>chunk-507268df0c575c1a1dafc320ed55bb49<SEP>chunk-d52f636ec1e248fba87af843ffd93511<SEP>chunk-9126b7168266feeb5c044ddb65ae0392<SEP>chunk-c4f9e407e113bf4f292d2bfecfb8c361<SEP>chunk-ff2be9cdc909be640e9aaf71298fc4c9<SEP>chunk-533c11dca17ed148bc0fe09075977a5a<SEP>chunk-4ca9aac0c54b5272b268630d1b3e68f9<SEP>chunk-b54ac9ad4f0146c0455d735ab73fde35<SEP>chunk-322c357b48b096d2f7b5c99e2d2d2519<SEP>chunk-b0b6f9f02020768407fee531e6074a4d<SEP>chunk-14be37b1d86fb5b82128188406768290<SEP>chunk-70c6bbdb11e53c9f8f6f300d287b2520<SEP>chunk-8c0f80d81b49972daf18e0b85888c919<SEP>chunk-0b93a19f07fdaada8a87bb7bfa37fae9<SEP>chunk-b4387a01e271d1d16068a0288faa84e5<SEP>chunk-46f092e49beb29848499bc5cec4e1faf<SEP>chunk-cb2b247e069cff8e39d34db433289983<SEP>chunk-aaa5c02ef780f417e1e3498aff83c60b<SEP>chunk-39ae671b46577f26845d7bb862a61c36<SEP>chunk-25634a7e16db511e9e5b4a8597da99fd<SEP>chunk-5849ade76c5b4eb2790b0b03a838cc07<SEP>chunk-5f2b82bf7ee5cac6adf00faf7fb17ffd<SEP>chunk-bda2d2f720df9a2377a09a7b416beb0e<SEP>chunk-9a28e4054912d7c9812d1628ee5acb4a<SEP>chunk-924b77c112ecc0d58074213d49a1a3d2<SEP>chunk-21d71f186fdeb1dfcf5eb219529f54f0<SEP>chunk-b628c030400a26f95b386175dbe5ab57<SEP>chunk-61a7ee017159ac7e6854fff065426b75<SEP>chunk-959b75d8730e8069b5cdeee7b801f17f<SEP>chunk-1638eab96ec57bc1b768b7d70d8ef77f<SEP>chunk-0390556d788c91f6a96de617dfba0674<SEP>chunk-efcb91e5fdaab3bfd47bb92c605956fe<SEP>chunk-77a2fc8481ea11ffad7cb8ddb5fb08aa<SEP>chunk-a9c35b7e3af59116caff7410890807ed<SEP>chunk-5df4284d1aa76cb89d7850ba8ee300b9<SEP>chunk-5a1740daf11f031bb2f4e4877b90a316<SEP>chunk-a85ada8ef40f654a099ee00af9f2432f<SEP>chunk-3d3e1db7059b50ed67e675540955de81<SEP>chunk-55501b6eda54d23ad2ef3c8a94319a9a<SEP>chunk-df8fc1ec5d1cc48e4ba2ac7