  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "A conscious world leader regards Mother Earth and its inhabitants as an interconnected family, emphasizing global stewardship.<SEP>Perceives Mother Earth and its inhabitants as family, promoting global oneness.<SEP>Conscious world leader regards planetary ecosystems and humanity as an interconnected familial entity requiring holistic stewardship.";
