  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Refers to principles governing the relationship between one's state and the manifestation of chaos or order.<SEP>A principle suggesting that living a self-centered life leads to various personal and societal conflicts.<SEP>Overarching principle governing chaos and order, including laws like the third consciousness law of chaos and order.<SEP>Consciousness law is a domain-specific principle governing bodily harmony and system functionality.<SEP>Consciousness law is a domain-specific concept referenced in the context of health and chaos dynamics, though its exact definition remains implicit in the text.<SEP>Consciousness Law is a domain-specific principle that, when followed, leads to order in various aspects of life and contributes to a magnificent life.";
