  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Contribution is the act of enriching one's life and contributing to the world, emerging from a state of abundance consciousness and deep connection.<SEP>Contribution refers to the capacity to positively impact the world, enabled by abundance consciousness and self-awareness.<SEP>Contribution is framed as a conscious human being's perspective on purpose, emphasizing societal impact.";
