<urn:mukthiguru:Contributions> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Contributions";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Contributions refer to the value of services or efforts made by individuals, often undervalued in societal dynamics.<SEP>Contributions are the actions of people that form the basis for awareness and gratitude.<SEP>Contributions are the actions of people that form the basis for awareness and gratitude.<SEP>Contributions are the actions or efforts of others that form the basis for gratitude when acknowledged.";
