  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Revised version of the sentence: \"When we become awakened human beings, we become enlightened human beings, and we are in a true state of oneness, and we live in a true state of oneness.\"<SEP>Revised version of the sentence: \"When we become awakened human beings, we become enlightened human beings, and we are in a true state of oneness, and we live in a true state of oneness.\"<SEP>The corrected sentence \"We are falling sick our friends or relatives the people we know are falling sick.\" is the final version considered a bad fix.<SEP>Corrected sentence: \"We are falling sick, our friends or relatives, the people we know are falling sick.\"<SEP>\"We are falling sick our friends or relatives the people we know are falling sick.\" A revised version of the original sentence with commas removed after 'sick' and 'know'.<SEP>Corrected Sentence is the properly structured sentence using the provided terms: \"Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji offer Deeksha, initiating Sadhana to experience the Limitless Field and realize the truth of Ekam.\"<SEP>Corrected Sentence is the properly structured sentence using the provided terms: \"Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji offer Deeksha, initiating Sadhana to experience the Limitless Field and realize the truth of Ekam.\"";
