<urn:mukthiguru:Crisis> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hwNlLB1sze0)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M7ItOHTrvz8)<SEP>YouTube Video: K-AFDVOkIoE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K-AFDVOkIoE)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-7f167e0e6ad11f51a72e88b506b459a9<SEP>chunk-969db65cd4de00b6ac88dc7de2088f7a<SEP>chunk-56d49489b1f42f899d9566a254886c2c<SEP>chunk-bb8776e3af3003e2566aad28f28875b7<SEP>chunk-7c8c081356f803e6e944675013e90777<SEP>chunk-0de990c9c98448c49e9565dc513c171a<SEP>chunk-28a9278165fe13a505446b814c02e9dc<SEP>chunk-1858c31999fe39fe76b1a067f13f934d<SEP>chunk-b1e9b7eb495ce02a274d514dffa406f5<SEP>chunk-014f762e43b25d198c755c424f29f67a";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Crisis is a period of intense difficulty, trouble, or danger, often characterized by anxiety and panic, and can be a critical situation that may develop gradually or strike suddenly.

It is also described as a time when wealth rapidly diminishes from human hands, reflecting instability in economic structures. In the context of global finance, a crisis manifests as an economic downturn that leads to job losses, diminished savings, and company devaluation, while also exposing the fragility and vulnerability of financial systems, as exemplified by the impact of a virus. These economic dimensions highlight how a crisis can erode financial security and create widespread instability.

Beyond economic implications, crisis serves as a context for personal growth, where individuals can leverage challenges to rise higher in life.

It is also framed as a period of instability or challenge that is contextualized within spiritual evolution and planetary sustainability, suggesting that crises can be opportunities for transformation and broader ecological awareness.

Overall, crisis is a complex and dynamic condition that simultaneously presents severe challenges and potential for growth, affecting individuals, economies, and even planetary systems.<SEP>A global crisis arises from humanity's unwise signals, environmental destruction, and fear.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Crisis";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779663974"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long> .

