  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "A crocodile is a large aquatic reptile and a predator in the narrative.<SEP>Symbolizes financial struggles arising from obsession and mediocrity in the allegory.<SEP>The crocodile symbolizes financial problems and mediocrity resulting from self-obsession.<SEP>The crocodile serves as a metaphor for addiction, highlighting the futility of relying solely on willpower in such a context.<SEP>Crocodile symbolizes overwhelming power in the analogy comparing addiction resistance.";
