  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-bb336118db8922490b3e05a79c11dba1<SEP>chunk-b0b6f9f02020768407fee531e6074a4d<SEP>chunk-71a9fb4bfe84373a489e9a88ded57dae<SEP>chunk-f0801bcd006400c8824a3d4098716493";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Desserts are aromatic and juicy treats used in the monkey-catching method to lure monkeys.<SEP>Desserts are aromatic and juicy desserts used as bait in the trapping method.<SEP>Aromatic and juicy desserts used as bait in the monkey catching method.<SEP>Aromatic desserts left in a tree hole by villagers to trap monkeys." .

