  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Destruction is the action of destroying something, causing it to cease to exist.<SEP>Destruction represents the outcome of prolonged dissatisfaction and disconnection.<SEP>Destruction refers to the gradual erosion and downfall of an individual's well-being due to prolonged dissatisfaction and addictions.<SEP>Destruction is associated with dissatisfaction and negative outcomes." .

