<urn:mukthiguru:Destructive%20Self> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Destructive Self is a psychological concept representing a manifestation of inner conflict that can lead to harmful behaviors such as aggression or hatred. It is characterized by emotional imbalance, impulsivity, and a need to dominate others, often resulting in self-destructive behavior. In some accounts, the destructive self contributes to an inner war, driving the need to dominate others, and can manifest as aggression and conflict, exemplified by Greg's post-divorce actions.

The destructive self is also described as a psychological state where individuals attempt to transcend through renouncing behavior, culture, or language, though this perspective is less common. It is further defined as a self-destructive mindset that perpetuates inner division, and as an inner state driven by comparisons between reality and idealized scenarios, manifesting as emotional imbalance, aggression, and unhealthy relationships. Some descriptions note that it can manifest as perfectionism, ruthlessness, or addiction to power, all of which are underpinned by emotional imbalance and impulsivity.

Collectively, these descriptions portray the destructive self as a multifaceted psychological condition that fuels inner conflict, self-destructive tendencies, and harmful behaviors, while also highlighting its role in perpetuating inner war and the need to dominate others. The concept underscores the complexity of inner division and the various ways it can manifest, from aggression and conflict to perfectionism and addiction to power.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779184143"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-13c1b39086ccfd163efe6f6f872777c0<SEP>chunk-a2bc52698450e6bd9eed995a65131be2<SEP>chunk-3c5cad218c7d45700a257c9263d28c19<SEP>chunk-0b07ef4dcf56fe79aaec78af52489ef5<SEP>chunk-48d38d40b501a5ac9741fdde5e643c26<SEP>chunk-747dd6f3fc344d596e672f021c5892ee<SEP>chunk-837d0412addc5b4967790622264e22cc<SEP>chunk-813e5d6774fbe0673f530d4b67ec6629";
