  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Diego is a man experiencing severe guilt, depression, and suicidal thoughts after the death of his son, leading to self-imposed suffering and disconnection from his family.<SEP>Diego is a character who experiences guilt over his son's death and seeks forgiveness through meditation and actions.<SEP>A grieving father who struggles with guilt and self-destructive behavior after his son's death.<SEP>Diego is a father who experienced the loss of his son through suicide, leading to his own guilt and depression. He later undergoes a healing process with Krishnaji and plans to hold talent competitions in his son's memory.";
