  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Disciples of the Sages followed the teachings of the sages of India and pursued enlightenment.<SEP>Disciples of the Sages are followers of the Sages of India.<SEP>The Disciples of the Sages are followers pursuing enlightenment through yoga.<SEP>Disciples of the Sages of India who passionately pursued Enlightenment.<SEP>Followers of Indian sages passionately pursuing enlightenment, referenced in the video's historical analysis.<SEP>The followers of the sages who pursued Enlightenment.<SEP>Followers of the sages who pursued enlightenment passionately.";
