  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a merged description for the entity \"Divine\". The input includes multiple JSON objects, each with a \"Description\" field. The descriptions are in plain text, but the JSON objects are each on a new line. The output must be a plain text summary, multiple paragraphs, no extra formatting, objective third-person, mention the full name of the entity at the beginning. Must be comprehensive, integrate all key information, no omission. Must not exceed 600 tokens. Must be in English. Must retain proper nouns as original.

