  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The divorce between Greg and Alicia triggers significant changes in Greg's behavior, including the manifestation of the destructive self.<SEP>Divorce is mentioned as a potential outcome of a successful marriage.<SEP>The divorce of Alicia and Greg occurs after their daughter leaves for college, driven by unresolved marital issues.<SEP>Divorce is the legal dissolution of a marriage.";
