  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Dopamine is described as the neurochemical driving euphoric experiences and subsequent cravings.<SEP>Dopamine is described as the neurochemical driving euphoric experiences and subsequent cravings.<SEP>Dopamine is a neurotransmitter released by the brain during euphoric experiences like romantic love, linked to pleasure.<SEP>Dopamine is a neurotransmitter released by the brain during euphoric experiences like romantic love, linked to pleasure.<SEP>Dopamine is a neurotransmitter associated with pleasure and reward, which subsides over time in romantic relationships.";
