  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Temporary behaviors like indulging in luxuries (e.g., coffee, alcohol, cookies) to alleviate negative emotions.<SEP>Dopamine-fueled escapes refer to temporary behaviors like consuming coffee, martinis, or cookies to alleviate emotional pain, though they do not resolve underlying issues." .

