  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a comprehensive, cohesive summary of the given entity \"Drive\". The input is a list of JSON objects, each with a \"Description\" field. The descriptions are about drive as motivation, determination, motivational force, central theme in family dynamics, etc.

