  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Earth Day is an annual global event celebrated on April 22nd to honor and protect Mother Earth, symbolizing environmental awareness and action.<SEP>Earth Day is an annual global event celebrated on April 22nd to honor and protect Mother Earth, symbolizing environmental awareness and action.<SEP>Earth Day is an annual global event observed on April 22nd to promote environmental awareness and planetary stewardship.";
