  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Economic problem refers to external challenges like job losses and financial instability caused by the crisis.<SEP>An external challenge or hardship, such as an economic problem, which can lead to suffering.<SEP>An economic problem refers to external challenges impacting individuals, often leading to panic or anxiety when experienced.<SEP>Economic Problem refers to financial challenges that can trigger emotional reactions like panic or anxiety.<SEP>The economic problem is described as an external challenge that can lead to anxiety and suffering.";
