  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Economic unrest is a concept addressed as a reason for peace meditation.<SEP>Economic unrest refers to instability caused by inequitable wealth distribution and exploitative practices.<SEP>Refers to the instability in economic systems addressed through paradigm shifts in wealth creators and leaders.<SEP>Economic Unrest is a problem that requires shifts in thinking and action.<SEP>A state of instability in economic systems, addressed through proposed shifts in leadership and societal values.";
