<urn:mukthiguru:Education> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "YouTube Video: Vr3PS2DdbDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU)<SEP>YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)<SEP>YouTube Video: Ao8Rhhl9E8k (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ao8Rhhl9E8k)<SEP>YouTube Video: nCkbv_lvFfg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nCkbv_lvFfg)<SEP>unknown_source";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Education";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Education is a multifaceted concept that, when combined with spirituality, fosters introspective and purpose-driven learning environments. It serves as an educational framework and metaphor for spiritual development, using grades, academic levels, and degrees to mirror stages of spiritual progression and enlightenment, emphasizing structured learning and self-improvement.

Education also represents intellectual pursuits and learning opportunities that contribute to personal growth, self-awareness, and fulfillment. Within a transformed way of living, education is highlighted as a key relationship to enjoy, and it is proposed as a vehicle for embedding peace principles in children’s development, shaping future leaders and citizens.<SEP>Education is proposed as a vehicle for embedding peace principles in children’s development to shape future leaders and citizens.<SEP>Education is discussed as a critical system under scrutiny for its effectiveness in preparing students for future challenges, with historical references to India's educational heritage.<SEP>Education refers to formal learning systems that shape individuals' career-oriented mindsets and societal expectations.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779672384"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-8542a80600889bb6e804d31658e4ffdd<SEP>chunk-8747b8559b6ab050bd73313beb85bb44<SEP>chunk-1fbe8b29b004fd2a51bfaf808ad4a188<SEP>chunk-70c4972427bbbb91625b1858ddbe811f<SEP>chunk-3671b49c0db3dedf797a14f78cb2a87b<SEP>chunk-79200bb3b73a3f0e6cc0591fef7b2d08<SEP>chunk-6a5c1cd3abe977e04aa0398546d911a7<SEP>chunk-3f4d48e02ed3cffc983ab81c8c5b5555<SEP>chunk-0aa35626964e0e0b383b32633be633be<SEP>chunk-836e578c5eddb352fd28d56ce3144bde" .

