  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Ekam Abundance Festival is an annual event hosted at Ekam, built on principles challenging linear cause-effect assumptions in life.<SEP>Annual festival at Ekam focused on reversing linear cause-effect paradigms through non-local consciousness principles.<SEP>Ekam Abundance Festival is a spiritual event where participants experience transformative experiences and healing.<SEP>Ekam Abundance Festival is an event where participants experience transformations and awakenings, leading to overcoming addictions.<SEP>The Ekam Abundance Festival is a global sports competition featuring top athletes in track and field.<SEP>Ekam Abundance Festival is an event where the individual experienced a massive awakening of the heart and connected with his eldest son.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Ekam Abundance Festival" .

