  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a comprehensive, cohesive summary of the given entity or relation: Ekam World Peace Festival.

We have a list of descriptions in JSON format, each on a new line. The input includes many repeated descriptions and some variations. We need to integrate all key information from every description, without omission, in an objective third-person perspective, mention the full name at the beginning, and produce multiple paragraphs, plain text, no extra formatting, within 600 tokens.

We must handle conflicts: if there are multiple distinct entities or relationships with same name, we would summarize each separately. But here it seems to be the same entity with multiple descriptions. However, there are some variations: some say it's annual, some say it's held in August 2018, some say it's organized by O&O Academy, some say it's a festival, some say it's a global event, some say it's about promoting global harmony, collective consciousness, active participation, meditation, consciousness transformation, spiritual transformation, and that it's a catalyst for Julie's spiritual transformation.

We need to combine.

