  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Enlightened consciousness refers to a state of total awareness and liberation from mental disturbances.<SEP>Enlightened consciousness is described as the ultimate vision of human life, empowering individuals to live fully as partners, parents, friends, or leaders and impact global business dynamics.<SEP>Shiva is depicted as a representation of an enlightened consciousness, symbolizing a state of supreme awareness.<SEP>Enlightened consciousness involves shedding past emotional charges, existing in the eternal present, and transcending desires.<SEP>Enlightened consciousness is a state where negative mental states (anger, hate, arrogance, lust, etc.) are neutralized and rendered harmless, symbolized by the poisonous cobra around Shiva's head.<SEP>Enlightened consciousness is a state that sheds all emotional charges from the past, making it ready for ever-new experiences of life.<SEP>Enlightened consciousness is a state that sheds all emotional charges from the past, making it ready for ever-new experiences of life.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "" .

