Enlightened Festival is a spiritual event associated with Mahashivaratri, a Hindu festival dedicated to Lord Shiva. It focuses on dispelling inner darkness and ignorance through rituals, meditations, and teachings. The festival emphasizes enlightenment by overcoming spiritual ignorance and spreading knowledge. Observers engage in practices to awaken higher consciousness and connect with divine energy.""" .

