<urn:mukthiguru:Enlightened%20State> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Enlightened State is a condition of oneness and great compassion, characterized by the experience of bliss permeating all sensory and mental experiences and by the integration of these experiences into a unified whole. It is described as a state of being free from the matrix of the mind and its four mattresses, which enables intelligent decisions. In this state, individuals are able to channel the universe's intelligence toward positive outcomes such as problem-solving and enlightenment. The enlightened state is also a required mental condition for humans to effectively channel and utilize the universe's inherent intelligence. Furthermore, it represents a transcendent mode of existence free from suffering, emphasized as a transformative goal. The state thus combines compassion, bliss, and integration, and serves as a necessary mental framework for accessing higher intelligence and achieving transformative, suffering‑free existence.<SEP>A state of being free from suffering, associated with awakened consciousness and positive contribution to collective consciousness.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ehkqJ54DIC0)<SEP>YouTube Video: 4Fjf6IQsjQs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4Fjf6IQsjQs)<SEP>YouTube Video: HZIuHUGmnGY (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HZIuHUGmnGY)<SEP>YouTube Video: LapJqYf9hzI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LapJqYf9hzI)";
