  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-6dd6f0aed7fea431a27783bb1609b0ed<SEP>chunk-b4a15d5573c6e5557a85af4c25bbe3f9<SEP>chunk-85ff6540f61eaa4adc3ec9e5f4057b70<SEP>chunk-53a1844f9e75d5bbffcc37eefcf95719<SEP>chunk-0218062ded6a8b7c8b783d92c65d1917";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual teaching or concept definition from the contaminated text provided. The contaminated text includes a lot of developer instructions and prompt templates mixed with the real content about enzymes.

First, I need to identify the real spiritual content. The contaminated text mentions two viewpoints. Viewpoint 1 talks about enzymes being part of cellular communication, biochemical molecules facilitating processes, etc. Viewpoint 2 describes enzymes communicating in a state of Oneness for bodily harmony. 

The task is to remove all the developer instructions, like the structure requirements, the need to integrate viewpoints, and the drafting steps. I should focus only on the actual descriptions of enzymes from both viewpoints. 

Looking at the contaminated text, the key points from Viewpoint 1 are that enzymes are involved in cellular communication, biochemical molecules facilitating metabolic processes, and biological molecules in the human body. Viewpoint 2 states they communicate in Oneness to maintain harmony. 

I need to present these two viewpoints separately in plain English, without any bullet points or headers. The output should be a clean 1-4 sentence description. Since the user specified to return only the spiritual content, I should avoid any mention of the instructions or structure. 

I should check if there's any repetition. The text mentions that Viewpoint 2 is repeated multiple times, but the actual content is the same. So, I'll include it once. 

Putting it all together, the first paragraph covers the scientific aspects of enzymes in communication and metabolism. The second paragraph addresses the spiritual aspect of Oneness and harmony. I need to ensure that the language is concise and flows naturally, combining the points without using any markdown or extra formatting. 

Finally, I'll review to make sure all developer instructions are removed and only the spiritual teachings are present. If there's any uncertainty, but in this case, the content is clear. So the final answer should be""";
