<urn:mukthiguru:Existence> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: PFNP4c1cOSI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PFNP4c1cOSI)<SEP>YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)<SEP>YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)<SEP>YouTube Video: QzJ_Ft1de1o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QzJ_Ft1de1o)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-0ee45ed086ccf00bec8f02b0098563bd<SEP>chunk-ac599df176221b3c1e3e9b33cb62fa37<SEP>chunk-075b8e71a3c71d11c785be4bbfe965ed<SEP>chunk-b85547a9c5ce2c1aff2a86073a2bcb87<SEP>chunk-cd11c060af63780157ebf40717dc0fe2<SEP>chunk-8ac203494cdcc9d8041ac912b2411f28<SEP>chunk-e94d81180e7457d6f36d99965cfbf34d<SEP>chunk-89ddb9ac19fba38ddebc97bcf3b40b3b<SEP>chunk-182703a5f6b3f0b44169765435446675<SEP>chunk-7438d62acfd111c95d021226c6581819";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779656853"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Existence";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Existence is a foundational philosophical concept, described as the state of being or occurring in reality. It is regarded as the fundamental state of being, pure and unadorned, underlying all phenomena. This perspective frames existence as a pure, intrinsic condition that underlies every aspect of reality.

Existence is also characterized as a pure, intrinsic state underlying all phenomena, including life, trees, rain, and human actions. The text describes this as “pure existence,” forming the basis of metaphysical inquiry into intrinsic meaning. In the text, existence is presented as pure and intrinsic, serving as the foundational basis for exploring the intrinsic nature of reality.

Additionally, the description notes that consciousness encompasses all existence, with individuals being part of it. This relationship positions existence as a universal condition that is encompassed within the broader scope of consciousness.<SEP>The state of being or reality, framed as a pure, intrinsic phenomenon in the text.<SEP>Existence is the same as the unitary field of consciousness, existing in all things.<SEP>Existence denotes the state of being or reality, particularly in the context of individual or collective impact.""" .

