  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "{\"Description\": \"We need to produce the final answer: the merged description.\\n\\nWe have to output plain text, multiple paragraphs, no extra formatting.\\n\\nWe need to ensure we mention the full name at the beginning: \\\"Exploitation is a concept that involves taking without regard for the giver’s well‑being, which can lead to economic unrest and cause harm to people, animals, and the environment. It is also described as a harmful practice that can be addressed through inclusive thinking and paradigm shifts.\\n\\nExploitation represents systemic extraction of resources or labor driven by imbalanced power dynamics. In some contexts, it refers specifically to the unethical treatment and endangerment of elephants and natural resources by humans. Additionally, exploitation is characterized by taking advantage of others for personal or political gain. The concept is also noted as something that peace aims to quench, indicating its relevance to broader societal goals.\\\"}<SEP>Exploitation involves taking advantage of others for personal or political gain.<SEP>Exploitation involves taking advantage of others for personal or political gain.<SEP>Exploitation involves taking advantage of others for personal or political gain.<SEP>Exploitation involves taking advantage of others for personal or political gain.";
