  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Fatherhood encompasses various paternal roles (e.g., doting, strict, abusive) and their influence on children through samskaras and karmic evolution.<SEP>Fatherhood encompasses embodying love, connection, and impacting a child's mind, heart, and being through qualities like courage, strength, and wisdom, transcending biological paternity.";
