  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The festival at Akam Kshetra is a spiritual gathering where seekers move into Turiya.<SEP>The festival is a recurring event attended by the father and son, serving as a cultural and spiritual gathering.<SEP>Original incorrect term in the text that was later corrected to \"Limitless Field\".<SEP>The festival serves as a gathering aimed at transforming human consciousness by teaching participants to transcend suffering and contribute positively to collective awareness.<SEP>The festival serves as a gathering aimed at transforming human consciousness by teaching participants to transcend suffering and contribute positively to collective awareness.<SEP>Gathering aimed at teaching participants to live free of suffering and contribute positively to collective consciousness." .

