  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "A unified, boundless expanse where thought and matter are interconnected, central to the practice of Soul Sync.<SEP>The field of consciousness is a conceptual framework representing the collective awareness or energy that interacts with human emotional states.<SEP>Universal consciousness field recognized through spiritual and scientific frameworks.<SEP>The field of consciousness is another concept mentioned as part of the same broader field.<SEP>Field of Consciousness is a philosophical concept representing collective awareness and interconnectedness of all beings.<SEP>Field of consciousness is a term used to describe the indivisible, unitary consciousness, all the Devas, the Suras, and the spirits that pervade other Lokas to Abraham.";
