<urn:mukthiguru:Flying> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Flying is presented as a capability that transitioned from impossible to achievable globally. This transition reflects a significant shift in perception and technological feasibility, indicating that what was once considered unattainable has become possible on a worldwide scale. The description appears consistently across multiple sources, reinforcing the view that the capability of flying has evolved from a theoretical impossibility to a practical reality across the globe.<SEP>Flying is presented as a capability that transitioned from impossible to achievable globally.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779551792"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
