<urn:mukthiguru:Fossil%20Fuels> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "naturalobject";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779251881"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Fossil fuels are energy resources formed from the remains of ancient organisms over millions of years. They consist of hydrocarbons derived from decomposed organic matter, which were buried under the sea or the Earth's surface, resulting in their formation.

These fuels serve as primary energy sources for modern industrial processes, transportation, and the powering of human activities. They are currently central to global energy systems, providing the bulk of energy used worldwide.

Fossil fuels are non-renewable, meaning they cannot be replenished within a human timescale. Their extraction and combustion contribute to environmental strain, including greenhouse gas emissions and other pollutants, leading to targeted reductions in sustainability practices.

Despite their importance, the reliance on fossil fuels is being increasingly scrutinized, with efforts to transition toward renewable energy sources to mitigate environmental impacts and address sustainability concerns.<SEP>Fossil fuels are non-renewable energy sources derived from Earth's resources, linked to environmental strain.<SEP>Fossil fuels are non-renewable energy sources derived from decomposed organic matter, used for energy production and daily activities.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-6586d0e1f5d54248cb5be73a7d3a343a<SEP>chunk-bb29e2ed1d32a5cd538be88c0d484668<SEP>chunk-4565491a2f82c499948bc59bd08ceda8<SEP>chunk-d10d3062cabaaccfc33ac170d7845177<SEP>chunk-29504d0af63a387f3edf40d4bb13cddc<SEP>chunk-323533a8c8c6c9eda38d56c56d637777<SEP>chunk-7c57553df2850654b5a35e1ee26c7149<SEP>chunk-c3c5777bd0aa108885f3e118f2c5486c<SEP>chunk-b83c8b00df8935f2c00062b416bf9b2c<SEP>chunk-e1984cc91b0da578d9648e1604a3db60";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Fossil Fuels" .

