  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Friends are individuals the narrator connects with, perceiving their feelings as their own.<SEP>Friends are the closest people to whom masks are hidden, indicating a state of trust.`<SEP>The friends are mentioned as influencing the decision to attend the event.<SEP>Friends are close companions of the lottery winner who become envious of their wealth.<SEP>Friends are another source of pressure, similarly associated with judgment and dissatisfaction.`<SEP>Friends are individuals connected through mutual affection or shared interests.<SEP>Friends are individuals who are close companions or associates of a person." .

