  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Gandhiji is referred to as Mahatma Gandhi and is associated with the concept of greed and its impact on Mother Earth.<SEP>Gandhiji is referenced for his quote on greed versus need, highlighting human impact on Earth's resources.<SEP>Gandhiji is referenced for his quote on greed versus need, highlighting human impact on Earth's resources.<SEP>Gandhiji is referenced for his quote on greed versus need, highlighting human impact on Earth's resources.";
