<urn:mukthiguru:Gender> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Gender is the basis of discrimination mentioned for most nations.<SEP>Gender discrimination is highlighted as a form of social inequality present in many nations.<SEP>Gender is a social construct used as a basis for discrimination.<SEP>Gender is a social category that does not affect the sense of oneness in the second level.<SEP>Gender is referenced as a social construct that should not dictate opportunities or perceptions in sports or other fields.<SEP>Gender is referenced as a social construct that should not dictate opportunities or perceptions in sports or other fields.<SEP>Gender (man, woman, transgender) is listed as a factor in leader selection criteria.";
