  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fdPQxZsPAwI)<SEP>YouTube Video: pPHQMD3w9-s (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pPHQMD3w9-s)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)<SEP>unknown_source";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The text includes several grammatical corrections, such as changing \"not being capable\" to \"not capable\" and \"life\" to \"lives\".<SEP>Concept involving fixing comma errors in the sentence \"We are falling sick, our friends or relatives, the people we know, are falling sick.\"<SEP>The process of identifying and fixing errors in sentences, such as run-on sentences, fragments, and vague terms, to improve clarity and grammatical correctness.<SEP>The correction involves changing a preposition to fix the error.<SEP>The correction involves changing a preposition to fix the error.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779737165"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
