  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The greater intelligence of the universe is the universal intelligence that humans connect with through mystic ways, fostering oneness and spiritual alignment.<SEP>The greater intelligence of the universe is something meditation helps tune into, aligning the practitioner with universal wisdom.<SEP>The greater intelligence of the universe is accessed through meditation by opening the heart to universal wisdom.<SEP>The greater intelligence of the universe is something meditation helps tune into, aligning the practitioner with universal wisdom.<SEP>The greater intelligence of the universe is accessed through meditation by opening the heart to universal wisdom." .

