  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Greg is a person who undergoes a transformation post-divorce, exhibiting destructive behavior driven by hatred.<SEP>Greg is a man who becomes obsessed with revenge after his divorce, manifesting traits of the destructive self such as emotional imbalance and impulsivity.<SEP>Greg is a financially independent individual who develops a destructive self after divorcing Alicia, driven by resentment and comparison.<SEP>Greg is a person who manifested a destructive self post-divorce, characterized by hatred, aggression, and obsession with retribution.`<SEP>Greg is a character who transitions from submissiveness to aggression post-divorce, driven by pent-up anger.<SEP>Greg is a man who becomes obsessed with retaliating against his ex-wife Alicia after their divorce, driven by pent-up anger and a sense of betrayal.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Greg" .

