  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The Happy Child represents a state of joy, innocence, and freedom from fear or self-centric misery, characterized by radiant smiling, joyful laughter, and deep love.<SEP>The \"happy child\" symbolizes a state of freedom, joy, and authenticity achieved through healing the wounded child.<SEP>The Happy Child symbolizes a state of joy, innocence, and unfiltered emotions free from self-criticism, enabling natural acceptance and forward motion.`<SEP>The Happy Child represents a state of joy and freedom from fear, characterized by resilience and readiness for new experiences.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
