  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The happy child state is a concept discussed in the video, representing a<SEP>The happy child state represents a joyful, carefree emotional condition where one feels connected to the world and experiences universal love.<SEP>The happy child state is a psychological concept characterized by feelings of belonging, love, and kinship transcending cultural, linguistic, and racial boundaries.<SEP>Happy Child State signifies emotional healing and joy achieved via the Soul Sync Exercise, contrasting with the wounded child state.<SEP>The happy child state represents a carefree, joyful mindset free from fear, judgment, or self-centric misery, characterized by unconditional emotions and simplicity.`<SEP>The happy child state embodies joy, trust, and freedom from past burdens, associated with innate innocence and unconditional self-acceptance.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source" .

