  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Pfat_DztMI)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fdPQxZsPAwI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UbCEX5KBbPw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)<SEP>YouTube Video: j7EZJwH8uCM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j7EZJwH8uCM)<SEP>YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)<SEP>YouTube Video: OnAAtrwsfOc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OnAAtrwsfOc)<SEP>YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)<SEP>YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-5d7bc721d374a5cb0cba9dd3f98f763b<SEP>chunk-70c6bbdb11e53c9f8f6f300d287b2520<SEP>chunk-6dd6f0aed7fea431a27783bb1609b0ed<SEP>chunk-56d49489b1f42f899d9566a254886c2c<SEP>chunk-91b2aa787cfc2f8f82f250a6e1012946<SEP>chunk-3372e5d9566c081ee06a41f5a3cb4448<SEP>chunk-65dfea79d783b0403b775689b17817eb<SEP>chunk-8c2cc5514a536fb11e09433f01ed2e85<SEP>chunk-92de552ab3b343ec94bcf5b612359aba<SEP>chunk-ad4544e5cec6ee250e4823e5b924afdf<SEP>chunk-8dc923334a22952ab64751bb371544aa<SEP>chunk-82b4b0dbb1bf7ada138b9c4293afb2ad<SEP>chunk-6ceaf029b184877ef7237e73de7e90eb<SEP>chunk-84fd7b14281eebe067a21784a7a955d0<SEP>chunk-77a2fc8481ea11ffad7cb8ddb5fb08aa<SEP>chunk-85ff6540f61eaa4adc3ec9e5f4057b70<SEP>chunk-3c35da3ef16cded7b3dd200cbc19a5f4<SEP>chunk-b0711a74429c017f31e7a7d0d9eeca01<SEP>chunk-4b35201ea3b2c1a816e4f9f7600e1284<SEP>chunk-cbc63c32944f9f552dca3de43ae2906d<SEP>chunk-fcb0245a76a7b396fd778f0392cfe0f8<SEP>chunk-6988c802643ab5986cfc41940a6f6b44<SEP>chunk-f11387cad436a638d2f57c99446730e6<SEP>chunk-d89831c29a65e71a84017ad0bb3212c4<SEP>chunk-729a868fcc915b32e3804866576c1ee4<SEP>chunk-3c35c8046e4068fa71b3df5521e81022";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779560693"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Health is a multidimensional concept that encompasses physical, mental, and social well‑being and is not to be sacrificed in the pursuit of right action, with happiness being valued. It signifies physical well‑being that can be enhanced through meditative relaxation of the body, and it is the result of perfect communication among cells, enzymes, and neuropeptides. Health also represents the collective presence of three intelligences—body, heart, and consciousness intelligence—and is necessary for manifesting well‑being.

In the context of yoga, health is a current focus and an intended purpose, contrasting with its original spiritual purpose. Health is also described as a stated intended purpose of yoga, with several descriptions emphasizing this role.

Health is defined as a state of complete physical, mental, and social well‑being, which can be negatively impacted by chronic stress, anger, and stress. It is an aspect of well‑being addressed through consciousness law principles, leading to wonderful health outcomes, and is in perfect harmony with domain‑specific principles such as consciousness law, where bodily systems function optimally. At the same time, health is an aspect of life that can be disrupted by chaos.

Health is determined by effective communication between trillions of bodily cells, as per Dr. Rosedale's medical insights. It is also described as a holistic state encompassing the body, mind, and consciousness in harmony, with the capacity to heal and rebuild, and is linked to Mukthi and connection.

Health is a critical factor for longevity, with the planet's health directly impacting the survival and well‑being of all beings. Health is also presented as a blessing that can be felt through the mantra, and is emphasized as essential for longevity.

Health requires attention to individual conditions, as it is linked to the three intelligences: body, heart, and consciousness intelligence. It is also described as a state that requires attention to individual conditions, as it is linked to Mukthi and connection.<SEP>Health refers to physical and mental well-being, negatively impacted by anger and stress.<SEP>Health is discussed in the context of physical decline due to stress and the potential for healing through Oneness consciousness.<SEP>Health represents the physical and mental well-being negatively impacted by persistent brain activity.<SEP>Health refers to the state of complete physical, mental, and social well-being, discussed in the context of stress and anxiety.""" .

