  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "A health crisis is an emergency situation in which the normal healthcare system is overwhelmed or fails to provide adequate care.<SEP>Health crisis is a situation where connection acts as a soothing balm for emotional and physical struggles.<SEP>Health Crisis represents a period of severe physical or mental health challenges, where connection acts as a soothing balm.<SEP>Health crisis refers to a period of significant physical or mental health challenges.<SEP>Health crisis refers to a period of significant physical or mental health challenges affecting individuals.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779219003"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Health Crisis" .

