  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Health practitioners in India, who are contrasted with the sages of India as the origin of yoga.<SEP>Health practitioners in India, who contrast with the sages of India in the emergence of yoga.<SEP>Health Practitioners of India are contrasted with the Sages of India in the text.<SEP>Health practitioners in India, mentioned in the context of yoga's origins not being among them.<SEP>Health practitioners of India associated with the origins of yoga, though the practice actually emerged with the sages.<SEP>Group of health practitioners in India referenced in the video's discussion about yoga's origins, contrasted with enlightened sages.<SEP>A group referenced in the text as a contrasting origin point for yoga, later corrected to the sages of India.";
