  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Heartbreak is the overwhelming pain resulting from the end of a relationship, which can erode trust and vulnerability in future relationships.<SEP>Heartbreak is described as a cyclical emotional trauma resulting from unhealed wounds and repeated relationship failures.<SEP>A state of emotional pain from past relationships that can affect future interactions.<SEP>Heartbreak is described as the most painful human experience, linked to broken relationships and physiological effects like \"broken heart syndrome.\"<SEP>Heartbreak is characterized as the most painful human experience, causing physical heart damage and linked to broken heart syndrome.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779247224"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Heartbreak";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "" .

