\"Home is a multifaceted concept that encompasses the experience of being in one's living space, characterized by acceptance without judgment and seen as part of the universe. It is also defined as a state of non-judgmental observation of one's living environment as it exists. Home symbolizes a state of belonging and inner peace achieved through self-realization. Additionally, Home is the environment where interactions between adults and children occur, particularly regarding pressure. It is viewed as a domestic environment that functions as a family unit under conscious leadership, and is perceived as family by a conscious household leader, representing the household domain. Home also refers to residential spaces where individuals seek freedom and normalcy amidst crises. In the context of freedom and societal constraints, Home can also be understood as the state of being confined indoors.\"

