  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h9S9Hh4aBN8)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zp2w7DTmOwc)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y4ZR5U8VuQY)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M7ItOHTrvz8)<SEP>YouTube Video: qJxGtSDiayM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qJxGtSDiayM)<SEP>YouTube Video: r_l2RNcSPPA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_l2RNcSPPA)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)<SEP>YouTube Video: uZg9XnRub7w (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uZg9XnRub7w)<SEP>YouTube Video: ftFDBaH7RFg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftFDBaH7RFg)<SEP>YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTx4G0KEuUE)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FP5O9F9JiOk)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZaZOJ6gazYM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iikr2xzAK6Y)";
