  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Hubble refers to the Hubble Space Telescope, an astronomical instrument that captures imagery of the cosmos. The telescope's images are often described as symbolizing cosmic beauty and radiant energy, especially in poetic contexts.

In some literary or lyrical references, Hubble is invoked as a source of imagery, contributing to themes of cosmic and natural beauty. The Hubble Space Telescope is also noted for its observations of Earth, which are used to illustrate scientific perspectives on the<SEP>Hubble refers to the Hubble Space Telescope, alluded to in the lyrics as a source of cosmic imagery reflecting Earth's beauty.""";
