Description List:<SEP>The human body is the physical vessel that contains the experience of ecstatic bliss and oneness with all life, as described in the context of Kundalini energy.<SEP>The human body is described as part of a deranged system overwhelmed by excessive stimuli and lack of balance.<SEP>The human body is described as part of a deranged system overwhelmed by excessive stimuli and lack of balance.<SEP>The human body is a biological entity that possesses fighting abilities and releases defense proteins.<SEP>The human body is a biological entity that possesses fighting abilities and releases defense proteins.<SEP>The human body is described as inherently dynamic and subject to aging, contrasting with the pursuit of static perfection.""";
