<urn:mukthiguru:Human%20Consciousness> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """{\"Description\": \"Entity Name: Human Consciousness\\n\\nDescription List:\"}
{\"Description\": \"Human consciousness is a state of awareness that Akin aims to connect and uplift.\"}
{\"Description\": \"Human consciousness refers to the collective mental framework of humanity, currently characterized by self-centeredness and loophole exploitation.\"}
{\"Description\": \"Human consciousness is described as self-centered and prone to creating chaos through loopholes in systems.\"}
{\"Description\": \"Human consciousness is described as a collective state influenced by meditation and values.\"}
{\"Description\": \"Human consciousness is described as having inherent mystical potential, though often constrained by societal lifestyles and values.\"}
{\"Description\": \"Human consciousness is described as possessing inherent mystical potential that has been diminished by modern lifestyles and misplaced values.\"}
{\"Description\": \"Human consciousness refers to the collective awareness and perception shaping societal evolution and legacy.\"}<SEP>Human consciousness is described as rich and capable of extraordinary states through transcendental experiences.<SEP>Human consciousness is described as incredibly rich, capable of higher states through powerful experiences rather than accumulated information.<SEP>Human consciousness is described as incredibly rich, capable of higher states through powerful experiences rather than accumulated information.<SEP>Human Consciousness is incredibly rich and can lead to higher states of consciousness.`""";
