  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a comprehensive, cohesive summary of the entity \"Human Life\" based on the description list. The description list includes many descriptions, some repeated, some contradictory. We must integrate all key information, handle conflicts, and produce a summary in multiple paragraphs, under 600 tokens.

First, let's extract the descriptions:

From the input, we have:

