2. \"Refers to the potential and purpose of human existence, encompassing consciousness, connection, and bodily existence.\"
3. \"Human life is described as undergoing cycles of order and disorder, including birth and death, winning and losing, progress and passivity, and health and ill health.\"
4. \"Human Life involves cyclical patterns of order and disorder, reflecting natural rhythms and societal dynamics.\"
