Additionally, there is a description: \"Human life is filled with moral dilemmas and complexities, requiring guidance from spiritual right action.\" (which is #11)

But note: the input also includes a description that is not part of the list? Actually, the input is messy, but we have the above.

We must also note that the entity name is \"Human Life\".

