<urn:mukthiguru:Hurt> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Hurt";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-98a858d2ad9db1fe93167a9194441c7b<SEP>chunk-ab8b9e8deff04b22db3cfe26b8508b88<SEP>chunk-10c65a85a540bee33fe950b749066f1f<SEP>chunk-d52f636ec1e248fba87af843ffd93511<SEP>chunk-bb336118db8922490b3e05a79c11dba1<SEP>chunk-fa73522aa96594208b9f43ea66a6493e<SEP>chunk-b0b6f9f02020768407fee531e6074a4d<SEP>chunk-d97614999399e6f5f1181bdaebd85f12<SEP>chunk-aaa5c02ef780f417e1e3498aff83c60b<SEP>chunk-5506ec1bf2947c78c3b169a20af36482<SEP>chunk-834da746d2aa7b2a05efc6fe3ab1fc17<SEP>chunk-c18e39fa455d4e81a05127af456a216c<SEP>chunk-bf6e1c8e25957956967b751c441a4ec5<SEP>chunk-fafff025e01a29bbcee9969fc4559382<SEP>chunk-87e2f7787298d3205ec139c556ef83c0<SEP>chunk-d305977f98ef25807e2b5a0d7a24ce2c<SEP>chunk-0e593bb50eabcacd46122f257190fe7f<SEP>chunk-3a5d8d7606e9b8e3d7ef11bf46090954<SEP>chunk-e27a47feac82bbd6f6606fd0582e97d1<SEP>chunk-e346b8f3e13471227b92c08380bf14d1<SEP>chunk-7d201146e40d123c544e6caf9225da91";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Hurt is an entity that, according to the video's analysis of human behavior, is identified as the psychological origin of comparison. This perspective suggests that hurt serves as a foundational factor that drives comparative processes in human cognition and behavior.

Additionally, hurt is described as emotional pain or trauma that arises from past experiences. Such hurt can generate feelings of inadequacy and foster a tendency to compare oneself unfavorably with others, reinforcing negative self-perception.

Furthermore, hurt is characterized as a negative state that has the capacity to perpetuate itself when spread. When individuals share or transmit hurt, it can amplify suffering within a group or community, creating a cycle of increasing distress.<SEP>Hurt is mentioned as a negative state that perpetuates itself when spread, leading to increased suffering.<SEP>One of the negative emotions listed as a consequence of the 70 percent.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779671870"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Js7ongWaW64 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Js7ongWaW64)<SEP>YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)<SEP>YouTube Video: odNtpKqbCQo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odNtpKqbCQo)<SEP>YouTube Video: XFFgRTgP8Rs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XFFgRTgP8Rs)<SEP>YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "" .

