<urn:mukthiguru:Ideals> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779655619"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Ideals";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Ideals are abstract beliefs that may conflict with spiritual right action when prioritized over situational awareness. They are also described as mechanical and self-focused, contrasting with actions rooted in present-moment connection. Additionally, ideals are considered inadequate for leading society toward peace, especially when disconnected from actionable truths.

Ideals represent aspirational principles of unity and equality. The universality of ideals is often contrasted with the reality of societal divisiveness.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-14be37b1d86fb5b82128188406768290<SEP>chunk-0b93a19f07fdaada8a87bb7bfa37fae9<SEP>chunk-638abb6fbdf727a0284e50fe14e82b1f<SEP>chunk-bfec7ed2213b36e2e9d3090ab708cd73<SEP>chunk-08c5fbdcd35ed15300b9915ca1fced8a<SEP>chunk-fb20367827f31cb284dc2e32ba2e1bb0<SEP>chunk-95adc2eca3ca128f7e7b2f4a7bf1a8d6<SEP>chunk-a6affe7a665bbb46d2be844611d794d1<SEP>chunk-8b53cedbcd4de86ef1b08281380f9428<SEP>chunk-bf98c80e4c8e0ceabdc9951dcc42a4ec<SEP>chunk-12740ae94c3469761e52a81015d8effe";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)<SEP>YouTube Video: oSqD_BvF7vA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oSqD_BvF7vA)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)<SEP>YouTube Video: 1PlGMOAypCI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1PlGMOAypCI)";
