  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The immune system is the body's defense mechanism that destroys invading organisms.<SEP>The body's defense mechanism against foreign invaders, which can be negatively impacted by chronic stress and inflammation.<SEP>The immune system is the body's defense mechanism that destroys invading organisms.<SEP>The immune system is a biological system referenced in the meditation stages impacting bodily functions.<SEP>The immune system defends the body against infections and diseases, requiring strengthening to survive in environments with pathogens.";
