<urn:mukthiguru:Indian%20Cricket%20Team%20Captain> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779700991"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Indian Cricket Team Captain";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """The Indian Cricket Team Captain is the leader of the Indian national cricket team, guiding the squad and making strategic decisions that directly influence the team's performance. The captain's role is central to on-field outcomes, as their leadership and choices during matches can significantly affect results.

In the context of a transcription error discussion, the term \"Indian Cricket Team Captain\" is frequently referenced, underscoring the need for precise identification of the captain's name and role, especially when handling textual data that may contain inaccuracies. The repeated appearance of the same description across multiple instances highlights the consistency of the term within cricket discourse, even when errors occur. This consistency ensures that the captain's identity and contributions are accurately represented.

Overall, the Indian Cricket Team Captain remains a pivotal element in both the execution of the team's strategies and the accurate portrayal of cricket-related information. The captain's decisions and leadership are integral to the team's success, and the term's consistent use in discourse reflects its importance in maintaining clarity and precision in cricket-related communications.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-d1e543707be2e55d7f92f83bb1c9223e";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "person" .

