  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Individual refers to the primary unit of societal transformation through personal spiritual practice and consciousness evolution.><SEP>Individual refers to every person, emphasizing their role in fostering oneness and connection through actions.<SEP>An individual experiencing suffering and inner disturbance.<SEP>An individual's state of suffering creates disconnection and division, impacting planetary health.<SEP>An individual nurturing positive emotional states (joy, love, connection, peace, calm) and rewiring their brain to live in completeness.<SEP>An individual nurturing positive emotional states (joy, love, connection, peace, calm) and rewiring their brain to live in completeness.<SEP>An individual who can exist in a beautiful state, affecting others and contributing to family dynamics.";
