  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779672383"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Inner State refers to the emotional and mental condition of an individual, serving as the foundation for life. It is described as a subjective, introspective mental or emotional space where connection with others is cultivated.

Inner state is portrayed as natural and reflective in daily life, central to the concept of spirituality. It is associated with experiencing life's aspects and is considered a beautiful inner state of being.

Inner State is referenced in the context of spiritual vision and connection practices. It is viewed as a natural, reflective condition that supports spiritual vision and connection, and as a foundation for life.<SEP>Inner state refers to a person's internal awareness and consciousness, central to the described spiritual practices.<SEP>Inner State describes an individual's subjective experience and emotional condition, influencing their interactions and family dynamics.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-57a709334836e0a4dc7c14a173461dce<SEP>chunk-9068ddb93a07ecf743249c1b3afe8709<SEP>chunk-c9bf814a48dc1240281eb32fd8bfe8b4<SEP>chunk-e5a28c3bc026d600e209a66303560b8e<SEP>chunk-6333458ab425b6d36a113393a04c6884<SEP>chunk-aaa5c02ef780f417e1e3498aff83c60b<SEP>chunk-a6ebf53761366dcfd806d1bd7405b9ee<SEP>chunk-76149e88e75ab43aa17ddf5959e26b51<SEP>chunk-1a4e20db18753630cc0835f806d71f29<SEP>chunk-b37ece05c6dd07c4fd1c02e2cefb7912<SEP>chunk-80b6135a8c5f98aa06b34dde60b95f6b<SEP>chunk-c3ed34f47b9c5ac6f04c21ce288a22da<SEP>chunk-cdbfc6e200f4cd4487961cefed0a0954<SEP>chunk-6f4b86894bf06d07d9095036ac74d620<SEP>chunk-2596b0f6fe118e104aa7005b1e2d7f81<SEP>chunk-5d8f3893ed8d4a9bbfe512ce1d2b7944<SEP>chunk-6a5c1cd3abe977e04aa0398546d911a7<SEP>chunk-6a05be89bdb9093be2522608eb8c0a87<SEP>chunk-3d3e1db7059b50ed67e675540955de81<SEP>chunk-287c3c0f3f95498058ee40d18602c6a5<SEP>chunk-c47a850c80a21ed6c67cbed2bc4b8ec0<SEP>chunk-f367b232a1868597453e46a0827c00ef<SEP>chunk-8214f902f81ebb0b2df3cc231089a8c7<SEP>chunk-836e578c5eddb352fd28d56ce3144bde";
