  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Inner void describes a painful emotional state resulting from unfulfilled relational needs.<SEP>Inner void refers to emotional emptiness created by holding onto aversion, prompting reliance on temporary fixes.<SEP>An inner void is created by holding onto a state of disrespect and fragmented self, leading to temporary fixes.<SEP>The Inner Void refers to Mike's unaddressed feelings of inadequacy and emptiness that he attempted to fill through wealth and success.";
