  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fdPQxZsPAwI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ehkqJ54DIC0)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZGvKY4mPfIc)<SEP>YouTube Video: utRatnFr-S8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=utRatnFr-S8)<SEP>YouTube Video: k8iO5daXllM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k8iO5daXllM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=07NOYJmkkFo)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a merged description of the entity \"Intelligence\". The input includes a list of JSON objects, each with a \"Description\" field. The first description is longer, covering multiple aspects: concept mentioned in text, part of list of concepts, key idea within conceptual framework, repeated mention underscores importance, systematic organization, positioned alongside other abstract notions, related to brain, neural structure, heart, spine, indicating connection to physiological components, foundational element emerging from interaction of these structures. Also, represented as an interconnected concept observed in nature, encompassing tree, bird, human, broader application beyond human context, showing presence across different forms of life.

The subsequent descriptions are all identical: \"A concept representing the interconnected intelligence observed in nature, including the tree, bird, and human.\"

Thus, we need to synthesize a comprehensive summary that integrates all key information from every description. Must be objective, third-person, mention the full name of the entity at the beginning. Must be multiple paragraphs, plain text, no extra formatting. Must not exceed 600 tokens. Must be in English.

We need to handle conflicts: The first description includes multiple aspects, while the rest are just the same concept. There's no conflict; we can combine.

We need to ensure we include all key points: concept mentioned in text, part of list of concepts, key idea within conceptual framework, repeated mention underscores importance, systematic organization, positioned alongside other abstract notions, related to brain, neural structure, heart, spine, indicating connection to physiological components, foundational element emerging from interaction of these structures, and also the concept of interconnected intelligence observed in nature, encompassing tree, bird, human, broader application beyond human context.

We need to produce a cohesive summary, perhaps in two paragraphs: first paragraph covering the textual and conceptual aspects, second paragraph covering the natural and physiological aspects.

We must keep within 600 tokens. Let's count roughly: each token is roughly a word. We need to be concise.

We need to mention the entity name: \"Intelligence\".

We need to be objective, third-person.

We need to avoid extraneous comments.

We need to output plain text.

