<urn:mukthiguru:Jealousy> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Jealousy is a concept that, along with anger and suspicion, can grow and consume a person.<SEP>Jealousy is a greed-related state dissolved during the spiritual process of Navratri.<SEP>A suffering state arising from feeling lesser than others in love or status.<SEP>Jealousy is an emotion conflicting with the selflessness of true friendship.";
