  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Jeevan Mukta refers to an awakened state of being liberated from worldly attachments, leading to union with Universal Consciousness.<SEP>Jeevan Mukta refers to a state of liberation in Indian philosophy where an individual is free from rebirth and worldly attachments.<SEP>Jeevan Mukta refers to a state of liberation where the afterlife is experienced as progressive blissfulness until union with Universal Consciousness or Brahman.";
