  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779185993"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Julie is a romance writer who attended the Ekam World Peace Festival and reflected on her desire for her boyfriend’s health.<SEP>Julie is a person who experiences physical pain, gains insights at Ekam, and faces relationship challenges with her boyfriend.<SEP>Julie is a person who experienced transcendental compassion at Ekam and resolves to avoid cruelty toward her boyfriend despite internal conflicts about self-sacrifice and universal intelligence.<SEP>Julie is a person who has transformed her relationship with her inner state and the universe through sacred secrets.<SEP>Julie is a romance writer who experiences a profound transformation in her understanding of love, health, and her relationship with the universe after attending the Ekam World Peace Festival.<SEP>Julie is a romance writer who experiences a profound transformation in her understanding of love, health, and her relationship with the universe after attending the Ekam World Peace Festival." .

