  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Julie's boyfriend is a person with chronic pain, whose experiences influence Julie's perspective.<SEP>Julie's boyfriend is a person with a chronic illness, whose pain becomes a catalyst for Julie's spiritual awakening and realization about universal intelligence.<SEP>Julie's boyfriend is a person with a chronic illness, whose pain becomes a catalyst for Julie's spiritual awakening and realization about universal intelligence.";
