  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a comprehensive, cohesive summary of the given entity \"Justice System\". The input is a list of JSON objects, each with a \"Description\" field. The descriptions are all about urging the justice system to treat women as equals to promote fairness, with some variations: some mention eliminating biases, ensuring same rights, responsibilities, outcomes, fostering equitable environment, etc. Some mention addressing gender inequalities.

We need to synthesize into a single summary, multiple paragraphs, plain text, no extra formatting. Must be objective, third-person, mention the full name of the entity at the beginning. Must not exceed 600 tokens. Must be in English.

We need to ensure we incorporate all key information: the call for equal treatment of women, the aim to ensure same rights, responsibilities, outcomes, eliminate biases, systemic discrimination, foster just and equitable environment, repeated emphasis, significance of gender equality as core objective, addressing gender inequalities.

We need to handle conflicts: there are no conflicting descriptions; they are consistent. So we just summarize.

We need to keep length under 600 tokens. Let's count roughly: each description is about 30-40 words. There are 7 descriptions. So total maybe 250-300 words. That's fine.

We need to produce multiple paragraphs. Possibly 2-3 paragraphs.

We need to start with \"The Justice System is ...\". Actually the entity name is \"Justice System\". So we can start: \"The Justice System is being urged to treat women as equals to promote fairness.\" Then elaborate.

We need to be objective, third-person.

We need to mention the full name of the entity at the beginning.

We need to ensure we don't omit any important facts.

We need to handle the repeated emphasis: \"The repeated emphasis on this principle across multiple statements underscores the significance of gender equality as a core objective for the justice system.\"

We need to incorporate the idea of eliminating biases and disparities, ensuring same rights, responsibilities, outcomes, fostering a more just and equitable legal environment.

We need to mention that the justice system is being urged to treat women as equals to promote fairness, and that this call is repeated across multiple statements, indicating significance.

We need to mention that the justice system is discussed as needing to treat women as equals, addressing gender inequalities.

We need to ensure we mention the objective: fairness, equality, eliminating biases, etc.

We need to keep it within 600 tokens. Let's draft.

Paragraph 1: Introduce the Justice System and the call to treat women as equals.

Paragraph 2: Explain the aims: same rights, responsibilities, outcomes; eliminating biases; fostering equitable environment; repeated emphasis.

Paragraph 3: Mention that the justice system is also discussed as addressing gender inequalities, and that gender equality is a core objective.

We need to ensure we mention the entity name at the beginning.

Let's draft:

\"The Justice System is being urged to treat women as equals to promote fairness. This call for equal treatment of women within the justice system aims to ensure that all individuals, regardless of gender, receive the same rights, responsibilities, and outcomes under the law. By emphasizing equality, the demand seeks to eliminate biases and disparities that may arise from systemic discrimination, thereby fostering a more just and equitable legal environment. The repeated emphasis on this principle across multiple statements underscores the significance of gender equality as a core objective for the justice system.\"

That's one paragraph. Then we can add:

\"Additionally, the justice system is discussed as needing to treat women as equals, addressing gender inequalities that persist in legal processes. The repeated emphasis on gender equality across multiple statements highlights its importance as a central goal for achieving fairness and justice within the system.\"

But we need to keep within 600 tokens. Let's count tokens.

We need to count tokens: each token is roughly a word. Let's count.

Paragraph 1: \"The Justice System is being urged to treat women as equals to promote fairness. This call for equal treatment of women within the justice system aims to ensure that all individuals, regardless of gender, receive the same rights, responsibilities, and outcomes under the law. By emphasizing equality, the demand seeks to eliminate biases and disparities that may arise from systemic discrimination, thereby fostering a more just and equitable legal environment. The repeated emphasis on this principle across multiple statements underscores the significance of gender equality as a core objective for the justice system.\"

Count words: Let's count manually.

\"The\" (1) \"Justice\" (2) \"System\" (3) \"is\" (4) \"being\" (5) \"urged\" (6) \"to\" (7) \"treat\" (8) \"women\" (9) \"as\" (10) \"equals\" (11) \"to\" (12) \"promote\" (13) \"fairness.\" (14) \"This\" (15) \"call\" (16) \"for\" (17) \"equal\" (18) \"treatment\" (19) \"of\" (20) \"women\" (21) \"within\" (22) \"the\" (23) \"justice\" (24) \"system\" (25) \"aims\" (26) \"to\" (27) \"ensure\" (28) \"that\" (29) \"all\" (30) \"individuals,\" (31) \"regardless\" (32) \"of\" (33) \"gender,\" (34) \"receive\" (35) \"the\" (36) \"same\" (37) \"rights,\" (38) \"responsibilities,\" (39) \"and\" (40) \"outcomes\" (41) \"under\" (42) \"the\" (43) \"law.\" (44) \"By\" (45) \"emphasizing\" (46) \"equality,\" (47) \"the\" (48) \"demand\" (49) \"seeks\" (50) \"to\" (51) \"eliminate\" (52) \"biases\" (53) \"and\" (54) \"disparities\" (55) \"that\" (56) \"may\" (57) \"arise\" (58) \"from\" (59) \"systemic\" (60) \"discrimination,\" (61) \"thereby\" (62) \"fostering\" (63) \"a\" (64) \"more\" (65) \"just\" (66) \"and\" (67) \"equitable\" (68) \"legal\" (69) \"environment.\" (70) \"The\" (71) \"repeated\" (72) \"emphasis\" (73) \"on\" (74) \"this\" (75) \"principle\" (76) \"across\" (77) \"multiple\" (78) \"statements\" (79) \"underscores\" (80) \"the\" (81) \"significance\" (82) \"of\" (83) \"gender\" (84) \"equality\" (85) \"as\" (86) \"a\" (87) \"core\" (88) \"objective\" (89) \"for\" (90) \"the\" (91) \"justice\" (92) \"system.\" (93)

So about 93 words.

Paragraph 2: \"Additionally, the justice system is discussed as needing to treat women as equals, addressing gender inequalities that persist in legal processes. The repeated emphasis on gender equality across multiple statements highlights its importance as a central goal for achieving fairness and justice within the system.\"

Count words:

\"Additionally,\" (1) \"the\" (2) \"justice\" (3) \"system\" (4) \"is\" (5) \"discussed\" (6) \"as\" (7) \"needing\" (8) \"to\" (9) \"treat\" (10) \"women\" (11) \"as\" (12) \"equals,\" (13) \"addressing\" (14) \"gender\" (15) \"inequalities\" (16) \"that\" (17) \"persist\" (18) \"in\" (19) \"legal\" (20) \"processes.\" (21) \"The\" (22) \"repeated\" (23) \"emphasis\" (24) \"on\" (25) \"gender\" (26) \"equality\" (27) \"across\" (28) \"multiple\" (29) \"statements\" (30) \"highlights\" (31) \"its\" (32) \"importance\" (33) \"as\" (34) \"a\" (35) \"central\" (36) \"goal\" (37) \"for\" (38) \"achieving\" (39) \"fairness\" (40) \"and\" (41) \"justice\" (42) \"within\" (43) \"the\" (44) \"system.\" (45)

So about 45 words.

Total words ~138. That's well under 600 tokens.

We need to ensure we mention the entity name at the beginning. Already did: \"The Justice System is being urged...\"

We need to ensure we mention the full name of the entity or relation at the beginning of the summary to ensure immediate clarity and context. We did.

We need to ensure we are objective, third-person. Yes.

We need to ensure we mention the repeated emphasis. Yes.

We need to ensure we mention the aim: same rights, responsibilities, outcomes, eliminating biases, fostering equitable environment. Yes.

We need to mention that the justice system is discussed as needing to treat women as equals, addressing gender inequalities. Yes.

We need to ensure we don't omit any important facts. The descriptions also mention \"ensuring that all individuals, regardless of gender, receive the same rights, responsibilities, and outcomes under the law.\" We included that.

We also mention \"systemic discrimination\" and \"bias and disparities.\" Yes.

