  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Karmic energy represents the transfer of consciousness and states between generations, influencing family patterns and behaviors.<SEP>Karmic energy refers to the cyclical consequences of actions, influencing spiritual and emotional states.<SEP>Karmic energy refers to the cyclical consequences of actions, influencing spiritual and emotional states.<SEP>Karmic energy is a force that can be negative or positive, and forgiving oneself can break its flow." .

