<urn:mukthiguru:Krishna> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-9631a67f046d45e3e2ba8f3d8b8dfbfd<SEP>chunk-26b56a81ecc68984178f2485406fb618<SEP>chunk-672a64891a721958057240b2cc83a897<SEP>chunk-adf8cda164a53953c2d871599de03c16<SEP>chunk-d4970d6b99dd25f2175abb5b84e2f52c<SEP>chunk-d0968f5f92c9347abb58d844c3aec5da<SEP>chunk-a86eca0b1f90f6c49a60c38f2bf9272a";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Krishna";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: pmSPHJfg3AU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pmSPHJfg3AU)<SEP>YouTube Video: WfkCDNu4SuE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WfkCDNu4SuE)<SEP>YouTube Video: ftFDBaH7RFg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftFDBaH7RFg)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "person";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual content about Krishna from the contaminated text provided. The contaminated text includes a lot of developer notes and instructions mixed in with the real content.

First, I need to go through each point in the contaminated text and identify which ones are actual descriptions of Krishna. The first few points mention Krishna as a peacemaker involved in the Peace Voice and Just Peace Movement, part of the group associated with Peace Voice, a central figure in Hinduism linked to divine love and spiritual teachings, and then there's a note that's ambiguous. Then there's a mention of association with Navratri and the feminine, and multiple mentions of being a central character in the Mahabharata known for wisdom and divine role.

The developer notes discuss how to handle the ambiguous note and conflicts between the Navratri mentions. But I need to ignore those. The key is to extract only the actual spiritual teachings or factual content. 

So, the real content points are:
1. Peacemaker in Peace Voice and Just Peace Movement.
2. Part of the group associated with Peace Voice.
3. Central figure in Hinduism, divine love, spiritual teachings, not tied to Navratri here.
