  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Krishna Ji is the correct spelling for the term \"Krishnaji\".<SEP>Krishna Ji is a revered teacher and leader known for his structured teachings on consciousness, lived authenticity, and guiding participants toward awakened states.<SEP>Krishna Ji is a spiritual leader known for his teachings, guidance, and embodiment of truthful, calm, and loving principles.<SEP>A spiritual figure referenced in the text, collaborating with Akam to challenge traditional gender norms in spirituality.<SEP>Krishna Ji is a spiritual teacher who discusses enlightenment and happiness, addressing students and the challenges of the hungry mind.<SEP>Krishna Ji is a spiritual teacher who discusses enlightenment and happiness, addressing students and the challenges of the hungry mind.<SEP>Krishna ji is a person addressed in the context of high expectations and stress.";
