<urn:mukthiguru:Leadership> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Leadership";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: fiABnex9O6Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fiABnex9O6Y)<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UJM00IqGKtc)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779647916"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Leadership is the practice of guiding others through transformative change and fostering collective growth. It is a transformative process guided by wisdom and compassion, nurturing collective development and enabling individuals and groups to evolve together. By facilitating change and steering toward shared objectives, leadership creates an environment where transformation and development are mutually reinforcing, promoting both personal and collective growth.

Leadership roles influenced by societal gender refer to the ways in which gender dynamics shape leadership positions and practices. This aspect highlights how societal gender norms affect who assumes leadership roles and how leadership is exercised, adding a layer of complexity to the broader concept of leadership.<SEP>Leadership roles influenced by societal gender<SEP>The practice of guiding others, influenced by one's internal state and values.<SEP>Leadership is a concept often misunderstood as merely holding a position or authority over others.<SEP>Leadership is discussed as a concept where equating it solely to position or authority over others is deemed flawed.<SEP>Leadership is discussed as a concept where equating it solely to position or authority over others is deemed flawed.<SEP>Leadership is a concept often misunderstood as merely holding a position or authority over others.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-94684d3c1e91618d6299c39872dafbdf<SEP>chunk-57c07a0512777570587c500dccd8311d<SEP>chunk-f11387cad436a638d2f57c99446730e6<SEP>chunk-fb34444d5342f0a266be4edca9184fcf<SEP>chunk-330c229b9775dad36da206ebfc157ab5<SEP>chunk-550dc3fe2d86679425efdc1841d6bee3" .

