  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "{\"Description\": \"The \\\"life giver\\\" is a concept representing an entity that provides or sustains life, emphasized as being more significant than life itself in the context of celebration.\"}<SEP>The Life Giver is a concept symbolizing the source of all life, closely tied to the celebration of interconnectedness with nature.<SEP>The Life Giver is a concept symbolizing the source of all life, closely tied to the celebration of interconnectedness with nature.<SEP>The Life Giver is a concept symbolizing the source of all life, closely tied to the celebration of interconnectedness with nature.<SEP>Life Giver is a conceptual term in the text relating to entities that sustain life.";
