  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a merged description for the entity \"Limitless Field Meditation\". The input includes a list of descriptions (JSON objects) each on a new line. However, the provided input is not exactly in the format described: it's a block of text that includes the entity name and then a list of descriptions. But we must treat the entire input as the description list.

