  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Domain-specific term describing boundless, unrestricted joy as a spiritual state.<SEP>Limitless Joy is an unbounded state of happiness and bliss, considered a spiritual achievement.<SEP>Limitless joy describes an unbounded, profound sense of happiness not tied to material circumstances.`<SEP>Domain-specific term describing boundless, unrestricted joy as a spiritual state.<SEP>Limitless Joy is an unbounded state of happiness and bliss, considered a spiritual achievement.<SEP>Limitless joy describes an unbounded, profound sense of happiness not tied to material circumstances.`";
