  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "A loved one is an individual whose presence is perceived as irreplaceable and deeply impactful, evoking profound feelings of love and connection.<SEP>A loved one is an individual whose presence is perceived as irreplaceable and deeply impactful, evoking profound feelings of love and connection.<SEP>A loved one is perceived as irreplaceable, with their passing highlighting the sacredness of their presence in life.<SEP>A loved one is an individual within one’s soul circle who receives focused attention and becomes central to the healing dynamic.";
