  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Magic";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Magic refers to the positive and transformative experiences, such as synchronicities, that arise from a state of abundance consciousness.<SEP>Unexplained phenomena that enrich life and contribute to a sense of wonder.<SEP>Magic represents the sense of wonder and extraordinary experiences that arise from abundance consciousness, enhancing life's richness.<SEP>Magic symbolizes extraordinary outcomes and harmonious connections arising from aligned consciousness.<SEP>Magic is used as a rhetorical device to emphasize the abstract and repetitive nature of the struggle.<SEP>A repeated word symbolizing a theme or concept, possibly representing power, mystery, or a central motif in the text.<SEP>Magic is a repeated term in the text, potentially symbolizing a concept, spell, or abstract idea, though its exact nature is unspecified in the input.";
