Tokens: Across (1) multiple (2) descriptions (3), the (4) Magnificent (5) Black (6) Bird (7) consistently (8) symbolizes (9) nature's (10) cycle (11), with (12) its (13) lizard-carrying (14) behavior (15) serving (16) as (17) a (18) metaphor (19) for (20) the (21) ongoing (22) cycle (23) of (24) life (25) and (26) death (27). The (28) symbolism (29) underscores (30) the (31) natural (32) order (33) and (34) the (35) perpetual (36) renewal (37) inherent (38) in (39) ecosystems (40). So about 40 tokens.

