  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Maha Shivaratri is the mystic night of oneness, observed through inward meditation to unite with Mahadeva and experience divine consciousness.<SEP>Maha Shivaratri is the mystic night of oneness, during which meditation is performed to enter the realm of consciousness and unite with Mahadeva.<SEP>Maha Shivaratri is the mystic night of oneness, observed through inward meditation to unite with Mahadeva and experience divine consciousness.<SEP>Maha Shivaratri is the mystic night of oneness, during which meditation is performed to enter the realm of consciousness and unite with Mahadeva.";
