<urn:mukthiguru:Mahabharata> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Mahabharata";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """The Mahabharata is an ancient Indian epic that has shaped cultural and historical narratives, including the portrayal of characters such as Parvati, Shri Krishna, and Arjuna. It is also used to illustrate responses to inner violence and emotional conflict. The epic details a great war and its characters, serving as a narrative framework for exploring complex moral and philosophical themes.

Beyond the war, the Mahabharata delves into the concepts of Dharma, conflict, and non-violence, emphasizing principles like Ahimsa. Its characters, such as Shri Krishna and Arjuna, embody these ideas, and the epic is often cited as an epic that discusses these principles. The text also references the game Gilly, indicating its inclusion of diverse elements beyond the central conflict.

Overall, the Mahabharata stands as a comprehensive ancient Indian epic that integrates cultural narratives, philosophical discourse, and character-driven storytelling. It continues to influence cultural and historical understanding, offering insights into the human condition through its exploration of war, morality, and spiritual principles.<SEP>The Mahabharata is an ancient Indian epic that discusses principles like Ahimsa and features characters such as Shri Krishna and Arjuna.<SEP>The Mahabharata is a significant event in Indian history and culture, referenced in the analysis.<SEP>Mahabharata is an ancient Indian epic cited in the text and part of the required terms.<SEP>The Mahabharata is an ancient Indian epic depicting the Kurukshetra War and philosophical debates.`<SEP>The ancient Indian epic that explores the moral and ethical dilemmas faced by the Pandavas, including the concept of Dharma Sankhata.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-a265fa7ca94330810bb78b19f99a2ea9<SEP>chunk-8bc46e0d57c8aca69ad6ab17dc5cfd03<SEP>chunk-dadf662841fb50b7a5b2c3f5fc8512f2<SEP>chunk-d0968f5f92c9347abb58d844c3aec5da<SEP>chunk-4529c1884cd3f5e14f3ad9c161d86e76<SEP>chunk-31d0c1d0868a0433b37bd7b3d6982020<SEP>chunk-9d3dc0d7e3d5f00409884918b93104a2<SEP>chunk-a86eca0b1f90f6c49a60c38f2bf9272a<SEP>chunk-5139546d120bc87201fc62ee64d86e4c<SEP>chunk-151ea8496c9d62859f2ebee56a03be85";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 1_-cZz8YRFw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1_-cZz8YRFw)<SEP>YouTube Video: ftFDBaH7RFg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftFDBaH7RFg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)";
