  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The Mahabharata war is cited as an example of a conflict where victory did not bring joy.<SEP>The Mahabharata War is an ancient conflict resulting in massive loss of life and familial destruction, illustrating the futility of war.<SEP>The Mahabharata War is an ancient conflict resulting in massive loss of life and familial destruction, illustrating the futility of war.<SEP>The Mahabharata War is a historical conflict referenced in the discussion." .

