  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a merged description of the entity \"Marriage\". The input includes a description list: first description is a longer description about marriage as a social institution, with details about India, societal pressures, spiritual practices. Then many repeated short descriptions: \"Marriage is mentioned as a significant life event in the context of spiritual practices.\" - Correct.

