  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Meditate is a corrected spelling of the word \"Mediate\" from the original text.<SEP>Meditate is the correct method of meditation, involving chanting the Hamsa Soham Ekam mantra.<SEP>Meditate is the correct verb that should replace \"mediate\" in the text.<SEP>Meditate refers to practices aimed at fostering inner peace and collective consciousness.<SEP>Meditate is a practice involving focused attention and mindfulness, recommended for stress reduction and cognitive benefits.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "method" .

