  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a comprehensive, cohesive summary of the entity \"Meditation Practice\" based on the given descriptions. The output must be plain text, multiple paragraphs, no extra formatting, within 600 tokens. Must be objective, third-person, mention full name at beginning.

