Paragraph 3: Discuss neural effects: sustained practice can reverse limbic dominance over prefrontal cortex, rewire neural pathways, reduce amygdala activity, enhance prefrontal cortex function, achieve thought coherence.

Paragraph 4: Summarize overall purpose: fostering unity with family and the divine, achieving thought coherence, etc.

