  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Meditations are practices that utilize the Transformation Triad to promote calm, clarity, health, vigor, and vitality by harmonizing mind, breath, and consciousness.<SEP>Meditations are practices aimed at shifting one's mental state from suffering to beautiful.<SEP>Meditations are practices that help individuals achieve a state of calm and quiet, beyond suffering.<SEP>Meditations refer to ancient practices crafted by the O&O Academy, offered through the Breathing Room platform to achieve relaxation and calm.<SEP>Meditations are spiritual practices designed to invite divine consciousness and deepen parental connection during pregnancy.<SEP>Meditations are practices aimed at achieving states of well-being, calm, peace, and serenity, including spontaneous or induced experiences.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
