  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual teaching or concept from the contaminated text provided. The contaminated text includes a lot of developer instructions and prompt templates mixed with the real content about Mike.

First, I need to identify the real spiritual content. The descriptions mention Mike's professional role as a CEO, his personal struggles like arrogance and jealousy, his existential crisis during a meditation journey, and his transformation through a self-reflection course. The themes include ignoring inner feelings and prioritizing external success over self-awareness, and a shift towards the greater good.

I should remove all the developer instructions, which are the parts about synthesizing summaries, handling conflicts, and the technical requirements. The key points are Mike's journey from arrogance and downfall to transformation and self-awareness. The spiritual elements here are the existential fear, life review, meditation, and the transformation towards the greater good. The themes of self-awareness and inner feelings versus external success are also part of the spiritual teaching.

I need to condense this into 1-4 sentences without bullet points or headers. Make sure it's in plain English and only the essential spiritual content. Let me check if there's any UNPARSEABLE content. No, there's clear spiritual elements here. So the clean description should cover his role, struggles, existential aspects, transformation, and the themes involved.
</think>

Mike is a CEO of a successful architecture firm who faces downfall due to arrogance and jealousy, prompting existential fear and a life review during a meditation journey. His struggles with inadequacy, hollow success, and fear of being a \"nobody\" lead him to a transformative four-day self-reflection course. Through this process, he confronts prioritizing external success over self-awareness and shifts from negative motivations to pursuing the greater good via knowledge utilization. The narrative illustrates the consequences of ignoring inner feelings and the potential for renewal through introspection and conscious transformation""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-7503a6ae65b185937e995c2f50e85b5c<SEP>chunk-cd472120781d30f6deb417cdc30ee13c<SEP>chunk-b8797891f91bec3ca8041425168acbf1<SEP>chunk-4254fba3cd08eeac830728e39c9bc049<SEP>chunk-200c896d057fae8b41a69675f296365e<SEP>chunk-a3883befbc3677e763ade9f571892747<SEP>chunk-2093a273636983f00fe7dc86ea163faa<SEP>chunk-d564739567a16e99326ecc627fbd4051<SEP>chunk-ecbc3c2d763ada03509e65f05c56b79c";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Mike" .

