<urn:mukthiguru:Modern%20Science> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W2ZzApmqJmo)<SEP>unknown_source";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Modern Science";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual teaching or concept definition from the contaminated text provided. The contaminated text includes a lot of developer instructions and prompt templates mixed with the real content.

First, I need to identify the real spiritual content. The contaminated text talks about \"Modern Science\" and mentions two concepts. The first is a speculative research effort to conquer death through technology. The second is the historical scientific approach from the 16th century emphasizing a mechanical universe. The rest of the text is about how to handle the conflict between these two concepts in a summary.

My job is to remove all the developer instructions and just present the actual concepts. The user specified that the output should be a clean 1-4 sentence description in plain English. So I need to make sure I only include the two concepts without any extra formatting or explanations.

Looking at the contaminated text, the key points are the two distinct concepts of Modern Science. The first is speculative and forward-looking, aiming to conquer death via technology. The second is the historical approach from the 16th century with the mechanical universe. The rest of the text is about how to structure the summary, which I need to ignore.

I should start by stating that Modern Science can refer to two concepts. Then explain each one briefly. Make sure to mention the 16th century and the mechanical universe for the historical part. For the speculative part, highlight the technology and conquering death. Keep it concise, within 4 sentences. Avoid any bullet points or headers. Just plain text.

Check if there's any other spiritual content. The text doesn't mention anything else, so those two concepts are the main points. No need to include the instructions or the process of handling the conflict. Just the clean description.

So the final answer should be two sentences: one introducing the two concepts, then each explained in a sentence. Make sure it's objective and third-person. No markdown, just plain English""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-8afdbda86ff5c184cd2f7d6fbf294ca1<SEP>chunk-3ac76af31c236939fa98f5d5574ffb7e";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779753791"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long> .

