  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "A mother sheep who shelters the lion cub, believing it to be her own offspring.<SEP>The mother sheep who raises the lion cub and provides guidance about his identity.<SEP>The mother sheep is a character who advises the lion cub to stop fantasizing, influencing his initial self-perception and behavior.<SEP>A mother sheep adopted the lion cub, raising him as her own offspring.<SEP>A sheep who adopts the lion cub, symbolizing societal norms that suppress individuality and enforce conformity.`";
