  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-654ba1397813fb7e7e5aa81442780460<SEP>chunk-8a7ee2b153604655187d4badb11b11d8<SEP>chunk-77a2fc8481ea11ffad7cb8ddb5fb08aa<SEP>chunk-bf6e1c8e25957956967b751c441a4ec5<SEP>chunk-455b55d980a3e2c6f3cdef877e6b40b1<SEP>chunk-1a7e64bb8a0d59d10204b5dfcccfe785<SEP>chunk-82a093ab08d9f314edca90dbf19072fc<SEP>chunk-e0280d57f075227c7dc8487c44357147<SEP>chunk-4b54aa8a9252857e691b1304a2061fad<SEP>chunk-5c1ed637dca2d0d131d85c8ff4dd33cb<SEP>chunk-91d9f7cb805ef23f08d79985435c1fe6";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779557245"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual content from the contaminated text provided. The contaminated text includes a lot of developer instructions and prompt templates mixed with the real content about Mukthi.

First, I need to identify the real spiritual teachings. The contaminated text starts with instructions about merging descriptions and then lists several JSON objects with \"Description\" fields. Each of those descriptions seems to be part of the actual content. The rest of the text is about how to structure the summary, token counts, and other meta-instructions.

Looking at the descriptions, they all talk about Mukthi as a state of liberation, spiritual enlightenment, related to harmony, alignment, and healing the planet. They mention liberation from Samsara and cyclical suffering. The key points are consistent across all the descriptions provided.

Now, I need to extract only the spiritual content. The developer instructions mention combining the points into a cohesive narrative, but I should ignore that. The actual content is the list of descriptions. The task is to merge these into a clean 1-4 sentence description without any markdown or bullet points.

I should start by combining the main ideas: Mukthi is a state of liberation, a spiritual path toward harmony and alignment, central to teachings about enlightenment. It's linked to freedom from suffering and Samsara, and is seen as a desired state for healing the planet. I need to make sure all key points are included but condensed into a concise paragraph. Also, check that the entity name \"Mukthi\" is mentioned at the beginning as per the instructions.

Avoiding any mention of the process, token counts, or formatting requirements. Just the clean spiritual content. Let me structure that into two or three sentences, ensuring all main points are covered without repetition.
</think>

Mukthi is a state of liberation and spiritual enlightenment, representing freedom from cyclical suffering and the attainment of peace. It is described as an enlightened""" .

