  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Sunil worked in Mumbai and faced unkindness there.\" That's correct. But the reason for going to Mumbai is his decision to quit school. The original output doesn't have a relationship between Sunil and his decision to quit school. However, the decision is part of the narrative but not an entity. So maybe no missed relationship here.<SEP>Mumbai is the city where Sunil worked and experienced emotional pain.<SEP>Mumbai is a city in India, home to Prachiti and Dhani.";
