  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a merged description for the entity \"Mystic\". The description list includes:

1. First description: \"Mystic is a spiritual guide who provides advice on connecting with universal intelligence and overcoming anxiety. Beyond this role, a mystic is described as someone who transcends conventional understanding, perceiving the unity that underlies existence and the nature of reality. Additionally, a mystic is said to transcend illusions of separation, understand birth and death cycles, and embody transcendent awareness.\"

2. Then multiple identical descriptions: \"A mystic transcends illusions of separation, understands birth/death cycles, and embodies transcendent awareness.\"

3. Then a second description: \"Mystic refers to the ability to access transcendental states, intuition, and universal intelligence beyond logic.\"

We need to integrate all key information. The summary must be in plain text, multiple paragraphs, objective third-person, mention the full name of the entity at the beginning. Also, conflict handling: if distinct entities/relations, but here it's the same entity. So we just summarize.

We must not exceed 600 tokens. We need to be concise but comprehensive.

We need to mention the entity name: \"Mystic\". Also, we can mention the role: spiritual guide, etc.

