Then the repeated descriptions: same as the second part: transcending illusions of separation, understanding birth/death cycles, embodying transcendent awareness.

Then the second description: ability to access transcendental states, intuition, and universal intelligence beyond logic.

We can combine: The first description expands on the role and the deeper aspects, while the subsequent descriptions reinforce the core aspects: transcending illusions of separation, understanding birth/death cycles, and embodying transcendent awareness.

