  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "A national forest where the project site is located, leading to a conflict with the Forest Department.<SEP>The national forest is a protected area where the project site is located, subject to strict forest laws.<SEP>The national forest is a protected area where the Ekam project site is located, leading to legal disputes over construction access.<SEP>The national forest where Ekam was built, located in the foothills of a mountain range with strict legal protections.";
