  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Governments are mentioned as one of the old systems breaking down, and are contrasted with the need for community-based solutions.<SEP>Nations globally grapple with discrimination and systemic issues, reflecting shared human challenges.<SEP>Nations are political entities that can experience economic decline due to external factors like virus infestations.<SEP>Nations are entities that can be involved in wars and can pray for peace.<SEP>Nations refer to political entities or communities of people, as mentioned in the context of global peace aspirations.";
