  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a merged description of the entity \"Native Americans\". The input list includes 8 JSON objects, but we only have two descriptions in the input: one says \"Native Americans are a group affected by America's karmic debt and historical oppression.\" and the other says \"Native Americans are cited as an ancient civilization practicing spiritual ceremonies.` - Correct.\"

