We need to ensure we don't omit any important facts. The first description mentions \"affected by America's karmic debt and historical oppression\". The second mentions \"ancient civilization practicing spiritual ceremonies\". Also note that the second description includes \" - Correct.\" which might be a note. We can ignore that or incorporate as a note that the description is considered correct.

