<urn:mukthiguru:Navratri> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Navratri";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Navratri is a Hindu religious festival, recognized as a significant religious festival in Hindu tradition. It is celebrated over nine nights (or nine days) and is dedicated to the worship of the Mother Goddess, embodying the divine feminine. The festival spans nine nights, during which devotees engage in Upasana, a ritual practice that honors the Goddess.

While Upasana is traditionally performed throughout the entire period, some traditions emphasize its observance during the first three days, reflecting a focus on initial rites of devotion. The festival symbolizes the journey of the seeker into consciousness, guided by the Goddess, and is considered a nine-day Hindu festival that marks the spiritual renewal of participants. Through its nine nights of worship, Navratri serves as a time for spiritual reflection, devotion, and the celebration of the divine feminine.<SEP>Navratri is a Hindu festival celebrating the Mother Goddess, symbolizing the journey of spiritual awakening and the dissolution of negative states like anger and greed.`<SEP>...` -> Correct.<SEP>Navratri is a nine-night celebration of the Mother Goddess and the feminine, also referred to as Dussehra.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=207izZBbqVg)<SEP>YouTube Video: 9-NMv5E-18s (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9-NMv5E-18s)<SEP>YouTube Video: WfkCDNu4SuE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WfkCDNu4SuE)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "event";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779519141"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-86fb5c9368dde9170c4844b23678c8ad<SEP>chunk-a348f3e70c609d0d7798352cd61a2781<SEP>chunk-35b63d2ee19735d06397a5b887beddb0<SEP>chunk-5a85e64decd4f2a6f6b8b1a83aae1399<SEP>chunk-5a811ca674072f39c34abb4651e492c5<SEP>chunk-c87bd389c5c5a0aa7ee00af0f32f42e6<SEP>chunk-8d66f25e14fdb745367662bcfd5df1bf<SEP>chunk-d51e7d7fdd9bf5d32d4f076f7cdbb5be<SEP>chunk-672a64891a721958057240b2cc83a897<SEP>chunk-adf8cda164a53953c2d871599de03c16" .

