  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Negative bias refers to the human brain's propensity to prioritize negative experiences and threats over positive ones, rooted in evolutionary survival mechanisms.<SEP>Negative bias refers to the human brain's propensity to prioritize negative experiences and threats over positive ones, rooted in evolutionary survival mechanisms.<SEP>Negative bias refers to the brain's tendency toward pessimistic interpretations, mitigated through awareness and observation.<SEP>Negative bias refers to the brain's tendency toward pessimistic interpretations, mitigated through awareness and observation.<SEP>Negative bias refers to the brain's tendency toward pessimism or stress, which can be mitigated through meditation and mindful communication.";
