  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a merged description of the entity \"Nexon Technologies\". The input is a JSON list of description objects, each with a \"Description\" field. However, the provided input is not a proper JSON list; it's a block of text that includes two description entries: one is a long description that includes many repeated statements and instructions, and the other is a short description: \"Nexon Technologies is a tech company that saw its stock decline by 7.8% after disappointing earnings.\"

