<urn:mukthiguru:O&O%20Academy> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "O&O Academy";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-8ee3e05777e56f75a0285ee42d5cac0e<SEP>chunk-a3cf87dcbdae759e4fd39a070ea3cde7<SEP>chunk-2d7f2293587016371499185adff2fbdb<SEP>chunk-7a11c33d05bfc14747b1fe7585c881fd<SEP>chunk-77c3eca51ec162d8f289b1a4c885ddf8<SEP>chunk-2db23a486228af8b1a7c18bb64b846bc<SEP>chunk-2be9c30d5eb8cae8ce6cd1e6425921bc<SEP>chunk-cf3bc78e02d58d61212dd4fe3b5c8715<SEP>chunk-2da89c2811049fcf9342c94e7de23b62<SEP>chunk-8a3ef14b4ae6173889d682a026ec55c0<SEP>chunk-8539e53b3407e35921fe5963280d3207<SEP>chunk-3d84d66881e27df882507ec43ab5fd29<SEP>chunk-50a3afd25409a52a572d62a449dbc4ec<SEP>chunk-d83a359a3b08bc2ee4dd9304ff1558fc<SEP>chunk-b11b8892f4c01791209e67f4d7241cea<SEP>chunk-3bc441c03c9cd5688b0f20314b1b1b3b<SEP>chunk-a8aa437c4036f2bcb15546966bd2e573<SEP>chunk-50804a0cd2fabf8122814121f088fb8d<SEP>chunk-68272ee7ebb0f34dcf88d287b8d9983d<SEP>chunk-3f7b8834c0b5fdd9d0b5f928c5733a2b<SEP>chunk-de229f52ef2b3b22ad5584576b9cb7c3<SEP>chunk-3a8bed92469d79105da75d0930238822<SEP>chunk-09d79ee40c176e3ec0ecf0d2471f0b89";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """O&O Academy is an institution co-founded by Krishnaji and Preethaji, formed through the merger of Oneness and One World Academy. It offers dynamic learning programs designed to help individuals achieve transformative states of joy and connection through consciousness, and it provides transformative consciousness training. The academy facilitates transformative processes that assist individuals in releasing stored memories and achieving positive change.  

O&O Academy also serves as a training ground where the doctor later works as a trainer, helping others live in a beautiful state. The organization was created by Preethaji, Krishnaji, and Sri Bhagavan/Amma, offering courses for consciousness transformation.  

The academy was also an educational institution where a couple intended to enroll but encountered conflict en route. The authors developed a curriculum at O&O Academy that integrates the Four Sacred Secrets, which is designed to support transformative processes.<SEP>O&O Academy is a philosophy and meditation school headquartered in India, offering courses to transform human consciousness and foster harmonious living.<SEP>O&O Academy is a philosophy and meditation school co-founded by Preethaji and Krishnaji, focused on transforming human consciousness through courses and events like the Field of Abundance.`<SEP>O&O Academy is a school focused on philosophy, meditation, and consciousness transformation, cofounded by Preethaji and Krishnaji.<SEP>O&O Academy is a philosophy and meditation school centered in India, providing ancient practices adapted for modern use.<SEP>O&O Academy is a properly capitalized entity referenced as a guided meditation platform.<SEP>O&O Academy is a philosophy and meditation school in India providing ancient practices adapted for modern needs.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "organization";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779414195"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: r_l2RNcSPPA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_l2RNcSPPA)" .

