  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "O&O Academy of philosophy and meditation school is an Indian institution providing meditation practices adapted for contemporary needs.<SEP>O&O Academy of Philosophy and Meditation School is an Indian institution focused on philosophy and meditation, providing practices for the Breathing Room platform.<SEP>Organization centered in India, referenced in the video as a source of practices.<SEP>O&O Academy of philosophy and meditation school is an Indian institution providing well-tested meditation practices centered in India.";
