<urn:mukthiguru:Obsession> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Obsession refers to an intense fixation on an ideal or role model, leading to loss of self and secondhand living.<SEP>Obsession denotes an excessive preoccupation with a particular interest or concern, potentially hindering other priorities.<SEP>Obsession refers to excessive focus on a partner's actions, leading to relational disconnection and emotional distance.<SEP>Obsession refers to excessive focus on a partner's actions, leading to relational disconnection and emotional distance.<SEP>Obsession is another concept that animals and plants lack, according to the original text.";
