<urn:mukthiguru:One%20Consciousness> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """One Consciousness is a philosophical concept that describes the ultimate realization of all life as a single, unified field of awareness and existence. It emphasizes unity, connection, and oneness beyond division or separation, presenting a state of unified awareness and interconnectedness. This perspective frames the entity as a profound state of being where all life is perceived as an integrated whole.

Additionally, One Consciousness is regarded as an ideal for leaders, highlighting its relevance in guiding leadership and fostering collective harmony. The concept thus serves both as a philosophical state and a practical principle for leadership, promoting unity and interconnectedness in both personal and societal contexts.<SEP>One Consciousness is portrayed as a constructive state of consciousness associated with oneness and positive impact.<SEP>One consciousness is the enlightened state of unity where all divisions dissolve, enabling harmony with oneself, others, and the planet.<SEP>One consciousness signifies a unified state of awareness leading to harmony in individuals and society.<SEP>One Consciousness is a state of Oneness that leads to beauty in family, society, and the world.<SEP>One Consciousness (or Oneness state) signifies unity and harmony, leading to beauty in individuals, families, societies, and the world.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-94684d3c1e91618d6299c39872dafbdf<SEP>chunk-d078b842a118a3665da45a82508e955c<SEP>chunk-62d9c2c61a7070c1d594767ed9814cde<SEP>chunk-7dca0f22171b9785fbbab01b79ee3fa3<SEP>chunk-1d104bf7b587259887bc9a25750b3a02<SEP>chunk-5750a413a72601ce81e6195a148e09ad<SEP>chunk-c4dd697e014967c1d2f280a84164c9e2";
