<urn:mukthiguru:Oneness%20Yoga%20Challenge> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """The Oneness Yoga Challenge is a spiritual program, challenge, practice, or event that is presented as a significant component in the journey toward enlightenment. It emphasizes the perfection of the body and energy channels, focusing on yoga practices to achieve enlightenment. The program is described as a spiritual practice aimed at perfecting the body and energy channels for enlightenment, with some references to a specific number of channels, such as 72,000, to achieve this goal.

The Oneness Yoga Challenge is also framed as a reason for perfecting bodily and energetic alignment, and it is mentioned in the original text as a specific program or event related to yoga and energy perfection. It is described as a spiritual program focused on achieving enlightenment by perfecting the body and energy channels, with some references to 72,000 channels.<SEP>The Oneness Yoga Challenge is a specific program or event aimed at achieving enlightenment.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-d0f73f6be38d246bcc320bc477e06c62<SEP>chunk-f30aeaccdf125f8eb8df6eca704db273<SEP>chunk-1c57270923c0b9f6969285d11c29b4d9<SEP>chunk-79078e355381ee5a4dccc266c751566a<SEP>chunk-1c981d2c6af3d27d3259ad2743465f9c<SEP>chunk-2cdf8ec9f94529bfc85d01fb0fbcd7b9<SEP>chunk-c8155d06192483203d070c3a6b141e8c<SEP>chunk-98b25b308c4bb7434621f489a95e2f07<SEP>chunk-8d7bf03b4b4565c628e7a6f285bed9c8<SEP>chunk-84d6d16d5c59a95373799db641f8719e";
