  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "\"Ones\" is considered as a possible correction for the typo \"ons,\" though deemed archaic or awkward in context.<SEP>The concept of correcting the typo \"ons\" to \"Ones\" in the sentence fragment, which is repeatedly discussed and debated in the video.<SEP>The proposed correction for the typo \"ons.\"<SEP>The proposed correction for the typo \"ons.\"<SEP>The concept of correcting the typo \"ons\" to \"Ones\" in the sentence fragment, which is repeatedly discussed and debated in the video.<SEP>\"Ones\" is proposed as a corrected version of \"ons,\" analyzed for grammatical and contextual appropriateness.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "YouTube Video: uZg9XnRub7w (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uZg9XnRub7w)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
