  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "\"Ones from our minds\" is a phrase under analysis for potential grammatical improvement or typo correction.<SEP>A conceptual phrase discussed in the video, referring to abstract ideas or creations originating from the mind.<SEP>The sentence fragment \"Ones from our minds\" discussed in the video, which is repeatedly analyzed and debated as a potential correction for the typo \"ons.\"<SEP>A sentence formed by correcting \"ons\" to \"Ones,\" though considered awkward.<SEP>A sentence formed by correcting \"ons\" to \"Ones,\" though considered awkward.<SEP>The sentence fragment \"Ones from our minds\" discussed in the video, which is repeatedly analyzed and debated as a potential correction for the typo \"ons.\"<SEP>Proposed sentence fragment \"Ones from our minds\" analyzed for grammatical and contextual appropriateness, repeatedly considered awkward in the discussion.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Ones from our minds" .

