<urn:mukthiguru:Order> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Order is a state of harmony that can be drawn into one's life based on one's state of consciousness. It manifests when the state of consciousness is calm and receptive to solutions, and it represents the opposite of chaos within the fundamental laws of consciousness. This state of harmony is not merely a passive condition; it signifies harmony and positive consequences that arise from beautiful states, fostering structured decisions and life balance.

When Order is present, it is characterized by structured, harmonious states within cyclical systems, encompassing both human and cosmic processes. Order can be communicated by one's state, leading to positive outcomes in life, and its presence in one aspect of life tends to spread automatically to other aspects, including wealth creation. Order symbolizes harmonious energy that is attracted to balanced, beautiful states, reinforcing the overall harmony and promoting beneficial results across various domains of life.<SEP>Order represents stability or structured energy influenced by one's state.<SEP>Order is a concept representing harmony or structure, drawn into business and work when in beautiful states.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Order";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-6dd6f0aed7fea431a27783bb1609b0ed<SEP>chunk-be5b7210ecbddf5ded747efb6c288c98<SEP>chunk-05f743c9b037a7017d2d7111bbe6ff3f<SEP>chunk-0c7f86b942d7f89bb8ff0cf5ae6c0035<SEP>chunk-7969e4168ecd055a3fbcda3d1911b288<SEP>chunk-dc66320ead9961b0ca8f9f6ef379767d<SEP>chunk-edee740a602e9fade69883d02224f2fa<SEP>chunk-3034c0dad09b57282220949046c9a771<SEP>chunk-f63f1b5d24ba94b5a3f6d30a788d8dd0<SEP>chunk-62aafe5d597e7b4e36bd88d98b8974d0";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
