<urn:mukthiguru:Organizations> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Organizations are groups that align team members and establish shared objectives. They experience cooperation fostered by spiritual vision and develop cooperative cultures when guided by spiritual vision, transcending superficial dynamics. Heartfelt connection is essential in organizational dynamics for fostering cooperation. Organizations are called upon to create wiser cultures that promote respect and reduce bias, and are urged to foster wiser cultures that reject color-based discrimination.

Organizations are listed among entities requiring health through individual transformation. They can nurture individuals by fostering judgment-free environments and connected conversations. Organizations are acknowledged to work on improving social conditions, though their efforts are deemed insufficient without inner-world changes.

Additionally, organizations can be involved in wars and can pray for peace.<SEP>Organizations are acknowledged to work on improving social conditions, though their efforts are deemed insufficient without inner-world changes.<SEP>Organizations include couples, families, institutions, movements, and destinations as systems requiring purpose-driven alignment.<SEP>Organizations are social structures or groups that operate at various levels, such as couples, families, institutions, movements, or destinations.<SEP>Organizations, particularly competitive ones, are environments where social alienation is frequently practiced as a response to stress.<SEP>Structured groups exhibiting heightened social alienation practices under competitive pressures.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "organization";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-e69d17b5a95c66d86550266e6f75a794<SEP>chunk-a0e255c0fa70cf89d2d5b637599c2750<SEP>chunk-dfd063e448fde077331ddbd4cc16008f<SEP>chunk-2acd70e04c811fbe48a08cf9d14bef96<SEP>chunk-982f35660cd8beb5ada701f1b74f7110<SEP>chunk-6a12fdf86752a3b47cf3eb0ac92a6887<SEP>chunk-06d9eb4b9e32d7ec0c21f0adab1c6240<SEP>chunk-1a7e64bb8a0d59d10204b5dfcccfe785<SEP>chunk-54304c335de80180a629fdfe3979a92e<SEP>chunk-8ae1e84c94c9daf68cd33af74bbc6fbf<SEP>chunk-25f394f47fe40575ea9fbcd110df6414<SEP>chunk-c0dc5060d878117d8549ed7941c43cb2<SEP>chunk-6f53ead9b7c14c9d4c207b785760c5a8<SEP>chunk-1939ef89c77285b5d61536082f605bb4<SEP>chunk-df19535ba38680d9457682cc02135690";
