<urn:mukthiguru:Original%20Sentence> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Original sentence discussed in the video: \"We are falling sick, our friends or relatives, the people we know, are falling sick.\" Contains a grammatical error with a comma after \"sick\".<SEP>The original sentence \"We are falling sick our friends or relatives the people we know are falling sick.\" is the subject of the discussion and editing process.<SEP>Original sentence: \"We are falling sick, our friends or relatives, the people we know, are falling sick.\"<SEP>\"ves the people we know are falling sick.\" A grammatically incorrect sentence being analyzed in the video.<SEP>The sentence \"Discrimination and separation *is* no matter how you show it,\" criticized for its ungrammatical structure but noted as a colloquialism.<SEP>The sentence \"Discrimination and separation *is* no matter how you show it,\" criticized for its ungrammatical structure but noted as a colloquialism.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
