  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Global epidemic mentioned in the text as part of the crisis context.<SEP>Pandemic is a worldwide health emergency caused by a new disease, leading to widespread disruption.<SEP>The pandemic is directly associated with the flat world concept.<SEP>A pandemic is a global health crisis that leaves lasting societal impacts, such as behavioral changes.<SEP>Pandemic refers to widespread disease outbreaks that have historically impacted human societies, often leaving lasting cultural and social marks.<SEP>A pandemic is a global health crisis that leaves lasting societal impacts, such as behavioral changes.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Pandemic";
