  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "An example of a vision (e.g., being a parent) that contrasts with spiritual vision's focus on consciousness state.<SEP>Parent represents an example of a vision (e.g., being a parent) that operates within the framework of spiritual vision.<SEP>Parents are called to consciously pass on states of connection and oneness to their children and grandchildren through stories and conversations.<SEP>Parent symbolizes familial love and nurturing, as listed among the manifestations of love in the text.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)";
