<urn:mukthiguru:Parents> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Parents are described as primary influencers who condition individuals to adopt comparative behaviors through early social interactions, fostering comparison via societal conditioning. This perspective highlights the role of parents in shaping comparative attitudes and behaviors from an early age, using societal norms and conditioning to influence how individuals perceive and compare themselves and others.

Additionally, Parents are referenced as transmitters of consciousness and state to their children, a process that impacts the child's karma. This view suggests that parents convey not only material or social conditions but also a form of consciousness or state that influences the child's karmic trajectory, indicating a deeper, spiritual dimension to parental influence.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Parents";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h9S9Hh4aBN8)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_X5jRvqxEEo)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)<SEP>YouTube Video: 3ITFXvYIPqg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3ITFXvYIPqg)<SEP>YouTube Video: nCkbv_lvFfg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nCkbv_lvFfg)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779667873"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-2b4fda69309d99ad3cadc792e81ed13a<SEP>chunk-3f368851bf5ddb2f8eff6b6b68ee073b<SEP>chunk-c0e08ca8392db0f9984988041685087e<SEP>chunk-5f6e567050111ca1e6e0891a182bd7b3<SEP>chunk-d97614999399e6f5f1181bdaebd85f12<SEP>chunk-0c9fc5b85e542ad2f803aa4b833a402e<SEP>chunk-aaa5c02ef780f417e1e3498aff83c60b<SEP>chunk-2a44f8cb9c9f8ea13650035b5bbd408c<SEP>chunk-5d0f74c4239eabf7a6fea87da28be5d8<SEP>chunk-3508c1cccdf21436532772d00c3c3463<SEP>chunk-4be5f58baaab4360b84499e4e9c8f89b<SEP>chunk-ec30e8bcff38a8016afa767698da187c<SEP>chunk-1f205cfd4f752f944e4f589c26e28701<SEP>chunk-1e483a5aae3e722cbcbaae7e0a2f3d19<SEP>chunk-70c4972427bbbb91625b1858ddbe811f<SEP>chunk-79200bb3b73a3f0e6cc0591fef7b2d08<SEP>chunk-3d3e1db7059b50ed67e675540955de81<SEP>chunk-287c3c0f3f95498058ee40d18602c6a5<SEP>chunk-23e9242ea59e5f560418d06d7bacd802<SEP>chunk-f11387cad436a638d2f57c99446730e6<SEP>chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13<SEP>chunk-15d5c49dad57bbf0bfa887044a164738<SEP>chunk-e346b8f3e13471227b92c08380bf14d1<SEP>chunk-4e900263f52a257effc9757bdfd34e24" .

