  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Passion";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Passion is an emotional state characterized by deep engagement with actions or states of being, serving as a driving force for meaningful impact and abundance. It is essential for successful relationships, involving intense emotions and desires that can shift with relational status or external circumstances. It is associated with a connected state and vision, often contrasting fear.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-9068ddb93a07ecf743249c1b3afe8709<SEP>chunk-1131fb555cf5cb5c110e8720fad1eacd<SEP>chunk-d97614999399e6f5f1181bdaebd85f12<SEP>chunk-5506ec1bf2947c78c3b169a20af36482<SEP>chunk-534aa5b1bce760dde6fcebe7d2a8da54<SEP>chunk-a0a737121c6d2b4ce7ac662967a310aa<SEP>chunk-e28a16af170670aaf61d68da07b71294<SEP>chunk-f911f447e8921c9205ec53996cfbe423<SEP>chunk-87ae4401ec344e0f145a40afa02041af<SEP>chunk-9d8a8416ae7a083477cbb7ac15043bbb" .

