  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The Peace Festival is a global event focused on fostering peace and unity through collective consciousness and scientific understanding.<SEP>Global event focused on promoting peace and consciousness, referenced in the context of a seventh-day celebration.<SEP>The Peace Festival is an event where the speaker is addressing the audience, mentioned as the seventh day.<SEP>The Peace Festival is an event where the speaker is honored to participate on its seventh day, described as auspicious.<SEP>Original incorrect phrase used in the TED talk transcript, later corrected to \"Limitless Field\".<SEP>An event or state associated with peace, mentioned in the original text and proposed corrections.<SEP>An event or state associated with peace, mentioned in the original text and proposed corrections." .

