<urn:mukthiguru:Peace%20in%20Your%20Eyes> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-701926e51028584695a89ba83fd7e78f<SEP>chunk-030392b491fddbfc0e19d2b0f73dcc1f<SEP>chunk-d26a33b7890276490920b92132c786db";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Peace in Your Eyes";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "event";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Peace in Your Eyes is a reconciliation event in Colombia organized by Shri Sri Preethaji, designed to bring together conflicting groups and foster healing and forgiveness. The event focuses on facilitating dialogue and mutual understanding among participants, with the aim of promoting inner peace and acceptance. It is also referenced as a phrase representing inner peace and acceptance, which is mentioned in the context of healing and transformation, highlighting its broader symbolic significance beyond the specific event.

The phrase “Peace in Your Eyes” is also used to denote a personal state of inner calm and acceptance, often invoked during periods of personal growth and transformation. Its usage in the context of healing underscores the connection between inner peace and the process of reconciliation, both at individual and collective levels.<SEP>A phrase representing inner peace and acceptance, mentioned in the context of healing and transformation.<SEP>Peace in Your Eyes is an event led by Sri Preethaji focused on healing and reconciliation.<SEP>A phrase representing inner peace and acceptance, mentioned in the context of healing and transformation.<SEP>Peace in Your Eyes is an event led by Sri Preethaji focused on healing and reconciliation.<SEP>A phrase representing inner peace and acceptance, mentioned in the context of healing and transformation.<SEP>Peace in Your Eyes is an event led by Sri Preethaji focused on healing and reconciliation.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779756051"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long> .

