  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Peculiar birds are a specific type of bird that migrates between Siberia and India.<SEP>Peculiar birds that migrate seasonally between Siberia and India, possessing knowledge of food sources and breeding grounds.<SEP>Peculiar birds that migrate seasonally between Siberia and India, possessing knowledge of food sources and breeding grounds.<SEP>Peculiar birds are mentioned as migratory creatures with instinctual seasonal movements between Siberia and India.<SEP>Peculiar birds that migrate seasonally from Siberia to India and back, demonstrating innate navigational knowledge.<SEP>Peculiar birds that migrate seasonally from Siberia to India and back, demonstrating innate navigational knowledge." .

