  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to parse the input. The input is a JSON list of descriptions. Each description is a JSON object with a \"Description\" field. The input includes many meta descriptions and some actual description strings. The entity name is \"People\". We must ignore meta descriptions and focus on the actual description strings.

