2. \"People collectively represent the general population and are capable of driving social change through awareness.\"
3. \"The general population, emphasizing collective responsibility in addressing harmful speech and actions.\"
4. \"People refers to individuals within a community or society.\"

We must synthesize these into a single comprehensive summary, in plain text, multiple paragraphs, without extra formatting, and within 600 tokens.

