Paragraph 2: Also, People collectively represent the general population and are capable of driving social change through awareness.

Paragraph 3: Moreover, People represent the general population, emphasizing collective responsibility in addressing harmful speech and actions.

Paragraph 4: People also refers to individuals within a community or society.

But we must integrate all key information. We can combine them.

