<urn:mukthiguru:Perfect%20Self> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The \"Perfect Self\" refers to an idealized version of oneself, with efforts to achieve it described as futile and tiresome.<SEP>The Perfect Self is an idealized image of oneself, formed through collective knowledge from ancestors, parents, teachers, friends, and societal opinions, characterized by emotional virtue, intellectual brilliance, physical attractiveness, and financial abundance.<SEP>The Perfect Self is an idealized image of oneself, characterized by emotional virtue, intellectual brilliance, physical attractiveness, and financial abundance, formed through collective knowledge from ancestors and society.<SEP>The Perfect Self is an idealized image shaped by societal messages about virtue, success, and attractiveness, often modeled after admired public figures.<SEP>The text discusses the concept of the Perfect Self.<SEP>The Perfect Self represents an idealized state of being, from which individuals deviate as they experience the Nobody State and despair.<SEP>An internalized, idealized version of success and self-worth shaped by societal and familial expectations, often leading to self-measurement and despair.`";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779187388"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-4254fba3cd08eeac830728e39c9bc049<SEP>chunk-3ab82e092d6b5c626c21e659e899eea6<SEP>chunk-e9621dc7d3757b01547188c8c828f956<SEP>chunk-f072f6c1aecbc4e4e511168e02ba440e<SEP>chunk-6bd5636c13f54dcbb4aa1a8db98334b5<SEP>chunk-d564739567a16e99326ecc627fbd4051";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Perfect Self" .

<urn:mukthiguru:Perfect%20Soul%20Mate> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-6bd1265c66d1065be54810dd4e52f30a<SEP>chunk-5b6ea8ea6a84c14eccce239691136bf1<SEP>chunk-1eb764bde7f7f1e1e97d8931c7b9875e";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "A perfect soul mate embodies an idealized partnership characterized by mutual growth and spiritual alignment.`<SEP>A perfect soul mate embodies an idealized partnership characterized by mutual growth and spiritual alignment.`<SEP>A state of being achieved through spiritual awakening, characterized by wholeness, joy, and connected consciousness.<SEP>An idealized partnership formed through spiritual alignment and conscious connection.<SEP>An idealized partnership formed through spiritual alignment and conscious connection.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Perfect Soul Mate";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779651326"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long> .

<urn:mukthiguru:Perfection> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-d97614999399e6f5f1181bdaebd85f12<SEP>chunk-c0dc5060d878117d8549ed7941c43cb2<SEP>chunk-9de34e6e869087957a9232040a7b6bbb<SEP>chunk-c6481baa2ca6ec863ed7690cee69e3d0<SEP>chunk-ae2f2a9e144a0416a2b1367a6eab9be2";
