  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779666428"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "YouTube Video: YkIBYppBtro (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YkIBYppBtro)<SEP>unknown_source";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Perfection is an ideal that requires relentless effort to practice in daily life.<SEP>Perfection is an unattainable ideal that leads to self-contradiction and struggle when pursued relentlessly.<SEP>Perfection is presented as an unattainable goal, leading to a struggle against pressure.<SEP>Perfection is critiqued as an unattainable ideal that perpetuates imperfection and struggle when pursued relentlessly.`" .

