  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a comprehensive summary of the entity \"Phrasing Error\". The input includes a long description and multiple short descriptions. The long description defines phrasing error, distinguishes from spelling/punctuation, mentions causes (ambiguous word choice, improper sentence structure, misuse of idioms), detection (coherence, clarity, flow, tools, human proofreaders), impact on translation (misinterpretation), research in computational linguistics. The short descriptions are all identical: \"Phrasing errors are linguistic mistakes in the original text.\"

We need to combine them, avoid redundancy, and produce a cohesive summary in multiple paragraphs, objective, third-person, mention the full name at the beginning. Also, we must not exceed 600 tokens.

