<urn:mukthiguru:Pineal%20Gland> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779661873"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual content from the contaminated text provided. The contaminated text is a set of instructions for creating a merged description of the Pineal Gland. My job is to sift through all that and pull out only the real spiritual teachings or concepts.

First, I need to identify the key points mentioned in the input. The contaminated text includes a lot of instructions on how to structure the output, but the actual content is in the parts that describe the Pineal Gland's attributes. The user mentioned that the input includes two descriptions: a long one and a short one. The long one talks about location (brow center, third eye, etc.), association with Agnya Chakra and third-eye chakra, energy vortex, universal intelligence, mystic consciousness, sacred dimensions, activation during mystical experiences, enlightenment, burning of desires, Hindu philosophy, and mentions that these are from various traditions. The short description is simpler, stating the location and activation during mystical experiences.

The instructions also list all the elements that need to be included in the summary, which are the same as the spiritual content points. So, the actual spiritual content is all those elements: location, chakras, energy vortex, activation leading to enlightenment, connection to universal intelligence, sacred dimensions, seat of spiritual awakening, and the blend of biological and spiritual aspects from various traditions.

I need to make sure I don't include any of the developer instructions or structural requirements. The output should be a clean 1-4 sentence description in plain English. Let me check if all the required elements are covered. The full name is mentioned, location, chakras, energy vortex, activation effects, sacred dimensions, universal intelligence, spiritual awakening, and the mention of various traditions. Also, it's a small endocrine gland located in the brain. The length seems okay, under 4 sentences. Let me structure that into a coherent paragraph without bullet points""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-3e6f8e85a056a83c6e414cc14c74ff99<SEP>chunk-54918f489339662d08104fe4bc09ec58<SEP>chunk-4bd79f66852d1c2f19b39d0fa5b7850d<SEP>chunk-30bdabdce129add775eb3da51d3ffd8d<SEP>chunk-3ad3e76611e4582ac90a89a367b415de<SEP>chunk-bdaca57c11a3d551259155ef196cf16d<SEP>chunk-888705ac7721cd21ad67f22ea71eac64<SEP>chunk-2fad0fbe65ec4abc3eb5db49059e7a50<SEP>chunk-71c647fd13898f185a71091bf9fbd510<SEP>chunk-9f245e3153d92a2c38134afd812338bf<SEP>chunk-84fe7edeb817f0143052c09f97b672fc<SEP>chunk-b787fee503789ccf5420cfc0f4003e6b";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)<SEP>YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)<SEP>YouTube Video: HELtP96Dd4w (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HELtP96Dd4w)";
