  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Preethaji, also known as Sri Preethaji, is a mystic and meditation creator, cofounder of O&O Academy, and a recognized figure in interdisciplinary events. She has delivered TEDx Talks that have garnered millions of views and leads events that blend science and spirituality, establishing her as a notable meditation and interdisciplinary leader. In addition to her work in guided meditation and video content, Preethaji is celebrated as a young advocate for peace and compassion, contributing to humanity and love at a young age. She is also recognized as a peace leader and champion for peace and humanity, with her contributions highlighted early in life.

Beyond her real-world activities, Preethaji is referenced in various contexts: she appears in a salutation, is addressed by Rajiv in reviewed content, and is mentioned alongside Pranam Krishnaji in spiritual discourse. She is also part of the source context in a YouTube video. In narrative contexts, Preethaji is portrayed as a character who experiences frustration and observes the dynamics among other characters, adding a literary dimension to her identity.

These multiple portrayals—ranging from a mystic, meditation creator, and peace leader to a character in a story—reflect the multifaceted nature of Preethaji across different domains and media. Note: Some descriptions refer to a real person, while others refer to a fictional character.<SEP>Preethaji is a misheard or alternative name for Sri Preethaji, potentially used in spiritual contexts.<SEP>Preethaji is a misheard or alternative name for Sri Preethaji, potentially used in spiritual contexts.<SEP>Preethaji is a misheard or alternative name for Sri Preethaji, potentially used in spiritual contexts.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Preethaji";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779736435"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long> .

