  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Prejudices are ingrained biases contributing to societal conflict and violence.<SEP>Prejudices are ingrained judgments or biases held by individuals, contributing to societal discrimination.<SEP>Prejudices are deeply ingrained judgments and biases that perpetuate discrimination and violence.<SEP>Prejudices are ingrained judgments and biases requiring recognition for societal progress." .

