  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779748666"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual teaching about the entity \"Present\" from the contaminated text. The contaminated text includes a lot of developer instructions and some example sentences.

First, I need to identify the real content. The first seven points are descriptions of \"Present\". The first one mentions acceptance with grace and ease. The second talks about ongoing experiences. The third adds existing state and temporal focus for manifestation. The rest (4-8) repeat the same idea about wise responses and awareness.

The main task is to combine these into a coherent summary. The key elements are: current moment, acceptance with grace, ongoing experiences, existing state, temporal focus for manifestation, and wise responses/awareness. The developer notes mention integrating all key info and handling conflicts, but there are no conflicts here.

I need to make sure the summary starts with the entity name, is in third-person, and is concise. The example starts with \"Present is the current moment...\" and includes all the key points. I should follow that structure, ensuring all elements are included without extra formatting or explanations. Also, check token count, but since the user didn't specify a strict limit here, just focus on the content.

So, the clean description should mention all the unique aspects from the first three points and the repeated ones. Avoid any developer instructions or notes. Just the spiritual content.
</think>

Present is the current moment, encompassing ongoing experiences and the existing state, emphasized as the temporal focus for manifestation. It is to be accepted with grace and ease, serving as the arena where wise responses and awareness arise.""" .

