  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a comprehensive, cohesive summary of the entity \"Present Moment\". The description list includes many points. We need to synthesize into multiple paragraphs, plain text, objective third-person, mention the full name at the beginning, within 600 tokens.

