<urn:mukthiguru:Pure%20Love> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Pure love is described as the origin of humanity, pure and all-encompassing.<SEP>Pure Love is described as a state of being from which separation occurred, and is associated with singularity, the zero point, and oneness.<SEP>Pure Love is described as the origin from which separation descends, associated with oneness.<SEP>Pure love is portrayed as the fundamental nature of existence, contrasted with human experiences of separation.";
