  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Plague-era quarantines institutionalized racial segregation...\" but the entity \"Hygiene Practices\" wasn't extracted. The input text says \"people refused to bathe, in fact, only once in a year or once in six months in Europe, somehow believing that water was the cause of plague.\" So \"Hygiene Practices\" should be an entity. The previous output didn't include it, so that's a missed entity." .

<urn:mukthiguru:Racial%20Violence> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779666397"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-a1ec36477897e4ff74fcbce70331c0fc<SEP>chunk-3ae96ad01fcb39bd7a75f6d45072f0d6<SEP>chunk-a466e41ebd2dd29a05776a329c8e9dec<SEP>chunk-638abb6fbdf727a0284e50fe14e82b1f<SEP>chunk-acb941e2e31d401b209b5294a9065fb1<SEP>chunk-18dfe327019b4987cc16243e45ad4a98<SEP>chunk-1939ef89c77285b5d61536082f605bb4<SEP>chunk-10bef6757e8808291f38e464343bf8be";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Racial Violence refers to acts of violence motivated by racial prejudice, representing a persistent social issue in America. It is rooted in historical and systemic factors, manifesting as repeated eruptions of hatred and anger that are often suppressed but recurring.

The concept has erupted multiple times throughout American history, indicating its recurring nature. Racial violence is a social conflict that America addresses through its ideals and values, reflecting ongoing efforts to confront the issue. It involves aggression or harm directed at individuals based on perceived differences in skin color or ethnicity, and includes acts of aggression or discrimination motivated by prejudice against a racial or ethnic group.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Racial Violence" .

