  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The Ramayana is an ancient Indian epic poem depicting the conflict between Rama and Ravana, with Ravana's actions leading to his downfall.<SEP>The Ramayana is an ancient Indian epic used as an example to illustrate the consequences of internal conflict.<SEP>The Ramayana is a classical Indian epic featuring the story of Ahalya's transformation and redemption.<SEP>The Ramayana is a classical Indian epic featuring the story of Ahalya's transformation and redemption.<SEP>The Ramayana is an ancient Indian epic that includes the story of Ahalya.";
