<urn:mukthiguru:Reality> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Constant comparison between the Perfect Self and reality leads to disappointment when ideals are unmet.<SEP>Reality is described as the state of a relationship after romance fades.<SEP>Reality encompasses the entire scope of existence, including all phenomena and experiences.<SEP>Reality encompasses the entire scope of existence, including all phenomena and experiences.<SEP>The actual state of existence, perceived without the mind's divisive nature in expanded consciousness.<SEP>The actual state of existence perceived neutrally in expanded consciousness.<SEP>Reality refers to the state of things as they exist, often contrasted with perception or imagination in the context of manifestation.";
