  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Scavenging describes actions motivated by scarcity, such as seeking love or wealth through lack rather than connection.<SEP>Scavenging is a survival-driven behavior where individuals seek love, wealth, or money due to a state of scarcity.<SEP>Scavenging refers to the act of seeking people, love, wealth, or money driven by a sense of lack, focusing on filling personal voids rather than broader world concerns.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779393003"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long> .

