  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Seasoned Meditator is a type of person for whom both guided and unguided methods work.<SEP>Experienced individual capable of handling both guided and unguided meditation practices.<SEP>Seasoned Meditators are experienced practitioners who can use both guided and unguided meditation, and both methods are fine for them.<SEP>Seasoned meditators can effectively engage in both guided and unguided meditation practices.<SEP>A seasoned meditator is an experienced practitioner who can navigate both guided and unguided meditation techniques effectively.<SEP>A seasoned meditator is experienced in meditation practices and considers both guided and unguided approaches suitable for their needs.";
