  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The Spiritual Journey leads the Student to realize his inner state fuels his professional struggles.<SEP>The process of recognizing one's true emotions and understanding the roots of gratitude.<SEP>Self-awareness is a concept involving conscious recognition of one's own thoughts and emotions, crucial for overcoming anger as highlighted in the text.<SEP>Self-awareness involves conscious understanding of one's thoughts and emotions, enabling mindful communication without blame.<SEP>Self-awareness is the capacity to perceive one's own blind spots, which is often easier to see in others than in oneself.";
