  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Self-Help Practices";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Self-help practices often involve analyzing external reasons for disturbances, differing from the sacred secret’s focus on inner self-awareness.<SEP>A category of methods focused on external explanations, distinguished from the \"sacred secret of inner truth.\"<SEP>Self-help practices are contrasted with inner truth, emphasizing external strategies rather than observing the mind's totality.";
