  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Self-sufficiency is a mask of independence that often conceals unresolved pain from past relationships.<SEP>Self-sufficiency is presented as a defensive facade masking deep-seated fears of emotional risk after heartbreak.<SEP>Self-sufficiency is a concept that is emphasized as a positive trait in relationships.<SEP>Self-sufficiency is a concept that is emphasized as important in relationships.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-aff6c19ce49adbdf7e2d1f8c08ebd1a9<SEP>chunk-322c357b48b096d2f7b5c99e2d2d2519<SEP>chunk-4fa62785a13cb6543b898c589a3bd605";
