  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Internal state leads to a dull sensory experience.<SEP>Sensory experience describes how individuals perceive the world through their senses, which can become dull in stagnant relationships.<SEP>Sensory experiences are all physical perceptions contributing to the enlightened state of bliss.<SEP>Sensory Experience refers to perceptions through the senses, which contribute to the experience of bliss in the enlightened state.<SEP>Sensory Experience involves paying attention to minute details of hearing and seeing, enhancing awareness.<SEP>Sensory experience involves heightened attention to minute details of hearing and intricate visual perception during the state of Ananda.";
