<urn:mukthiguru:Shanthi> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Shanthi";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: HtmLQkxj8ec (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HtmLQkxj8ec)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual content from the contaminated text provided. The contaminated text includes a lot of developer instructions and prompt templates mixed with the real content about \"Shanthi\". My job is to sift through all that and pull out only the spiritual teachings or definitions related to Shanthi.

First, I need to identify the key points in the contaminated text. The descriptions mention that Shanthi is a term chanted during the peace breath exercise, symbolizing tranquility. It's also associated with the World Peace Festival. Additionally, there's mention of Shanthi being a name possibly intended for \"Shawn\", used to replace \"Shawn\" for coherence, and possibly a person with mishearing corrections.

The developer instructions talk about synthesizing a list, handling conflicts, token counts, and formatting requirements. I need to ignore all of that. The real content is in the descriptions provided. The challenge is to combine the relevant parts without including any of the meta-instructions.

Looking at the example output the user provided, they included Shanthi as both a concept and a name, associated with the peace breath exercise, World Peace Festival, and the name replacement for Shawn. The example also mentions possible mishearing corrections. I need to make sure all these points are covered concisely in 1-4 sentences.

I should check if there are any duplicates in the descriptions. The first and fourth points are the same, so I can mention that once. The second and fifth are similar, so combine those. The third, sixth, seventh, and eighth points all relate to Shanthi being a name for Shawn, possibly a person with mishearing. Need to present that clearly.

Avoiding any bullet points or headers, just plain English. Also, ensure it's objective and third-person. Let me structure it as: Shanthi is a term/concept used in peace breath exercises for tranquility""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "person";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779443545"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-a693fb129ea0d439aa5af93825a4b3dc<SEP>chunk-7dd063bc1cf412c37b440d1dc5ebcf9b<SEP>chunk-b761644e632bad447dbbdffff1c12b62<SEP>chunk-dededd879a6495b8b3ec3f8c0e2e1ec9<SEP>chunk-41a69529bb31744f3a07ba326cfab626" .

