  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a comprehensive, cohesive summary of the entity Shiva, integrating all key information from each description. The output must be plain text, multiple paragraphs, no extra formatting. Must be objective, third-person, mention full name of entity at beginning. Must not exceed 600 tokens. Must be in English. Must retain proper nouns as original.

