- Shiva is a deity in Hinduism.
- Associated with cosmic principles, death, enlightenment, destruction, transformation, time, ego.
- Symbolized by poisonous cobra (snake), ashes, bull, hourglass, third eye.
- Depicted with wife Shakti, asuras, interacts with them.
