  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Singularity is a concept mentioned as the origin of humanity, synonymous with pure love and zero point.<SEP>Singularity is mentioned as a state of being from which separation occurred, and is associated with pure love, the zero point, and the zero point.<SEP>Singularity is characterized as the zero point, representing pure love and oneness before material existence.";
