  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Represents the limited mind, driven by anxiety and comparison.<SEP>The small bird embodies a chattering mind driven by anxiety and comparison, perpetually oscillating between past/future.\" But according to the instructions, relationships should be between two entities. The original output here has the source as Small Bird and target as \"anxiety, comparison,\" which are keywords, not entities. That's incorrect. The relationship should be between two entities, not between an entity and attributes. This is a formatting error.<SEP>...\" should instead be a relationship between Small Bird and another entity, or the attributes should be part of the entity's description, not a relationship.<SEP>...\" is invalid because \"anxiety, comparison\" are not entities. Similarly for the Big Bird relation.<SEP>The small bird symbolizes the limited mind characterized by anxiety, comparison";
