<urn:mukthiguru:Social%20Media> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Social Media";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: d0v8RE6i0GM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d0v8RE6i0GM)<SEP>YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779651435"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Social Media encompasses digital platforms such as Facebook and YouTube that have become digital spaces replacing in-person interactions, thereby exacerbating social alienation. These platforms also foster interpersonal alienation and create a dependency on digital entertainment, as users increasingly turn to online content for social and recreational needs.  

The usage of Social Media is frequent and often cited as a contributing factor to distraction and agitation. The constant connectivity and rapid flow of content fragment human interactions, leading to shortened attention spans. This environment of perpetual connectivity encourages rapid consumption of information, which can undermine sustained focus and deep engagement.  

Social Media is also recognized as a pervasive platform that fuels comparison. Users are constantly exposed to curated content that showcases idealized or \"better\" lives, prompting upward social comparison. This dynamic perpetuates a cycle of constant comparison, as the platform's design emphasizes visibility and performance, reinforcing feelings of inadequacy or envy.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-13c9585183fe0f71b4560d16c5cd2726<SEP>chunk-47ba35801c62795c3acbb6bf1357ab08<SEP>chunk-4c105f1c2d83f8107fb4042d9f1771a7<SEP>chunk-1b2894d7e044a8fc57ea102bdd508b16<SEP>chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13<SEP>chunk-0cd54f605ef5308b827b0b4e872697da" .

