  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Social media groups are online communities where discussions about reducing fuel consumption occur.<SEP>Social media groups are suggested as a corrected term replacing \"social media bodies\" for better clarity and context.<SEP>Groups associated with social media, previously referred to as \"bodies\".<SEP>Social media groups are platforms used to spread awareness about sustainability and one-Earth citizen initiatives.<SEP>Social media groups are online communities where discussions about sustainability and fuel reduction strategies occur.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept" .

