  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779734159"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "event";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The Soul Sync Meditation Challenge is an event that includes stages like Day Three, focusing on mind and breath.<SEP>The Soul Sync Meditation Challenge is a structured program with multiple stages focused on breath and mind awareness.<SEP>The Soul Sync Meditation Challenge is a seven-day program encouraging participants to practice meditation for five minutes daily, with each day focusing on mastering a stage of the Soul Sync technique.<SEP>The Soul Sync Meditation Challenge is a seven-day program encouraging participants to practice meditation for five minutes daily, with each day focusing on mastering a stage of the Soul Sync technique.";
