<urn:mukthiguru:Source> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Source";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779668083"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-7769be7ae0544b9b85386becf7e58bed<SEP>chunk-510c74de625674a35dffb4f0f8a8acb0<SEP>chunk-0ee45ed086ccf00bec8f02b0098563bd<SEP>chunk-609eba9953b128ee5842ae83faafcdb9<SEP>chunk-a84002ccf9bfe2d1ba87d2c2ea84b743<SEP>chunk-7a50476fe3717f3e56d4d65eb5669d3f<SEP>chunk-af881796b97d19f020179697b9daf675<SEP>chunk-dcbb7175c90efc697c5220666cba3363<SEP>chunk-977c3ae4342aedf46453743d441d540f<SEP>chunk-e22181d45ff680a216a2e1e3bb46c19d";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Source is a fundamental concept in the academy's teachings, referring to the origin of existence and consciousness. It is described as the origin of the universal intelligence, though not explicitly defined in the text. The source is also presented as the origin of humanity, synonymous with singularity and pure love. Additionally, it is characterized as a state of being from which separation occurred, associated with the zero point and the ultimate unity before descent into density. These attributes collectively portray Source as the primordial unity from which all subsequent reality emerges.

In a separate context, Source is identified as a YouTube video titled “k8iO5daXllM” that includes a provided URL. The video's content is described as a list of corrections. This representation of Source as a digital resource indicates that the term also refers to a specific online video that offers corrections, possibly related to the conceptual discussions above.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "content";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)<SEP>YouTube Video: k8iO5daXllM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k8iO5daXllM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)" .

