  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Distinct groups of organisms that exhibit non-verbal communication behaviors based on their state.<SEP>The collective category of living organisms, each facing challenges in life, including the Chhataka bird's quest for pure water.<SEP>Different species communicate non-verbally with each other.<SEP>Species refers to a group of organisms sharing common characteristics and capable of interbreeding.<SEP>Human beings as the only species engaging in intra-species harm based on superficial characteristics.";
