<urn:mukthiguru:Spiritual%20Awakening> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779748439"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Spiritual Awakening";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)<SEP>YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)<SEP>YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)<SEP>unknown_source";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Spiritual Awakening is a transformative state of consciousness and process that transcends mind‑created suffering, leading to lasting peace, self‑realization, and the halting of cyclical patterns. It can emerge after healing from depression, resulting in a state of consciousness untouched by sorrow, and is described as a journey toward higher consciousness and liberation from mind‑created suffering.

It is presented as a solution to conquer the mental infection of violence, emphasizing inner transformation, and as a conceptual framework where spiritual transformation and consciousness alignment are prerequisites for overcoming life's challenges and achieving harmony.

The state enables discovery of life's purpose and inner transformation, and the process involves discovering one's deeper life purpose through inner realization, fostering profound personal growth.<SEP>Spiritual awakening is described as the state enabling discovery of life's purpose and inner transformation.<SEP>Spiritual awakening is the process of discovering one's deeper life purpose through inner realization.<SEP>Spiritual awakening is described as the state enabling discovery of life's purpose and inner transformation.<SEP>Spiritual awakening is the process of discovering one's deeper life purpose through inner realization.<SEP>Spiritual awakening is described as the state enabling discovery of life's purpose and inner transformation.<SEP>Spiritual awakening is the process of discovering one's deeper life purpose through inner realization.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-1324fa0c36b3af6d5b8a9fbc0e3a438e<SEP>chunk-c41b1940fe688b602b0faf9703f688e0<SEP>chunk-e2996dd72088a1d41ccb0a4f9d7e122e<SEP>chunk-81310581d9c3ed56ae9e89492e24dc8b<SEP>chunk-c31c96b585957b3d969c1f44467db292<SEP>chunk-195432225c839e4aa9996bf06701d94e<SEP>chunk-e0a8c9ac09d21e5a96983fd54ff760fd<SEP>chunk-5b6ea8ea6a84c14eccce239691136bf1<SEP>chunk-53568a329a637c479df4fbddda1889db<SEP>chunk-d367f5c73fdfd0a5ceb6c32909b9ff6a" .

