<urn:mukthiguru:Spiritual%20Quest> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Spiritual quest is a journey toward transcending mind-created suffering and embracing higher consciousness.<SEP>Spiritual quest is framed as a journey involving concepts like awakening and consciousness, central to the text's philosophical discussion.<SEP>A journey toward self-discovery and transcendence beyond mind-created suffering, involving healing and spiritual awakening.<SEP>Spiritual Quest refers to a journey toward self-discovery and transcendence beyond mind-created suffering.";
