  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Sri Rama is Dasharatha's beloved son, who was sent away and led to Dasharatha's death from heartache.<SEP>Sri Rama is a divine figure in the Ramayana who redeemed Ahalya through compassion.<SEP>Sri Rama is a figure whose presence Dasharatha consciously perceived, deepening his inner conflict.<SEP>Sri Rama is a divine figure in the Ramayana who redeemed Ahalya through compassion.<SEP>Sri Rama is the figure whose compassion and touch transformed Ahalya.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779564418"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
