  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Sri Sri Krishnaji is a spiritual teacher who shares insights about human consciousness and states of mind.<SEP>Sri Sri Krishnaji is a guest on the Frankly Speaking show, co-creator of Ekam.<SEP>Sri Sri Krishnaji is a spiritual leader who participated in the Frankly Speaking show and discussed healing and connecting within.<SEP>Sri Sri Krishnaji is a co-founder of the Ékam movement, known for providing clarity and wisdom-based programs rooted in deep knowing rather than books.<SEP>Sri Sri Krishnaji is a spiritual leader and co-creator of the Breathing Room App, emphasizing love and connection.<SEP>Sri Sri Krishnaji is a spiritual leader and co-creator of Ekam, recognized for his teachings on divine energy and consciousness.`";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779174167"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
