<urn:mukthiguru:State%20of%20Consciousness> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "State of Consciousness";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """State of Consciousness is an individual's inner state that determines the signals sent to the universe, influencing outcomes such as chaos or order and shaping life experiences. It is also described as the means by which humans communicate with the universe.

The state of consciousness serves as the foundational aspect that provides stability and depth to one's willpower and drive, framing it as essential for sustaining these mental faculties. Additionally, a specific awakened state of consciousness is highlighted as necessary for wealth stability. The concept is further characterized as a heightened, harmonious mental condition that enables drive and willpower to thrive effectively.

This description appears twice in the source material.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-279428eb24ce3ae24c276976981916e9<SEP>chunk-be5b7210ecbddf5ded747efb6c288c98<SEP>chunk-9af6dcfed78cd2bcf20d318f9bbc704b<SEP>chunk-7f167e0e6ad11f51a72e88b506b459a9<SEP>chunk-53a1844f9e75d5bbffcc37eefcf95719<SEP>chunk-f911f447e8921c9205ec53996cfbe423<SEP>chunk-56da25e7d132b4ecea54c551b7809f75<SEP>chunk-e5d8a73bfe09b1e5fab115705dfa0fe7";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779653843"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gQiIwfA3mlk)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)<SEP>YouTube Video: 8p3zqYg5wuo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8p3zqYg5wuo)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU)" .

