  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The broken pieces (ambitions, hurts, conflicts) within the self cause stress and anxiety.<SEP>Build-up of stress and anxiety caused by internal conflicts, leading to negative behaviors.<SEP>Build-up of stress and anxiety caused by internal conflicts, leading to negative behaviors." .

<urn:mukthiguru:Stress%20and%20Pressure> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
