We must also mention that they are part of a broader range of negative mental and emotional experiences affecting individuals, workplaces, and society.

We must also mention that they are a significant factor in both personal and collective well-being.

We must also mention that they are contrasted with beautiful states, highlighting internal struggles despite external comforts.

