  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CZ_r5sYeTyY)<SEP>YouTube Video: qJxGtSDiayM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qJxGtSDiayM)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Students are individuals from diverse socioeconomic backgrounds who encounter challenges yet possess the potential to transcend suffering through the Beautiful State. Within the academy, students experience the true meaning of family via the cultural influence of the narrator and Krishnaji, and they are also mentored by Preethaji. These academy students receive architectural solutions online from “him” and his team, share transformative experiences akin to the man’s near‑death experience, and span a wide age range from twelve to eighty‑one, seeking personal transformation. Additionally, students of the authors have transformed their lives in various aspects, including relationships and careers. The academy, which the man connected with, serves as a hub for these students, integrating cultural, mentorship, and technological support.<SEP>Learners in a classroom setting who receive cultural and educational input.<SEP>Students are individuals who perform the Serene Mind Practice to assist others in overcoming inner disturbances.<SEP>Students are individuals who undertake a journey in consciousness and experience new opportunities and synchronicities.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Students";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "person";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "" .

