  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Suffering States of Consciousness";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Suffering states of consciousness include security, sorrow, loneliness, and lead to obsessive states of existential ennui, desperation, depression, hate, or despondency.<SEP>Suffering States of Consciousness are discussed as a barrier to greatness, where anger, shame, and stress are mistaken for motivating states.";
