  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "naturalobject";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The Sun is a celestial body revered in Hinduism, central to the practice of Surya Namaskar.<SEP>The Sun is the star at the center of the solar system, around which planets orbit in cyclical trajectories.<SEP>Sun is a natural element acknowledged in the gratitude practice for its role in food production.<SEP>The sun's position is referenced to determine the optimal time for eating.";
