  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Survival is one of the fundamental aspects of human existence, often viewed through a utilitarian lens.<SEP>Survival is presented as the motivating factor behind daily life activities in the statement.<SEP>Survival pertains to the basic necessity of sustaining life and meeting fundamental needs.<SEP>Survival is another factor in moral dilemmas, often conflicting with love.<SEP>Survival represents the struggle for basic needs in a resource-scarce environment with over a billion population.`<SEP>Survival is linked to the necessity of true friendships in historical human contexts.";
