  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The Swan is a natural object, a bird that was shot by Devadatta and later tended to by the Buddha.<SEP>The swan symbolizes...` -> The name is `Swan`. The type is `natural object`. The description is a full sentence. This is correct.<SEP>The swan symbolizes the object of Devadatta’s desire and the source of his conflict with the Buddha.` - Correct.";
