  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Synchronicities";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779728470"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual content about \"Synchronicities\" from the contaminated text provided. The text includes a lot of developer instructions and repetitive descriptions.

First, I need to identify the real spiritual teachings. The contaminated text mentions two JSON objects. The long description talks about meaningful coincidences aiding personal growth, linked to conscious wealth creation, Soul Sync, abundance consciousness, and Universal Intelligence. The short description is more generic, focusing on alignment with purpose.

The key points from the long description are: meaningful coincidences aiding personal growth, experienced by those in conscious wealth creation, observed by Soul Sync practitioners, related to abundance consciousness and Universal Intelligence. The short description adds that they emerge from living in alignment with purpose.

I need to combine these without repetition. The main entity is Synchronicities. The long description has extra details like Soul Sync and conscious wealth creation, while the short is more general. Since they refer to the same concept but with different emphases, I should integrate them. Mention Synchronicities as meaningful coincidences aiding personal growth, occurring in alignment with purpose or abundance consciousness, linked to Soul Sync and Universal Intelligence. Avoid repeating phrases and keep it concise, within 1-4 sentences. Make sure to remove all developer notes and just present the clean teaching.
</think>

Synchronicities are meaningful coincidences that aid personal growth, commonly experienced by individuals aligned with conscious wealth creation, abundance consciousness, or living in alignment with their purpose. These events are frequently observed by Soul Sync practitioners and are connected to Universal Intelligence. They manifest more frequently in lives harmonized with abundance principles and purpose-driven actions.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q4QyNologtw)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JYqlxlBZHc4)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0ypG1mlekNY)<SEP>YouTube Video: oXRZhJTHuOA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oXRZhJTHuOA)<SEP>YouTube Video: qJxGtSDiayM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qJxGtSDiayM)<SEP>YouTube Video: fiABnex9O6Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fiABnex9O6Y)<SEP>YouTube Video: Fn62UQTIMEk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fn62UQTIMEk)<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)<SEP>YouTube Video: YkIBYppBtro (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YkIBYppBtro)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yGLiryVQoQ)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uGosHULQQk0)" .

