  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "method";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Syrian Mind Meditation is a practice aimed at breaking anger-related mental patterns.<SEP>Syrian Mind Meditation is a practice aimed at breaking anger-related mental patterns.<SEP>Syrian mind meditation is a method taught to break anger circuits in the brain and achieve freedom from anger through self-awareness and reflection.<SEP>Syrian mind meditation is a practice aimed at breaking anger circuits in the brain and addressing emotional sorrow linked to past experiences.";
