  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "\"Tatwa Masih\" in the Prov` (This was cut off, but the intent is clear).<SEP>Tatwa Masih refers to an enlightened state of being characterized by the realization of ultimate reality and cosmic consciousness.<SEP>Phonetic mishearing of \"Tatvamasi\" in the transcript, referencing a philosophical concept.<SEP>Original misheard term later corrected to \"Tatvamasi.\"<SEP>Original misspelling of \"Tatvamasi\" in the text.";
