  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Text Correction is a method applied to correct transcriptions for the Mukthi Guru platform.<SEP>Text correction involves fixing transcription errors while preserving intended meaning, not original garbled content.<SEP>Text Correction involves fixing homophones, domain-specific terms, and punctuation in provided texts without altering original meaning or style.<SEP>Text correction involves fixing transcription errors without altering original meaning.<SEP>Text correction involves fixing transcription errors in spiritual content while preserving original meaning.<SEP>Process of fixing transcription errors in text without altering original meaning or style." .

