  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a merged description of \"The Device\". The input includes two JSON objects:

First: a long description that includes repeated statements about The Device being central, game-changing, revered by Taylor, etc.

Second: a short description: \"The Device is central to the story, with potential game-changing implications, and is revered by Taylor.\"

We need to synthesize into a single comprehensive summary, multiple paragraphs, objective third-person, mention the full name of the entity at the beginning. Also ensure we don't exceed 600 tokens. Also handle conflicts: there is no conflict, just repeated. So we can combine.

We need to output plain text, no extra formatting.

We need to be mindful of token count: 600 tokens is about 600 words. So we can be fairly thorough.

We need to include all key information: central element, potential game-changing implications, revered by Taylor, pivotal plot device, emotional and thematic weight, catalyst for change, repeated descriptions emphasize centrality and reverence, etc.

