<urn:mukthiguru:The%20Divine> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779254386"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "The Divine";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """The Divine is a spiritual concept representing the ultimate reality or ultimate truth, often associated with the presence of a higher power in all beings. It is also described as a spiritual entity referenced in the text, linked to blessings and spiritual practices, and appears as a repetitive phrase in the video serving as a spiritual affirmation.

Within the video's message, The Divine is portrayed as a central spiritual concept, tied to blessings, sacredness, and unity, and is invoked for blessings and togetherness. The Divine is a spiritual entity that blesses individuals to accept and celebrate sacredness, togetherness, and life, and is regarded as the source of blessings, thanked by the speaker. Additionally, The Divine is characterized as a spiritual entity representing higher power or divinity, central to blessings and unity in the text.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-3c249cf152a26fbb005f67817b9cc0e5<SEP>chunk-e3376cbf8644429a9850c44c882cd1fa<SEP>chunk-75c783fcdd09bf8a8394a04be5197385<SEP>chunk-ebaf44e9f9b7cf34eed85dc20005c2a0<SEP>chunk-62eeebe6c2fe0edb5198c7526c02ef79<SEP>chunk-b064115910fcd1227cf02905073a96e1<SEP>chunk-ad4544e5cec6ee250e4823e5b924afdf<SEP>chunk-22fbf22f17126e6b5377570cdb342627";
