  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The Serene Mind Practice is a method to move out of self-obsession into serenity, preventing limited states from becoming obsessive and fostering magical resolution of challenges.<SEP>A five-step practice for achieving clarity and managing emotions through focused observation and breathing exercises.<SEP>The Serene Mind Practice is a three-minute mindfulness method designed to help individuals step out of disturbed states and consciousness, with significant positive impacts on life and the world.<SEP>The Serene Mind Practice is a short but powerful method to help individuals step out of inner disturbance and consciousness disturbances, requiring only three minutes to practice with significant life impact.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CZ_r5sYeTyY)";
