  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "The universe is perceived as hostile in suffering states, amplifying feelings of isolation.<SEP>The universe is described as responding to heartfelt intentions, creating synchronicities and guiding toward a \"magnificent destiny.\"<SEP>The universe is metaphorically portrayed as a living entity embracing and healing the protagonist's wounded self during her meditation experience.<SEP>The universe is described as a unified, interconnected organism where all existence is interdependent.<SEP>The Universe is described as a living being that embraces and heals Maureen.<SEP>The universe is perceived by the man as no longer being his friend, contributing to his feelings of existential conflict.<SEP>The Universe is described as becoming a supportive friend when one opens themselves to deeper connection and awareness.";
