<urn:mukthiguru:Third%20Eye> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-468fc234a44cb0396e4202675d40e771<SEP>chunk-30bdabdce129add775eb3da51d3ffd8d<SEP>chunk-bdaca57c11a3d551259155ef196cf16d<SEP>chunk-355c42e8aaaf893df441489ff3a44b86<SEP>chunk-6a8eb45ded9794e4df68146dcf6df106<SEP>chunk-71c647fd13898f185a71091bf9fbd510<SEP>chunk-9f245e3153d92a2c38134afd812338bf<SEP>chunk-b787fee503789ccf5420cfc0f4003e6b";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)<SEP>YouTube Video: HELtP96Dd4w (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HELtP96Dd4w)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779661875"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Third Eye";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual teaching about the \"Third Eye\" from the contaminated text provided. The contaminated text includes a lot of developer instructions and some key points and conflicts.

First, I need to identify the real spiritual content. The key points mention that the third eye is a spiritual concept symbolizing mystical perception, transcendent perception beyond logic, intuition, and higher consciousness. It's associated with Eastern deities and higher awareness. The location is between the eyebrows, sometimes linked to the pineal gland and accessible through activation of the pineal gland or heart awareness. There are conflicts about the exact location (middle vs. region of eyebrows) and associations (pineal gland vs. heart awareness). 

I need to reconcile these. The main points are that it's a spiritual concept located between the eyebrows, linked to higher consciousness, intuition, and associated with Eastern traditions. The pineal gland and heart awareness are mentioned as methods of activation. The conflicts about location can be simplified to \"situated between the eyebrows\" as that's the most common description. The pineal gland and heart awareness can both be included as possible pathways. 

I should avoid mentioning the developer instructions, conflicts, or the process of reconciling. Just present the clean description. Let me structure this into 1-4 sentences. Make sure it's plain English, no bullet points, and starts with the entity name. Check for any remaining instructions or meta-text and remove them. Alright, that should cover it.
</think>

The Third Eye is a spiritual concept symbolizing mystical perception, transcendent awareness beyond logic, and higher consciousness. It is commonly associated with Eastern spiritual traditions and depicted as located between or in the region of the eyebrows. The concept is linked to the pineal gland and heart awareness as pathways for activation, though some descriptions emphasize its role as a metaphorical energy center rather than a physical organ.""" .

