Looking at the example paragraphs:

Paragraph 1: Introduces the concept, mentions higher reality, metaphysical framework, consistent across descriptions, guiding realm, influenced ancient civilizations.

Paragraph 2: Summarizes the concept, mentions guiding realm, philosophical compass, wisdom, direction.

So combining these into a concise description. The key elements are: higher non-material reality, guided ancient civilizations, metaphysical framework, source of wisdom and direction, beyond physical reality.

