<urn:mukthiguru:Trust> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Trust";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779414169"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Trust is a relational bond that involves the ability to rely on others emotionally and the willingness to be vulnerable. It is presented as foundational to experiencing love and essential for emotional connection, with its absence directly tied to emotional disconnection, pain, and conflict. Trust can be undermined by fear, past pain, and repeated heartbreak; when the wounded child is in control, the bond may close off, hindering emotional openness. The ability to rely on others emotionally becomes harder to maintain after repeated heartbreak, and trust is eroded by vulnerability and repeated disappointment. Trust is a critical component of relationships that, when compromised, can lead to isolation and disconnection. The breakdown of trust, especially when individuals share feelings, results in emotional consequences, further reinforcing the difficulty of maintaining trust in emotionally intimate contexts.<SEP>A relational dynamic characterized by reliance on another's integrity, which when violated, can lead to significant emotional distress.<SEP>Trust is a foundational element in partnerships and cooperation, often lacking in modern business environments due to short-term vision and fear-driven decision-making.<SEP>Trust relates to interpersonal challenges in maintaining eye contact and open communication.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-c0e08ca8392db0f9984988041685087e<SEP>chunk-aff6c19ce49adbdf7e2d1f8c08ebd1a9<SEP>chunk-322c357b48b096d2f7b5c99e2d2d2519<SEP>chunk-326ece98f6d256a814a626f5e89cbf94<SEP>chunk-bb8776e3af3003e2566aad28f28875b7<SEP>chunk-baa29517ede049854e2aecf133575342<SEP>chunk-f34fb6f27b6128e7888cfaefe712d84a<SEP>chunk-1049ffa49a880db4b5369cf84bcae432<SEP>chunk-4a6a915d04810354808f8de013c1de1f<SEP>chunk-10375887a7aa4a1c7205e37d5e7b18dc<SEP>chunk-455b122fda4addf20dfaf68404d297db<SEP>chunk-a8e26840aa3a5bf7f8632efb251d8ee5";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hwNlLB1sze0)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek)<SEP>YouTube Video: ZD1nQPtpojM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZD1nQPtpojM)<SEP>YouTube Video: r_l2RNcSPPA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_l2RNcSPPA)" .

