  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """{\"Description\": \"We need to produce a merged description of Ugadi, integrating all key information from each description. The descriptions are:\\\\n\\\\n1. \\\\\"Ugadi is a domain-specific term that was misheard and needs correction.\\\\\"\"
...<SEP>Ugadi is a festival celebrated as the first day of the lunar calendar of Chaitra Masa, symbolizing new beginnings and cyclical renewal.<SEP>Ugadi is the New Year's Day in the Hindu lunisolar calendar, marked by cultural and religious observances.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779519080"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
