  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Ugadi Pachadi, also known as Bevu Bella, is a traditional dish consumed during Ugadi in South India, symbolizing the six tastes of life through its bitter, sweet, sour, spicy, bland, and astringent flavors.";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-6a05be89bdb9093be2522608eb8c0a87" .

