  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Unawakened consciousness generates negative karmic actions and imbalances, leading to global problems like war, poverty, and environmental destruction.` -> Looks correct.<SEP>Unawakened consciousness generates negative karmic actions and imbalances, leading to global problems like war, poverty, and environmental destruction.`<SEP>State of human consciousness characterized by conflict, separation, and lack of awareness of universal interconnectedness.<SEP>A state of being that does not understand the interconnection of the universe and its communication.<SEP>A state of human awareness characterized by conflict, pain, and materialistic priorities." .

