  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a merged description of the entity \"Universal Intelligence\". The input is a list of JSON objects, each with a \"Description\" field. The output must be a plain text summary, multiple paragraphs, no extra formatting, within 600 tokens, objective, third-person, mention the full name at the beginning.

