  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """User is a Text Correction Expert for the Mukthi Guru platform. The platform, described as a spiritual service, provides text correction services, and the User is assigned to correct transcription errors in provided content.

The User is tasked with fixing transcription errors, applying corrections to the original text, and handling grammatical and stylistic considerations. In addition, the User may be involved in correcting transcripts of YouTube videos, ensuring that the transcript is accurate and stylistically appropriate.

Some descriptions also indicate that the User can be the requester seeking text correction services, which suggests a possible dual role or a scenario where the User both requests and performs corrections.<SEP>User is a Text Correction Expert tasked with identifying and correcting transcription errors in a corrupted placeholder string.<SEP>User is a Text Correction Expert tasked with identifying and correcting transcription errors in a corrupted placeholder string.""";
