  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual content from the contaminated text provided. The contaminated text includes a lot of developer instructions and prompt templates mixed with the real content about Vastu-Purusha Mandana.

First, I need to identify the key points. The descriptions mention that Vastu-Purusha Mandana is an ancient architectural framework governing A-Come's design through planetary energies. It's a mystical form representing the movement of nine planets, forming the structural basis of A-Come. There are duplicates of these points, so I need to consolidate them without repetition.

The entity is a concept and a form, built on planetary movement, with nine domes. A-Come embodies this. The output should be a clean 1-4 sentence description in plain English, starting with the entity name. I need to avoid any developer instructions or meta-text. Let me check the example response to ensure alignment.

The example response starts with \"Vastu-Purusha Mandana is an ancient architectural framework...\" and includes the key points: mystical form, nine planets, structural basis of A-Come, planetary energies, nine domes. It's concise, three sentences. I need to make sure I capture all essential elements without exceeding four sentences. Also, ensure that A-Come is mentioned as the entity that embodies the Mandana. Avoid any mention of the process or instructions, just the content. Let me structure it similarly.
</think>

Vastu-Purusha Mandana is an ancient architectural framework and mystical form representing the movement of nine planets. It governs the design of A-Come through planetary energies and forms its structural basis, embodied by nine domes. This concept integrates mystical principles with planetary motion to establish A-Come's foundation, symbolizing a harmonious balance between cosmic forces and built form.""";
