  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "{\"Description\": \"Krishna and Satyabhama engage in a war against Narakasura to liberate beings from his torture.\"}<SEP>War is a concept encompassing historical conflicts characterized by violence, loss of life, and societal disruption.<SEP>War is discussed as a complex moral and strategic concept, often framed as a necessary act of self-defense to protect innocent citizens and uphold duty (Dharma).<SEP>War and human activities contribute to planetary destruction and biodiversity loss.<SEP>A state of armed conflict between nations or groups, addressed through the video's message.";
