  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZGvKY4mPfIc)<SEP>YouTube Video: qJxGtSDiayM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qJxGtSDiayM)<SEP>YouTube Video: 7lggUuJtZXY (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7lggUuJtZXY)<SEP>YouTube Video: o6X1TVEFHAY (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o6X1TVEFHAY)<SEP>YouTube Video: owC8E_G2fY4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owC8E_G2fY4)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Entity Name: Wealth Creation

Description List:<SEP>The process of generating wealth through conscious alignment and expanded awareness.`<SEP>The process of generating wealth through conscious alignment and expanded awareness.`<SEP>Wealth creation is redefined as a process emerging from passion and creation dimensions, not struggle, with societal and personal impact.<SEP>Wealth creation is described as an effortless process driven by passion, innovation, and a desire to create positive impact in one's life, loved ones, society, and the world.<SEP>Wealth creation is described as effortless and driven by expansion, intuition, team creation, and innovation.<SEP>Wealth Creation is tied to Buddhi's role in nurturing prosperity.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Wealth Creation";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept" .

