<urn:mukthiguru:Wealth%20Creators> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Wealth Creators";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Wealth creators must shift from comparison-driven exploitation to cooperation-driven practices, inspired by forest ecosystems and family values.`<SEP>Wealth creators are individuals who depend on market, political, and environmental forces, requiring more than effort and capital for success.<SEP>Wealth creators are a group of individuals compared to farmers in India, illustrating their approach to wealth generation.<SEP>Wealth creators are individuals who operate from an enlightened state of consciousness to drive meaningful impact in business, relationships, and life.<SEP>Wealth creators are individuals who operate from an enlightened state of consciousness to drive meaningful impact in business, relationships, and life.<SEP>Wealth creators are individuals who live and function from an enlightened state of consciousness, contributing to a grand vision of societal transformation.";
