<urn:mukthiguru:Web%20of%20Life> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779661910"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: oXRZhJTHuOA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oXRZhJTHuOA)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: k0GsZxWhjSE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k0GsZxWhjSE)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """Web of Life is an interconnected system that encompasses all living and non-living elements on the planet, representing a holistic framework that connects all life on Earth. This concept emphasizes that actions in one part of the system affect the whole, illustrating the profound interdependence of all life. The web is shaped by human actions and states, as well as by actions emerging from deep connection, spiritual states, and abundance consciousness. Contributions from individuals, especially when performed from a state of abundance, can benefit the interconnected system, promoting collective well-being. The concept serves as a framework for understanding how the planet's living and non-living components are linked, and how human behavior and consciousness can either support or disrupt this network.

The interconnected system of all living beings and their relationships, influenced by conscious actions, is a core aspect of the Web of Life. Human behavior and consciousness play a pivotal role, with actions and states—whether ordinary or arising from deep connection, spiritual awareness, or abundance—affecting the broader existence. These contributions can either support the network or cause disruption, depending on the nature of the actions.

In practice, the Web of Life is also described as a metaphorical interconnected network of all beings through which light and energy flow. This metaphorical view highlights the dynamic flow of energy and the spiritual dimension of the system, reinforcing the idea that all beings are linked through energetic exchanges.

Overall, the Web of Life concept underscores the holistic nature of existence, where any action, regardless of its origin, influences the broader system. It provides a lens for understanding the intricate relationships among living and non-living elements, and the impact of human consciousness on the planet's interconnected network.<SEP>A metaphorical representation of interconnectedness between all beings, emphasized during the meditation.<SEP>The interconnected system of all living beings and their relationships.""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-2cfb508b00ca21845f924f5069b94f9b<SEP>chunk-9146e187edbee9cdbc50b048c433c6f9<SEP>chunk-3e00aec0d824214dc3b1bf504e305af0<SEP>chunk-8c7d4ae28dcb0e3eed4f5fc9c1814de9<SEP>chunk-cd538a6e8a311df1e5a60102db1f1b82<SEP>chunk-2bbc3803605e2adf00675f6eca362196<SEP>chunk-94684d3c1e91618d6299c39872dafbdf<SEP>chunk-43e5b5923e8d509b9e9edf60b61ff56b<SEP>chunk-4c6054ccc3bee7f9d86c600fc50b5dc7<SEP>chunk-8570f0aea49283824eb9980842a005e9";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Web of Life" .

