  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual teaching or concept definition from the contaminated text. The contaminated text includes a lot of developer instructions and role descriptions, but the real content is about \"Well-being.\"

