  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "Willpower alone is portrayed as insufficient to combat addiction, emphasizing its limitations in addressing deeper issues.<SEP>Willpower is noted as insufficient alone to combat addiction, highlighting its limitations.<SEP>Willpower is described as the ability to maintain focus and effort despite challenges.<SEP>Willpower is the mental strength needed to persevere through difficulties and maintain commitment.<SEP>The ability to persist in the face of challenges, dependent on a beautiful state of consciousness.<SEP>Willpower is the mental strength required to maintain decisions in the face of difficulties.<SEP>Willpower refers to the mental strength required to maintain decisions despite challenges and uncertainties." .

