<urn:mukthiguru:Wisdom> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ehkqJ54DIC0)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owXqW04b08o)<SEP>YouTube Video: Qu5IQo0ghbs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qu5IQo0ghbs)<SEP>YouTube Video: aqSM9LwqWgA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aqSM9LwqWgA)<SEP>YouTube Video: RFx74Q6Oq2c (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RFx74Q6Oq2c)";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779653363"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual content from the contaminated text provided. The contaminated text includes a lot of developer instructions and prompt templates mixed with the real content about \"Wisdom\". My job is to sift through all that and pull out only the spiritual teachings or definitions.

First, I need to identify the parts that are about the entity \"Wisdom\". The contaminated text starts with some instructions about producing a summary, then lists several JSON descriptions. The actual content is in the \"Description\" fields of those JSON objects. Let me look at each of those.

The first description mentions that Wisdom is a concept from the fragment “to bless you with wisdom” and relates to increased activity of Chitta, implying mental activity leads to wisdom. It also talks about Krishnaji's teachings during meditation being central to understanding Wisdom, with repeated mentions and experiential aspects.

The next several descriptions (2-6) all say the same thing: Wisdom is the teachings from Krishnaji in meditation. Then description 7 adds that Wisdom involves making judicious choices for growth and positive outcomes. Description 8 states Wisdom is critical for right decisions and a successful life.

So the key points are: Wisdom as a concept from the fragment, linked to Chitta's activity, Krishnaji's teachings in meditation, judicious choices, and importance in decision-making. The developer instructions and repetition of the same points (like multiple \"Same as 2\") are just noise and can be ignored. The task is to synthesize these into a clean, concise summary without any markdown, starting with the entity name and covering all the main points in 1-4 sentences.

I need to make sure not to include any of the instructions about token counts, paragraphs, or the structure they want. Just the content. Also, check that all the key elements are included: the fragment, Chitta, Krishnaji's teachings, meditation,""";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-168f7db76a78fdae540996d31ccc165d<SEP>chunk-b8d18accff7354006bbf1baf5cc50967<SEP>chunk-79727c38a2ca8d63adfca02ee83cd218<SEP>chunk-ab90f4a2ea15bf468182f88153f57ef6<SEP>chunk-fda55ecccb000507a303d6e1d174ab3e";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "Wisdom" .

