  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to synthesize a list of descriptions of the entity \"Woman\" into a single comprehensive summary. The input is a JSON list of objects, each with a \"Description\" field. The descriptions are repeated. We need to integrate all key information, be objective, third-person, mention the full name of the entity at the beginning, and keep within 600 tokens.

