  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a merged description for the entity \"YouTube Video: Unknown\". The input includes multiple descriptions (some generic, some specific). We need to integrate all key information, mention the full name at the beginning, be objective third-person, and keep within 600 tokens.

