  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> "enlightenment refers to a state of spiritual awareness or total cessation of ignorance, central to the discussion.<SEP>enlightenment is the lowercase version of the concept, as used in the proposed correction.<SEP>A spiritual state achieved through perfecting the body and energy channels.><SEP>enlightenment refers to a state of awakened consciousness beyond ordinary human perception, enabling profound transformation and freedom from mental limitations.<SEP>Enlightenment represents a state of liberation and peace, synonymous with Mukti, emphasizing harmony and collective tranquility.";
