<urn:mukthiguru:negative%20childhood%20impressions> a <neo4j://graph.schema#base>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#source_id> "chunk-61a8f6f1b34dfddc583a21c3b3271137";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#truncate> "";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#created_at> "1779755665"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long>;
  <neo4j://graph.schema#file_path> "unknown_source";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_type> "concept";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#entity_id> "negative childhood impressions";
  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to parse the input. The user gave a description list in JSON format. The description list is eight identical JSON objects, each with the same description: \"negative childhood impressions stored as samskaras that manifest as recurring mental and emotional tendencies.\"

But the user also gave a lot of instructions about how to synthesize. The user wants a summary of the entity \"negative childhood impressions\". The description list is eight identical JSON objects, each with the same description. So we need to synthesize a single comprehensive and cohesive summary.

We need to output the summary in plain text, multiple paragraphs, objective, third-person, mention the full name of the entity at the beginning, within 600 tokens, in English.

We need to ensure we do not omit any important facts. The description is: \"negative childhood impressions stored as samskaras that manifest as recurring mental and emotional tendencies.\"

We need to incorporate that they are stored as samskaras, which are latent mental imprints, and they manifest as recurring mental and emotional tendencies.

We need to mention the entity name at the beginning: \"Negative childhood impressions are ...\".

We need to be objective, third-person.

We need to be within 600 tokens.

We need to output plain text, no extra formatting.

We need to ensure we do not include any extraneous comments.

We need to output the summary.

Now, we need to decide on the structure.

We can have:

Paragraph 1: Define negative childhood impressions and mention they are stored as samskaras.

Paragraph 2: Explain how samskaras manifest as recurring mental and emotional tendencies.

Paragraph 3: Discuss the impact and possible ways to address them.

But we need to ensure we are within 600 tokens.

Now, we need to count tokens.

We can approximate.

Paragraph 1: about 50 words.

Paragraph 2: about 50 words.

Paragraph 3: about 50 words.

Total about 150 words, which is about 200 tokens.

Thus, it's well under.

Now, we need to ensure we mention the entity name at the beginning.

We can start with: \"Negative childhood impressions are deep-seated mental and emotional imprints stored as samskaras that manifest as recurring mental and emotional tendencies.\"

But that is a bit long. We can break it.

Alternatively, we can start with: \"Negative childhood impressions are deep-seated mental and emotional imprints that are stored as samskaras.\" Then we can continue.

But we need to mention the full name at the beginning.

