  <neo4j://graph.schema#description> """We need to produce a comprehensive, cohesive summary of the given entity \"unconscious mind\". The input is a list of JSON objects, each with a \"Description\" field. The descriptions are:

1. A long description that includes many details: archaic, massive layer, processes 11 million bits per second, governs deep impressions, influences behavior, operates as deep automatic system beneath conscious awareness, handles vast sensory and internal data, shapes perceptions, emotions, actions without explicit awareness, guides behavior, forms lasting impressions, affects decision-making and responses to environment.

2. A short description: \"the unconscious mind is the archaic, massive layer of the mind processing 11 million bits of information per second, governing deep impressions and influencing behavior.\"

We need to integrate all key information from every description. Since they are consistent, we can produce a single summary.

We must:
- Start with the full name of the entity: \"The unconscious mind is...\"
- Use objective, third-person perspective.
- Structure into multiple paragraphs (we can do two paragraphs: one about nature and processing, second about influence on behavior, perception, emotions, decision-making).
- Ensure we include all key points: archaic, massive, processes 11 million bits per second, governs deep impressions, influences behavior, operates as deep automatic system beneath conscious awareness, handles vast sensory and internal data, shapes perceptions, emotions, actions without explicit awareness, guides behavior, forms lasting impressions, affects decision-making and responses to environment.

We must not exceed 600 tokens. We'll aim for about 200-250 words.

We must not include any extraneous comments.

